<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Ntrubo Old Testament Project</book>
  <para style="h">Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="imt1">Siaman Nombia</para>
  <para style="ip">Nɔɔneŋ Tɔne kei yɛɛ nɔɔneŋse na kefanese ŋan doo Wurubuarɛ Nombia Tɔne keŋ man. Tɔne ŋmarasela kpookpoo karana nɔɔneŋ ŋan yaa ŋmarasena kefanese ŋan debaŋ dɔɔloŋ daale man. Be yilaa nɔɔneŋse na kefanese ŋan na Iseraetena na mo ŋa som, te ba moo ŋa kpu be Wurubuarɛ Nombia man.</para>
  <para style="ip">Be kpala alagyia kɛŋa akpeŋ akpeŋ man. Ŋaale yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ yele kalese na Wurubuarɛ kasom. Kefane sola Wurubuarɛ kekyɔ na ɔ kegyee na nyeekelɛɛ, kasola fa dukum kamokyɛɛ, Wurubuarɛ karaŋ kefa lee ɔ bɛrɛɛ dɔɔ, na kasola nyi Wurubuarɛ waa wɔŋ be kɔlara deŋele. Kefanese ŋan yɛɛ walaŋ dokoloŋ dokoloŋ na tɛɛle keŋ pou wui. Ŋaale na lese walaŋ wose man kagyoo wola te ŋaale mɔ ne kolosi lee keŋ ne hia Wurubuarɛ balaŋ pou na ba wose man kagyoo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu kolosiwɔ lee Nɔɔneŋse kɛŋa man. Baŋ bɔɔ ŋmarase Nɔɔkebakesee Wɔle kolosiwɔ lee Nɔɔneŋse kɛŋa wose man. Ka te kaa bese tɔne keŋ Kiristotena pou ne kale bɔ ɔsom man leenaŋ ka kewalaŋ keŋ.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ba te kpala Nɔɔneŋ sɔŋonyetooro na kufu kei akpeŋ anoŋ man nnɛ,</para>
  <para style="io2">Tɔne Gyaŋgbate 1-41</para>
  <para style="io2">Tɔne Alate 42-72</para>
  <para style="io2">Tɔne Atoorote 73-89</para>
  <para style="io2">Tɔne Anaarate 90-106</para>
  <para style="io2">Tɔne Anoŋte 107-150</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kenyaŋee gbagba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Walaŋ ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ɔ bɛɛ mo ɔ wose dona akpanyanyaŋtena ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:1">te ɔ bɛɛ tɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra gbɛɛneŋ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">te ɔ bɛɛ kyaa bomna baŋ bee kulu balaŋ ya nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo nombia na gyoo ɔ sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">te ɔ na gyoo ɔ mmaraase man nelim na ka weese.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Mena walaŋ ŋonaŋ wɔɛ ŋgba daŋ keŋ bɔɔ duu ke boo nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">te kɛɛ se bia ka debaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">te ke faareŋse bee kpiisi ya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">Kpene kamasɛ keŋ walaŋ ŋonaŋ ne yɛɛ na ne dee fa e.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Mɔna akpanyanyaŋtena dɔɔ be doo mena ya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">Baŋ yɛɛ ŋgba wura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">ŋan feliŋ ne gyɔɔ leki nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Mena dɔɔ akpanyanyaŋtena be gyae baa nyiŋ daseŋae nombia dedii keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">yaa nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ke kyaa baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ deyilae man ya.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo gyeŋ baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">mɔna akpanyanyaŋtena gbɛɛ na mo wɔ gyu yeŋ man bo.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gyoo ŋon Wurubuarɛ ba lese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Weera dɔɔ te tɛɛlese ne bake nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">te balaŋ ne bake nombia yakaa?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyooneŋ na koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">te baŋ bee di balaŋ dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">ne yɛɛ nɔɔ yilaa seŋ tia Degbeŋgyoo na balaŋ baŋ ɔ be tiu wɔ nuŋ nɛ nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />&lt;&lt;Ɛ yela dee tirii ba agbaraagbaraase ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">na dɔɔ som wɔ bela ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Ŋon ɔ kyaa ɔ gyooro gbeli dɔɔ Adido nɛ na boŋo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">Degbeŋgyoo ne kulu wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Ɔ ne kalena wɔ baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:5">te ɔ ne ŋmaase wɔ ɔ baŋ nedoŋ man nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />&lt;&lt;Me ta see me gyoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">Siyɔn, me bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Maa kolosi lee Degbeŋgyoo kawola keŋ wose man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:7">Ɔ yako maŋ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me bu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">gyɛŋ me ta bese n kya.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Bɔɔse maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">na maa yela tɛɛlese pou ka bese n dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">na tɛɛle ɔto ka bese n wui.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Nyaŋ ka mo nyeele bibiini gbutu tekerii wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:9">nyaŋ ke yɛlɛɛ wɔ bogobogo ŋgba saabu nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Mena dɔɔ, ɛmɛɛ gyooneŋ, ɛ sia dɛɛ kara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne di tɛɛle dɔɔ nɛ, ɛ see deŋele.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Ɛ mo keyee som Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">na ɛ ka mo wose keseree nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Ɛ buŋ ɔ bu ŋon, na mena ya na waa gyeŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">na ɛ gbɛɛneŋ ka mo ŋon gyu kewɔlɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">nawolo nyi waa tale gyeŋ baŋ karatetee dokoloŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne yeu kagyoo e nɛ ɛmɛɛna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide nɔɔneŋ debaŋ keŋ ɔ be yeu lee ɔ bu Abesalom gyaŋ nɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, me kɔlara boe nideli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">Balaŋ burum na koro seŋ tia maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Balaŋ burum ne yako nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:2">&lt;&lt;Wurubuarɛ be gyae waa lɛɛ e ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Mɔna nyaŋ, Degbeŋgyoo yɛna yoo nyeele pampasaŋ keŋ be kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">me gyoorobiiri na ŋon ɔ ne gyina ma nyee adido.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Me baake Degbeŋgyoo keŋkeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">te ɔ kpaa maŋ lee ɔ bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Me tisiwɔ doo te me doo dosoroŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">ma besewɔ foŋ nawolo nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:5">Degbeŋgyoo gyee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Mɔɔ gyae maa yee balaŋ kakpoŋ kakpoŋse baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">bɔɔ tɔ maŋ do yenaŋ kamasɛ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Degbeŋgyoo koro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">Me Wurubuarɛ, lɛɛ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">Lese me kɔlara lakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">na n ke tekerii akpanyanyaŋtena kela.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Nyeekelɛɛ lee Degbeŋgyoo gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">Yela nyaŋ nhira kekɔŋ n balaŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Balinɔɔ kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ ŋon n tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">me baake neŋ na kpa maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Lese maŋ lee me kaale man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">wii me waraŋase na n ke nyii ma kefane.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Ɛmɛɛ balaŋ kɛwɔ, kelii woromɔ yaa ɛ ke tina me gyoorobiiri keŋ kewɔlɛɛ yela?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Kelii woromɔ yaa ɛ ke tina nɔɔwoya ŋan be dana tɔnɔɔ ya, na akɛrɛɛ kedi yela?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Ɛ gyeŋ nyiaa, Degbeŋgyoo ta lese ɔ tobaale anokoarete ŋon see yenaŋ fa ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:3">me baake Degbeŋgyoo na ɔ ne nyii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Gyeŋ baŋ, mɔna naa yɛɛ dukum ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">n doo n dofoŋoŋ dɔɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">yɛɛ diiŋ na n ka gyoo n wose man.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Yɛɛ kedeesase ŋan tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">na n ka mo n wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, balaŋ burum ne bɔɔse nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Amɔte ne gyaela waa yela dee nyiŋ da wose?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">Gyuusu n sia na n ke wii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />N ta mo kenyaŋee do me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">kela debaŋ keŋ be weenɛɛ na ba soloŋ wɔle be gbigi wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Maa tisi doo, na maa doo dosoroŋ wosefɛɛreŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo nyaageŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">ne yelela mee doo wɔe kefɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, tei me nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">na n ke nyii me katoroŋ.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Me gyoo na me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">nyii me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">nawolo nyi nyaŋ te mɛɛ fane fa.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, nebo na, n ne nyii ma woya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">mɛɛ mo me nombia see n siaman nebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">mɛɛ daa n nɔɔketira.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Nawolo nyi n te yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ ŋon n ne gyae akpanyanyaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">n bɛɛ lɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra do n wose man ya.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Baŋ be dana agaŋtaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">be tale kaa seŋ n siaman ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">N ne kɔla nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra pou.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />N ne wɔlɛɛ akɛrɛɛtena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:6">Degbeŋgyoo, n ne kɔla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">baŋ bɛɛ koe te bɛɛ beo balaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Mɔna lee n balaŋ kegyae nideli dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">maa tale kɔŋ n dekpaŋalaŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:7">Maa mo obuo buŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">tee nyɔ ɔsom deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Degbeŋgyoo, mo maŋ ta n gbɛɛneŋ ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">Lee me kɔlara dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:8">yela n gbɛɛ kedoo teeŋ me siaman.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Ŋolo be tale mo ɔ wose lɔ be nɔɔwoya dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">nombia kumɛɛ te wulu be konɔɔse man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Be lokotɛɛ yɛɛ yebɔɔ keŋ be te wuu ke ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">bɛɛ mo be nɔɔse dii akɛrɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, bu wɔ fɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">Yela ba kebake ke busaana wɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Tu wɔ lee be nombiakumɛɛ burum dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">nawolo nyi be ta koro seŋ tia neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Mɔna yela ke yɛɛ baŋ pou bɔɔ yeu kaa gyoo neŋ nɛ gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">yela baa mo kenyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">gyee baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">na baŋ bɛɛ gyae n yele nɛ ke nyaŋee n man.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Ampaŋ, Degbeŋgyoo ne hiraa baŋ ba tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">n na mo n bɛrɛɛ wuu wɔ ŋgba yoo nyeele pampasaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ wosekekyaŋ man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa mo n baŋ kalana maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">yaa n ka mo n baŋ nedoŋ wɔŋ ma deŋele ya.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Degbeŋgyoo, wii me waraŋase, nawolo nyi mɛɛ gbaraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">Degbeŋgyoo, kyɔ maŋ kawee nawolo nyi me ŋɔɔ ne nyii weeleŋ.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Ma woo ne naa diyem nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">Kelii woromɔ, Degbeŋgyoo kelii woromɔ?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, besena na n ke lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">lee n kegyae keŋ kɔ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ, lɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Nawolo nyi ŋolo bɛɛ baake n yele woyadɛɛ ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">Amɔte na lesena n yele yebɔɔ man?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Me te mutii menɛɛ ta yee maŋ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 6:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:6">Nelim kamasɛ na me kewii ne fɔ ma dofoŋoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">me siasaraŋ te yele ma dedoi te fɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Kewii dɔɔ me sia bɛɛ naa nideli ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">me sia te yɛɛ fulaa lee me kɔlara pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Ɛmɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra pou ɛ ta lee me gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo te nyii me kewii.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Degbeŋgyoo te nyii me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">Degbeŋgyoo te lɛɛ ma kefane do.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Desɛŋ gyae ke kyaŋ me kɔlara pou na ba wose ke gbirisi wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">baa bese be wɔle na desɛŋ ke kyaŋ wɔ debokenaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, ma te yeu kaa gyoo neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">lɛɛ maŋ na n ka lese maŋ lee baŋ pou bee gegi maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Na mena ya na baa tirii maŋ ŋgba dinaate nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:2">na baa kyekpetee maŋ keŋ ŋolo be lɛɛ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, nyi akpaa ma te yɛɛ kei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">mo me nyiŋmaase yɛɛ kolo kum,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />yaa me ta mo dukum tɔ me dɔɔ ŋolo kom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:4">yaa me ta ŋere me kɔlare ŋolo do keŋ ɔ te yɛɛ maŋ kolo ya nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />kenaŋ na yela me kɔlare ke gegi maŋ kyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">yela waa sakatee ma nyeedoŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:5">na waa mo me sia tiu tɛɛle na maa doo akuŋkuŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, koro n baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">koro seŋ tia me kɔlara baŋ nedoŋ keŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">Me Wurubuarɛ wosi n wose, di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Yela tɛɛlese pou kaa yilaa kilisi neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:7">na n kaa kyaa n gyoorobiiri gbeli dɔɔ adido di gyoori be dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Degbeŋgyoo ne di balaŋ nombia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:8">Ao Degbeŋgyoo, di me nombia lee ma anokoare kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">na mena keŋ nombiikum be doo me man ya dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Yela akpanyanyaŋtena nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ kekɔŋ ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">na n ke yela walaŋ ŋon ɔ gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ ka seŋ ɔ nae dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">Nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon n tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">te n na gyoo walaŋ nyeempɔ na ɔ konɔɔ man kɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Wurubuarɛ Adidote yɛna me yoo nyeele pampasaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">ŋon ne lɛɛna baŋ be konɔɔse man dei nɛ nyee.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Wurubuarɛ ne di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">ɔ yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne bu fɔɔ wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Akpaa ŋolo te kyɛɛkee lee ɔ gbɛɛneŋ kumɛɛ man ya na, Wurubuarɛ waa sara ɔ yoosila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">waa buŋ na waa maa ɔ baŋdaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Ɔ te desina ɔ yoo abɔɔ kumɛɛ ŋan see,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">ɔ te desina baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋan ne ŋalakee nɛ see.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Kɛɛ, ɔ kamasɛ ŋon ɔ dana nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ fulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">ne kyaŋ kayeyɛɛ fulu na ɔ ta lola akɛrɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Walaŋ kamasɛ ŋon ɔ wula dowokom nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">ɔ ne yale gyoo bɔɔ keŋ ɔ be wulu nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Nombiakumɛɛ ŋan bɛɛ yɛɛ nɛ, na bese bo kɔŋ baŋ gbagba dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">be nombia akaraŋkaraŋ na bese bo seele baŋ gbagba.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Maa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ nawolo nyi ɔ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Degbeŋgyoo Adidote ŋon yele.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">Wurubuarɛ gyoorobiiri na deniwalaŋ obuo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, daa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">n yele te lɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 8:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:1">N ta mo n gyoorobiiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">wuu adido pou.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Bia na kyokyoose ne kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">n te tɔ n kɔlara pou gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">na ke yela n kɔlara na baŋ bɛɛ mo dukum tɔ kom nɛ ke yɛɛ yididi.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Akpaa me kɛɛ nya adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">tomse ŋan n ba mo n nyimbia yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:3">gyaalaŋ na kyolobiise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">baŋ n ba mo wɔ see ba akyaese man nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />na deniwalaŋ yɛna amɔte ŋon n na gyueŋ ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">te ɔ nombia ne hia neŋ?<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />N ke yɛɛ wɔ nɛ kaa wɔ kyomii bo na baa yɛɛ ŋgba Wurubuarɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">te n moo gyoorobiiri na obuo wuu wɔ ŋgba gyooro kotɔtɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />N yelaa be dii abɔɔ ŋan pou n be yɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:6">te n moo kpene kamase do be nawɔɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />Namense na nunkyuese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:7">na ŋale man wonembia,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />na gyebuse baŋ bee furufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">na ɛpo man kpebia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">na baŋ pou be dɔŋ ɛpo man doo be tɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, daa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">n yele te lɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Karaŋ kefa Wurubuarɛ nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, maa fa neŋ karaŋ lee me konɔɔ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">Maa yako gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan pou n be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Gyae ke yɛɛ maŋ gyoŋ na maa nyaŋee lee n yele man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:2">Ao Degbeŋgyoo Adidote, maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Me kɔlara ta bese be wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">ba leewɔ yala te ba yekeewɔ n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Nawolo nyi n ta lese me nombia ŋan doona ke gbɛɛ nɛ wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">n kyaawɔ n gyoorogbeli dɔɔ di nombia katenee man.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />N te kalena tɛɛlese te n wɔlɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">n ta feefo ba yela kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Me kɔlara te munu kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">be donɔɔse dinaana pou te wɔlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">ŋolo bɛɛ tɔɔse wɔ bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">ɔ ta see ɔ gyoorogbeli waa di nombia.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Ɔ ne di tɛɛle kei dɔɔ katenee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">ɔ ne di balaŋ nombia kyɛɛkyɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna baŋ bɛɛ ŋere wɔ do nɛ keyeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">ŋon yɛna baŋ ba wose be kyaŋ wɔ nɛ keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Baŋ ba gyeŋ n yele nɛ na mo ba wose lɔ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, n te bɛɛta baŋ bɛɛ kɛo neŋ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Degbeŋgyoo ŋon ɔ ne di gyoori Siyɔn nɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">ɛ yako tɛɛlese abɔɔ ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Ɔ ne wɔŋ baŋ bɛɛ koe balaŋ nɛ deŋele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">te ɔ bee wolee baŋ bɛɛ naase wɔ diyem nɛ kewii baake ya.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">kɛɛ mena keŋ me kɔlara ne naase maŋ diyem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:13">lese maŋ lee yeŋ anaanɔɔse man,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />na maa nyiŋ kolosi lee n yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">Siyɔn alebu ŋon anaanɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">na maa nyaŋee lee n nyeekelɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Tɛɛlese te yale gyoo bɔɔ keŋ bɔɔ wulu nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">te be nawɔɔ ka gyoowɔ kɔta keŋ baŋ gbagba be nyɔɔ weese nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Degbeŋgyoo ta lese ɔ wose wola lee ɔ nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">te balaŋ kumɛɛ nyiŋmaa man tomse besenaa kɔta kyaŋ baŋ gbagba.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Balaŋ kumɛɛ baa tisi gyu woyadɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">tɛɛlese baŋ pou bɔɔ wolee Wurubuarɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Mɔna Wurubuarɛ be gyae waa wolee ayematena korakora ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">baŋ bɛɛ naase wɔ diyem nɛ lookegyakaa be gyae ke yɛɛ yakaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo koro, naa yele denibalaŋ ke yoodi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">yela baa di tɛɛlese nombia n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, yela gyakoloŋ ka gyoo wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">yela tɛɛlese ka gyeŋ nyi, be yɛɛ denibalaŋ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, weera n seŋɛɛ lemlem mena?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Weera n moo n wose weese daa da wose kekyaŋ man?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Agaŋtaŋtena ne yele ayematena wose ne kyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">na ba te yale gyoo kɔtase ŋan bɔɔ nyɔɔ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛre ne gate ɔ wose lee kpene keŋ ɔ konɔɔ ne gyae nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">ŋon ɔ sia ne yɛɛ balaŋ abɔɔ nɛ ne falaa Degbeŋgyoo na ɔ te bɛɛ e.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Akpanyanyaŋtena ne gate ba wose te bɔɔ ne kɛo Wurubuarɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">ɔ nyeempɔ pou yɛna, Wurubuarɛ ŋolo be kyaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Kpene kamasɛ ne dee fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">ɔ te bɛɛ nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">ɔ bɛɛ kala ɔ kɔlara pou do kolo man ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Ɔ ne yako ɔ konɔɔ man nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Kolo be tale tɛɛse maŋ ya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">Ɔ ne kaŋ ntam nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ŋolo be tale yɛɛ maŋ kolo kum ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Kefaala na akɛrɛɛ na balaŋ kaŋeredo te wulu ɔ nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">abɔɔ kewɔlɛɛ na mmusuo nombia doo ɔ laakem ateta.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Ɔ na yoo benaana akuraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">ɔ na yoo koe balaŋ baŋ be nombia dei nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:8">ɔ na yoo deke balaŋ baŋ bɔɔ tale lɛɛ ba wose ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Ɔ na yoo deke ŋgba dinaate nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:9">Ɔ na deke nyi waa kyaŋ ŋon ɔ be tale lɛɛ ɔ wose ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">ɔ ne kyaŋ ŋon ɔ be yɔkɔse ɔ kɔta man na ɔ te wɔŋee e laŋ.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Ɔ ne gyɔ ŋon ɔ be yɔkɔse nɛ lɔ tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">na ɔ ta mo ɔ doŋ ŋere e.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Ɔ ne yako ɔ konɔɔ man nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Wurubuarɛ te wolee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">ɔ te wuu ɔ sia, mena dɔɔ ɔ be naa korakora ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, koro, Ao Wurubuarɛ, gyina n nyiŋmaa adido.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Naa wolee baŋ bɔɔ yɔkɔse nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Weera dɔɔ te Akpanyanyaŋtena bɛɛ mo Wurubuarɛ yɛɛ kolo ya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">Weera ɔ ne yako ɔ konɔɔ man nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">&lt;&lt;Ɔ be gyae waa wɔŋ ma deŋele ya&gt;&gt;?<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Mɔna n sia gyakaa baŋ bɛɛ naa diyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">na baŋ ba wose be kyaŋ wɔ nɛ dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Baŋ bɔɔ dana ŋolo ya nɛ ta mo ba wose lɔ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">nyaŋ ne kyɔɔna yoyolobia.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Tekeri Akpanyanyaŋte ŋon baam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">wɔŋ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛre deŋele lee ɔ nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">kelii debaŋ keŋ waa tina nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ yela.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna gyoo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">tɛɛlese baa wɔlɛɛ ɔ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, nyii baŋ ba woɛ nɛ kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">n na do wɔ kakyeŋ te n ne nyii be kewii.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Di lɛɛ yoyolobia na baŋ bɛɛ ŋere wɔ do nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">na deniwalaŋ ba tekaa nyiŋ ŋmaase ŋolo bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Wose kamo lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Ma te yeu kagyoo Degbeŋgyoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">Sena te nyaŋ ke tale yako maŋ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">&lt;&lt;Furufu ŋgba gyebu nɛ gyu n bulase dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />nawolo nyi kɛɛ, balaŋ kumɛɛ te wɔŋ be baŋdaŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">be ta mo be baŋdaŋ nyeela do ŋa ŋmeeseŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:2">baa tɔ balaŋ baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ detiŋtɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Akpaa be wɔlɛɛ mokɔɔ kaseese ŋan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">woŋ te ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ waa tale yɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Degbeŋgyoo kyaa wɔ ɔsom deni dinaa fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">Degbeŋgyoo kyaa ɔ gyoorogbeli dɔɔ adido,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">ɔ na gyene walaŋ kamasɛ tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ɔ sia gyakaa be dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Degbeŋgyoo na gyene baŋ ba tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">mɔna ɔ ne kɔla akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">baŋ bɛɛ gyae nombia akaraŋkaraŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Waa yela boalaŋ na nyewalaŋ na kpatakpela ka lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">kaa yala akpanyanyaŋtena dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">na waa mo feliŋ keŋ ke laŋɛɛ nɛ wɔŋ ba deŋele.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">ɔ ne gyae nombia kedi na kegbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ baa naa ɔ siagbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Degbeŋgyoo kyɔ daa, nawolo nyi ŋolo bee di anokoare bela ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">anokoaretena te taŋ denibalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Walaŋ kamasɛ ne di dekara bo fa ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">be yɛɛ nɔɔman yeliŋ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">te be dana nɔɔse ala ala.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Degbeŋgyoo waa do nɔɔman yeliŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">na laakemse ŋan ne kolosi agaŋtaŋ man nɛ dokɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />Baŋ bɛɛ yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">&lt;&lt;De laakemse gyae ke yela dee nyiŋ keŋ dɛɛ gyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">daa gbagba de nɔɔsebia gyae ke lɛɛ daa, amɔte yɛna de gbeŋgyoo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Degbeŋgyoo kpa nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Lee keŋ bɔɔ ŋere ayematena do, te baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya nɛ na toroŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">nɛnɛɛ maa koro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">&lt;Maa lɛɛ wɔ lee baŋ bɛɛ ŋere wɔ do nɛ nyiŋmaa man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Degbeŋgyoo keyakosee yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">ŋgba kɔba wolom keŋ bɔɔ yalakee ke bodobodo kosɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">yaa kɔba yayam keŋ bɔɔ kyalase ke betabo nyetooro nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ ne gyaela n ke yela ayematena ke kyaa wose kefɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">na n ke gyee daa lee akpanyanyaŋtena,<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />baŋ be dɔŋ yenaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:8">debaŋ keŋ nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ gyakaa na boo denibalaŋ man bo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, kelii woromɔ? Nyaŋ ke wolee maŋ kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Kelii woromɔ yaa nyaŋ ka mo n sia weese maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Kelii woromɔ yaa maa nyii weeleŋ me konɔɔ man?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Kaboena nyi maa di waraŋsa wee na wee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Kelii woromɔ yaa me kɔlare waa di me dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, kɛɛ maŋ na n ke tiranɔɔ fa maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">Yela me sia keŋmaŋee maŋ, na mena ya na maa yeŋ dosoroŋ man,<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />na me kɔlare ke yako nyi, &lt;&lt;Me te di ɔ dɔɔ,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">na me kɔlara ke nyaŋee nyi ma te yale.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Mɔna me sia gyakaa n kegyae keŋ be taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">mɛɛ nyaŋee me konɔɔ man lee n nyeekelɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">nawolo nyi ɔ te yɛɛ deeli fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Walaŋ akpanyanyaŋ keyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Diyiŋte ne yako ɔ konɔɔ man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">&lt;&lt;Wurubuarɛ be kyaa ya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Bɛɛ yɛɛ detiŋtɛɛ man abɔɔ na abɔɔ anekɔlaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">ŋolo be kyaa keŋ ɔ ne yɛɛ nombia kpaakpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Degbeŋgyoo kyaa adido ɔ ne kɛɛ denibalaŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">nyi ŋolo kyaa keŋ ɔ ne nyi nombia man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">yaa ɔ ne kɛo Wurubuarɛ gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Be popou ta yo gbɛɛ, be popou te wɔlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">ŋolo be kyaa keŋ ɔ ne yɛɛ kolo kpaakpaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">dokoloŋ kooŋ gba be kyaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Mena nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra kɛwɔ pou ba gyeŋ nyi kolo kyaa yee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">Bɛɛ tao me balaŋ ŋgba bee di weenɛɛ bo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">te bɔɔ na som Degbeŋgyoo ya.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Mɔna gyakoloŋ gyae ka gyoo wɔ nideli botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ kpuɛna baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ duuluŋ man balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Ɛmɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra, ne wɔlɛɛ kpene keŋ diyemte be bake nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo yɛna ba keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Ao, nafɔ nyeekelɛɛ gyae ka lee Siyɔn kɔŋ fa Iseraetena!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">Akpaa Degbeŋgyoo da besena ɔ balaŋ see ba beneŋ man na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">Yakɔbe waa nyaŋee, na ke yɛɛ Iserae gyoŋ!<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Keŋ Wurubuarɛ ne gyae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, amɔte kaboela nyi waa gyoo n kanyaŋ deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">Amɔte ne gyaela waa kyaa n bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Walaŋ ŋon nombiikum be doo ɔ keta man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">te ɔ ne yɛɛ abɔɔ ŋan tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">te ɔ ne kolosi anokoare lee ɔ konɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />Ɔ bɛɛ mo ɔ laakem wɔlɛɛ balaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ɔ bɛɛ yɛɛ ɔ dɔɔ dukum ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">te ɔ bee kolosi nombiikum lee balaŋ wose man ya.<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />Ɔ bɛɛ mo ohuhoo nombia yɛɛ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">mɔna ɔ na mo obuo fa baŋ bee yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">ɔ kaŋ ntam te ke da mo kaale kɔna e koraŋ na ɔ ne di ke dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">keŋ ɔ bɛɛ kyɛɛkee ɔ nyeempɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />Ɔ ne pakee ayematena kɔba keŋ ɔ bɛɛ gyakaa loŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">ɔ bɛɛ yoo lɛɛ kolo seŋ tia walaŋ ŋon ɔ nombia dei nɛ ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Walaŋ kamasɛ ŋon ɔ ne yɛɛ abɔɔ kɛŋa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">kolo be tale wosi e ya.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Wose kamo lɔ Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ, yela maa kyaa wose kefɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">nawolo nyi nyaŋ te me yeuwɔ kaa gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Me yako Degbeŋgyoo nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me Gbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">mɔɔ dana kolo kpaakpaa daale kpuna neŋ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ baŋ be kyaa tɛɛle kei dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">&lt;Baŋ yɛna obuo balaŋ baŋ be nombia na gyoo me sia nideli.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Baŋ be silana wurubuarɛse wɔlɛɛ baale nɛ, baa naa diyem nideli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">Mɔɔ gyae maa kyɛɛkee fatabo woli wurubuarɛse benaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">yaa maa gyuusu me nɔɔ baake ba yela gba ya.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaageŋ te ma lesewɔ te mee nyiŋ abɔɔ burum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">me fareba mɔ doo bo n nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Dekyae kpaakpaa keŋ mɔɔ nyim nɛ ta gyoo me sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">ke yɛɛ ampaŋ nyi dedii keŋ ta gyoo me sia nideli.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Maa lese Degbeŋgyoo ŋon ɔ na wola maŋ nɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">nelim koraŋ na me konɔɔ na wola maŋ gbɛɛneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Debaŋ kamasɛ na me sia gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">Ɔ kyaa me dunoluŋ dɔɔ, mena dɔɔ kolo be tale wosi maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Mena dɔɔ me wɔe te fɛɛ maŋ, te me laakem ne nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">maa kyaa wose kefɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Nawolo nyi n be gyae n ke yela ma woo ke dɔɔ woyadɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">yaa ŋon ɔ be di anokoare fa neŋ nɛ ke wɔlɛɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Nyaŋ ka wola maŋ nyeedoŋ gbɛɛ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">nyaŋ ke yela maa nyaŋee n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">maa kyaa n dunoluŋ dɔɔ di gyoŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyii maŋ, me kasola doona kegbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">tei me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ke ta lee nɔɔ keŋ ne di akɛrɛɛ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Yela ma deŋele kedi ka lee n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">yela n sia kena kpene keŋ doo kegbɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Akpaa n gyoo me konɔɔ man kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">te n gyoo me man nelim te n kɛɛse maŋ kɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:3">n be gyae n kena nombiikum daale me man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">me nɔɔ te kolosita nombiikum ya.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Balaŋ gyaewɔ nyi baa yo fa maŋ kolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">mɔna me wɔŋa ma wose lee balaŋ kumɛɛ gbɛɛneŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">lee nombia ŋan ba lee n nɔɔman dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />N gbɛɛneŋ man te me dɔŋ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">me nawɔɔ te kpaŋte lee n gbɛɛneŋ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Me Wurubuarɛ, nyaŋ te mee wii baake, nawolo nyi nyaŋ ke kpa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">see deŋele na n ke nyii ma kefane.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Lese gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan doo n kegyae man nɛ wola maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">nyaŋ ŋon n na mo n doŋ lɛɛ balaŋ nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">baŋ bee yeu kaa gyoo neŋ nɛ lee be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Gyee maŋ ŋgba n sibiibii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">mo maŋ weese n beŋkelɛɛ wuluŋ man,<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />lee akpanyanyaŋtena baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa wɔlɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">na me kɔlara baŋ bɔɔ kilisi maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Bɔɔ ne wii walaŋ waraŋase ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">te be nɔɔ ne kolosi agaŋtaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Ba deke maŋ, te nɛnɛɛ be te kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">be sia gyakaa me dɔɔ nyi baa lɔ maŋ tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Be yɛɛ ŋgba dinaate ŋon ɔ na deke kolo waa kyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">ŋgba dinaate talabo ŋon ɔ yoɛ ɔ na deke nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Degbeŋgyoo koro seŋ, yoo me kɔlara na n ke yɔkɔse wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">mo n yoosila lɛɛ maŋ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Degbeŋgyoo, mo n doŋ lɛɛ maŋ lee mena balaŋ benaŋ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">lee baŋ bɔɔ nyiŋ be wui dedii tɛɛle kei dɔɔ nɛ nyiŋmaase man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Mo abɔɔ ŋan n be desina see balaŋ kumɛɛ nɛ wulu be tɔɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">yela be bia ke nyiŋ kela mena keŋ bɛɛ gyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">na ŋaale ke tuŋ be naanasebia.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Maŋ dɔɔ maa kɛɛ n siaman katenee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">Akpaa me fom te me naa n siagbɛɛ na, me wɔe gyae ke fɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide keyoodi nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, me doŋ, mɛɛ gyae neŋ,<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna me kpanaŋ, na ma dekagya, na me lɛɛre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">me Wurubuarɛ yɛna me kpanaŋ ŋon mee yeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ŋon yɛna me yoo nyeele pampasaŋ, na ma nyeekelɛɛ doŋ, na ŋon ɔ ne gyee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Me baake Degbeŋgyoo ŋon kaboena nyi baa lese ɔ yele nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">te ɔ lɛɛ maŋ lee me kɔlara nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Yeŋ ŋmeeseŋ milii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">kewɔlɛɛ wuuwɔ waale maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Woyadɛɛ ŋmeeseŋ milii maŋ kilisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">yeŋ kɔtase kyaŋa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Ma wose kekyaŋ man nɛ, me baake Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">me wiiwɔ fa me Wurubuarɛ nyi waa kyɔ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">Ɔ nyii ma woya wɔ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">me kewii ke liiwɔ ɔ deŋela man.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Tɛɛle sereewɔ te ke wosiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">bulase mokɔɔ kaseese wosiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">ŋe sereewɔ nawolo nyi ɔ ta gyeŋ baŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Nyɔɔse leewɔ ɔ memɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">boalaŋ anekpaaŋ leewɔ ɔ nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">boalaŋ na nyewalaŋ leewɔ ke man.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Ɔ kpase adido man, te ɔ tisiwɔ kɔŋ tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">debuŋta tuum doo ɔ nawɔɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Ɔ kyaawɔ kerubise dɔɔ te ɔ furufuwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">ɔ kyaawɔ feliŋ beŋkelɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Ɔ moo detiŋtɛɛ wuu ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">ɔga kebiri ŋɔma tuum kilisi ɔ wose.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Ŋɔma na akpeleŋkpeleŋbia na ɔga keŋmaale te kilisi e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">nyewalaŋ ŋɛɛ na lee ŋɔma man.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Degbeŋgyoo faewɔ lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">Adidote ŋon woya faewɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Ɔ tɔɔ ɔ baŋdaŋ yaasee kɔlara baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">ɔga keŋmaale dinaa yelaa kekolosi gyoo wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Ɛpo man ateta lee debɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">tɛɛle mokɔɔ kasee mɔ lee debɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:15">lee Degbeŋgyoo n kekalana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">na weesɛɛ ŋan n ba lee foofoo nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Ɔ tenee ɔ nyiŋmaa lee adido kaa kyaŋ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">ɔ wɔŋa maŋ lee loŋse ŋan ŋe dana siiliŋ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Ɔ lɛo maŋ lee me kɔlara doŋ nyibaŋ gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">na me kɔlara baŋ be doŋ kela maŋ beiŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Ma wose kekyaŋ maŋ te be kaa wuu me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo kyɔɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Ɔ lese maŋ ka see botɔɔ keŋ ma wose gyae ke fɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">ɔ lɛo maŋ nawolo nyi me nombia na gyoo ɔ sia.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛɛ deeli fa maŋ lee me katenee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">ɔ tɔɔ maŋ kom lee keŋ me nyiŋmaase yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Nawolo nyi me tɛɛwɔ Degbeŋgyoo gbɛɛneŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">Me ta lee Wurubuarɛ wɔle yɛɛ dukum ya.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Wɔ mmaraase pou doo me siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">me ta lee ɔ kawolase ŋan wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Nombiikum be doo me man ɔ siaman ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">me wɔŋa ma wose lee dukum man.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Degbeŋgyoo tɔɔ maŋ kom lee me katenee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">lee keŋ me nyiŋmaase yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ ɔ siaman dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />N ne di anokoare fa baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">n ne yɛɛ deeli fa baŋ be dei nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />N yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ fa baŋ be yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">mɔna n ne ŋmanyaŋ akpanyanyaŋtena.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />N ne lɛɛ baŋ bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">mɔna n ne yɔkɔse baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela me kanea ke kyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">me Wurubuarɛ, besena ma detiŋtɛɛ yɛɛ keŋmaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Nyaŋ ke kyɔ maŋ na maa di me kɔlara pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">me Wurubuarɛ waa do maŋ doŋ, na maa toŋ gbaa me kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ, ɔ liiwɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">Degbeŋgyoo nombii yɛɛ anokoare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">ɔ yɛɛ yoo nyeele pampasaŋ, fa baŋ bee yeu kaa gyoo e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Amɔte yɛna Wurubuarɛ lee Degbeŋgyoo wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">amɔte yɛna kpanaŋ kela de Wurubuarɛ?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Wurubuarɛ na doona maŋ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">ɔ ne yele ma keta man ne gyu nideli.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Ɔ ne yele me nawɔɔ na betee ŋgba ŋaa nɛ keŋ bɛɛ kpaŋte ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">ɔ ne yele mɛɛ sem botɔɔse ŋan korɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Ɔ na wola me nyiŋmaase yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">me nyiŋmaase ne tale goo kɔbere baŋdaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />N moo n nyeekelɛɛ kekyɔ keŋ yɛɛ me yoo nyeele pampasaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa ne gyee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">n kekyɔ yelaa me yɛɛ doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />N fɛlɛɛ gbɛɛ nyi maa ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">na ma doona be kpaŋte ya.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Me gegi me kɔlara te ma ke kyaŋa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">me ta bese me wɔle ya kaboena ma koe wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Me yɛlɛɛ wɔ keŋ ba te tale koro ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">be yalawɔ me nawɔɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Nyaŋ doona maŋ doŋ fa yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">n yɔkɔse me kɔlara me siaman.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Nyaŋ yelela me kɔlara besewɔ be wɔle yekii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">te me munu baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Be wiiwɔ nyi baa kyɔ wɔ, mɔna ŋolo te lɛɛ wɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">be baake Degbeŋgyoo, mɔna ɔ te kpa wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Me naŋa wɔ ŋgba akuŋkuŋ te feliŋ gyɔɔwɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">me sakatee wɔ ŋgba abɔntere man depate nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />N te lɛɛ maŋ lee baŋ bee yoo maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">n moo maŋ yɛɛ tɛɛlese nyee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:43">Balaŋ baŋ mɔɔ gyeŋ wɔ ya nɛ, na som maŋ nɛnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Ŋɔɔla ne yɔkɔse ba wose fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">ba betaa nyii me nombia pɛ, na bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Be popou wose ta yeŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">bɛɛ mo wose keseree lee ba ayoese man kɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Degbeŋgyoo kyaa, yele kalese yɛɛ me kpanaŋ ŋon wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">Ɛ gyina Wurubuarɛ ma nyeelɛɛre ŋon adido.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Ŋon yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne yoo fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">ɔ ne yɔkɔse tɛɛlese do me tɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />ŋon lɛɛna maŋ lee me kɔlara nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">n gyinaa maŋ adido kela me kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">n lɛɛ maŋ lee balaŋ akaraŋkaraŋ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Degbeŋgyoo, mena dɔɔ maa lese n yele tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Ŋon faana ɔ gyoo keyoodi dinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ɔ lese ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ wola ŋon ɔ be tiu e nuŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">fa Dawide na ɔ duuluŋ man balaŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">Wurubuarɛ gyoorobiiri wa abɔɔ keyɛɛ man.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Adido na lese Degbeŋgyoo gyoorobiiri wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">ŋɔma ne gyɔ ɔ nyiŋmaa man tomse dekpeŋkpeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Wee ne yako ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ fa wee wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">nelim mɔ ne yako ɔ nombia kagyeŋ fa nelim wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Ta lee kekolosi man ya, ta lee nɔɔwoya man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">ŋolo te nyii ba woya mɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Mɔna ba woya liiwɔ tɛɛle pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">be nɔɔwoya ke liiwɔ tɛɛle keŋ ɔto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:4">Wurubuarɛ te baŋ kefɛɛ fa weese adido.<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />Kɛɛ lee ŋgba alowɔle baale ŋon ɔ na lee ɔ deni tɔɔmante man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">yaa ŋgba yeure kpaakpaate ŋon ɔ na mo kenyaŋee yeu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Kɛɛ bɛɛ lee adido</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">na ke ta mo ŋɔma man kelii ke dɛɛyalae yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">kolo bɛɛ weese ka wose lee ka kelaŋe man ya.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Degbeŋgyoo mmaraa liiwɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">kɛɛ yele walaŋ woo ne kɔŋ ɔ gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:7">Nyaŋ ke tale mo n wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo kawolase dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">kee yele diyiŋte sia ne kare.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Degbeŋgyoo kawola doo kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">kee yele walaŋ konɔɔ ne fɛɛ e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">Degbeŋgyoo mmaraase tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">ŋee yele walaŋ sia ne ŋmaŋee e.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Degbeŋgyoo keyee yɛna kpaakpaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">ke kyaa kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">Degbeŋgyoo kawolase doo ŋa dedoi man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">ŋe popou tenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Ŋɛɛ lee koya kela kɔba yayam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">kela kɔba yayam kpaakpaate gba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">ŋe dana gyoŋ kela teebɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">kela teebɔɔ keŋ ne kyɔsee lee teebɔɔ defaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Ŋan ne fareena n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">ɔ di ŋe dɔɔ na, ke dana kom ketɔ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Amɔte gyenena ŋon gbagba dukum keŋ ɔ be yɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">Mo me nombia kumɛɛ ŋan weesɛɛ nɛ kyɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Lese n tobaale lee nombiakumɛɛ ŋan ɔ ne naa na sia yɛɛ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ŋe naa di me dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">kenaŋ na nombiikum be doo ma wose man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">na maa lee nombia kumɛɛ dinaana keyɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Yela me nɔɔwoya na ŋan mɛɛ gyueŋ me konɔɔ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">ka gyoo n sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">Degbeŋgyoo, me Kpanaŋ na ma Nyeelɛɛre.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Keyoodi nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Degbeŋgyoo waa kpa neŋ n wose kekyaŋ wee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon yele dee gyee neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Waa kpila ŋolo lee ɔ deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man kaa kyɔ neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">waa lee Siyɔn bula dɔɔ kaa do neŋ doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Waa tɔɔse n kedeesase pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">na waa lɛɛ n katoo kedeesase.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Waa yɛɛ n konɔɔ man kegyaebii fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">waa yela ŋan pou n ne gyae nyi n ke yɛɛ nɛ ke de fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Dɛɛ fae yeesa nyaŋee lee n keyoodi dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">na dee gyina da felagese adido de Wurubuarɛ yele man.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 20:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:5">Degbeŋgyoo waa yɛɛ n kebɔɔsese pou fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Nɛnɛɛ me ta gyem nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">Degbeŋgyoo ne faana walaŋ ŋon bɔɔ tiu e nuŋ nɛ keyoodi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:6">Ɔ ne kpa e lee wa adido fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">na ɔ keyoodi doŋ dinaa keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Baale na mo ba wose lɔ anebiliŋiŋse dɔɔ, te baale mɔ dɛɛkyɔŋse dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">mɔna daa na mo da wose bo lɔ Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ yele dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Baa buŋii ba doona dɔɔ na baa lee yala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">mɔna daa dɛɛ koro na dɛɛ seŋ keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela gyoo keyoodi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">De baake neŋ na kpa daa!<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Karaŋ nɔɔneŋ fa keyoodi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, gyoo ne nyaŋee lee n doŋ keŋ dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">Ɔ ne nyaŋee nideli lee keyoodi keŋ n be fa e nɛ dɔɔ!<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />N te yɛɛ ɔ konɔɔ man kegyaebii fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">n faa e keŋ ɔ ba sola neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />N moo wose kenyiŋ kaa hiraa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">n moo kɔba yayam gbagba gyooro kotɔtɔɔ wuu e.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Ɔ sola neŋ nyeedoŋ te n faa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">n faa e weeya burum kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Lee keyoodise ŋan n be fa e dɔɔ, ɔ te lɛɛ yele nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">n ta mo gyoorobiiri na obuo fa e.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Ampaŋ n te hiraa e kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">n yelaa ɔ nyaŋeewɔ n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Nawolo nyi gyoo na mo ɔ wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">lee Adidote ŋon kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">kolo be tale wosi e ya.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />N nyiŋmaa gyae ke tuŋ n kɔlara pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa gyae ke kyaŋ baŋ bɛɛ kɔla neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Akpaa n lee nyi ɛ ke yoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">nyaŋ ka too wɔ ŋgba boalaŋ degyapaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">Degbeŋgyoo waa mo ɔ baŋ nedoŋ lila wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">na ɔ boalaŋ ke kpa wɔ dugudugu.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Nyaŋ ke munu be naanasebia lee tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">be duuluŋ man balaŋ pou lee denibalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Nyi akpaa be bake n nyeeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">te ba mo nyeempɔkum lee n wose man na, be gyae ke de fa wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Nyaŋ ke wɔŋ n baŋdaŋ tee wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">na n ke yela baa bese be wɔle yekii.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Degbeŋgyoo, gate n wose n doŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">dee kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele lee n wɔɔle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kewii baake na yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ, me Wurubuarɛ, weera te n bɛɛ maŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">Weera te n kyaa lem keŋ n be lɛɛ maŋ ya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">Weera te n bee nyii ma weeleŋ man kewii ya?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Me Wurubuarɛ, mee wii baake neŋ weese teŋteŋ, mɔna n bɛɛ kpa maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">nelim, mɔna mɔɔ ne nyiŋ wosefɛɛreŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Mɔ nyaŋ yɛna fereŋkyeŋte ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">bɔɔ see neŋ gyoori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">nyaŋ te Iseraetena na lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />N dɔɔ te de naanaɔ moo ba wose lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">ba moo ba wose lɔ n dɔɔ te n lɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Nyaŋ te be wiiwɔ baake te n lɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">ba moo ba wose lɔ n dɔɔ, te n ta do wɔ desɛŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Mɔna maŋ yɛɛ feeliibii e, ma te yɛɛ deniwalaŋ e ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">walaŋ kamasɛ na boŋo maŋ, bɔɔ na mo maŋ yɛɛ kolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Baŋ pou bɛɛ naa maŋ ne kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">Bɛɛ mo tuubia wuraa maŋ, na bee kpiisi ba nyeeya.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɔ na mo ɔ wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">Degbeŋgyoo waa lɛɛ e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:8">akpaa ɔ nombia na gyoo ɔ sia na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">waa lɛɛ e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Mɔna nyaŋ lesena maŋ lee me naa tɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">debaŋ keŋ me nɔɔ tosɛɛ me naa dide nɔɔman nɛ, n yelaa ma moo me loo gyakaa n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Be kɛɛ ŋmase koraŋ nɛ n yelaa ma moo me loo gyakaa n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ lee me naa tɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Naa kyaana lem lee me gyaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">nawolo nyi wosekekyaŋ benaana maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">te ŋolo be kyaa waa kyɔ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Nunkyue baala burum te kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">Basan nunkyue baala doŋ nyibaŋ te tɔ maŋ do.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Ba te wola be nɔɔse tee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">ŋgba dinaate ŋon tanam na ko e te ɔ ne gyae kolo waa kyaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Ma te gbalase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">me ŋɔɔ pou ta lee ŋa dedoi man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">Me konɔɔ te yɛɛ ŋgba aŋɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">ka te yalakee me tɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Me nɔɔ ta wolo ŋgba osuŋ yaale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">me laakem te mataa me nɔɔ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">n moo maŋ doosi yeŋ aŋasa man.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Balaŋ kumɛɛ te kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">ŋgba babaase dikpii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">ba te sɔkee me nyiŋmaase na me naawɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Maa tale kala me ŋɔɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">balaŋ ne fɛɛ sia kɛɛ maŋ na bɛɛ nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Be kpala me kanyaŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">te be lɔɔ boe ma kegba dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, naa kyaa lem lee me gyaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">nyaŋ yɛna me doŋ, yɛɛ bileŋ na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee yoosila nɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">ma nyeedoŋ lee babaase baŋ doŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee dinaatese baŋ nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">lɛɛ maŋ lee ŋale man namense baŋ woose man.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Maa baake n yele fa me balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">maa lese n yele balaŋ degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ, ɛ lese ɔ yele!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Ɛmɛɛ Yakɔbe duuluŋmantena pou, ɛ mo obuo fa e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Ɛmɛɛ Iserae duuluŋmantena pou ɛ yee e!<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Nawolo nyi ɔ ta leseta ɔ sia yaa waa bɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ŋon ɔ doo kayeyɛɛ man nɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:24">ɔ ta moota ɔ sia weese e ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">mɔna ɔ ne nyii ɔ kewii baake.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Maa lese n yele balaŋ burum degyaŋee man lee keŋ n be yɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">maa tɔ ma alaŋaŋ balaŋ baŋ bɛɛ yee neŋ nɛ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ayematena baa di baa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">baŋ bɛɛ kɛo Degbeŋgyoo nɛ baa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">ɛ kekyaabii man dee de fa ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Tɛɛlese pou</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">baa tɔɔse na baa bese kɔŋ Degbeŋgyoo gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:27">tɛɛlese loŋtona pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">baa buŋ ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">te ŋon ne diina tɛɛlese dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Baŋ bɔɔ nyiŋ ba wose tɛɛle kei dɔɔ pou baa di na baa som e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">baŋ pou baa bese gyu tɛɛle man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">baŋ bɔɔ gyae baa tale lɛɛ ba wose ya nɛ baa buŋ e.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Be duuluŋ man balaŋ baa som e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">kalola kegyakaarese baa kaa nyii Degbeŋgyoo wose man nombia.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Baa yako ɔ katenee nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">fa bia baŋ be ta lolata wɔ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">Ŋon yɛɛla.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">Dawide nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna me kɛɛre, ma wose be gyae ke kyaŋ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Ɔ na mo maŋ gyu botɔɔ keŋ ŋalese nalaŋ kyaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:2">Ɔ na mo maŋ gyu boo keŋ ne lam dɛɛdɛɛ nɛ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Ɔ na do maŋ doŋ wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:3">Ɔ na mo maŋ ta gbɛɛneŋ ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">lee ɔ yele man.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Doo nyi me dɔŋ yeŋ detaŋgya tuum man koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">mɔɔ yee nombiikum daale ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">Nawolo nyi n kpuɛna maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">nyɔ okpokpo na n gbutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">ne fɛɛna me wɔe.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />N na see maŋ weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">me kɔlara siaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">N moo nuŋ tiu ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">ma leenɔɔ wuluwɔ leki.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Ampaŋ deeli na kegyae gyae ke sila maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">ma kekyaa man pou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:6">te maa kyaa Degbeŋgyoo dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Gyoo dinaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Tɛɛle na abɔɔ ŋan pou doo ke man yɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">tɛɛle keŋ na baŋ pou be kyaa ke dɔɔ nɛ yɛɛ ɔ wui.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Nawolo nyi ŋon seena ka mokɔɔ ɛpo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">te ɔ baŋa ke loŋse dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa gyeŋ Degbeŋgyoo bula keŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Amɔte ne gyaela waa seŋ ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Walaŋ ŋon ayimɛɛ be doo ɔ nyiŋmaase man ya te ɔ konɔɔ man dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ŋon ɔ bɛɛ mo ɔ wose lɔ bɛɛneŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">yaa ɔ bɛɛ kaŋ dekara ntam ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Degbeŋgyoo waa hiraa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">na ba nyeelɛɛre Wurubuarɛ ke yela baa di deŋele.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Mena duuluŋ kei yɛna baŋ bɛɛ kɛo e nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">baŋ bɛɛ kɛo Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ nɛ<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Ɛmɛɛ anaanɔɔse, ɛ gyina ɛ nyeeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">ɛmɛɛ gyaŋgba anaanɔɔse ɛ toro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">na gyoorobiiri gyoo ŋon kaa gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Amɔte yɛna gyoorobiiri gyoo ŋon?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Degbeŋgyoo doŋte na Dekpataakpere ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Degbeŋgyoo yoonɔɔte Dekpataakpere ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Ɛmɛɛ anaanɔɔse, ɛ gyina ɛ nyeeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">ɛmɛɛ gyaŋgba anaanɔɔse ɛ toro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">na gyoorobiiri gyoo ŋon kaa gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Amɔte yɛna gyoorobiiri gyoo kei?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">ŋon yɛna gyoorobiiri gyoo ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:1">n dɔɔ te ma moo ma wose lɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Me ta mo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">naa yele desɛŋ kekyaŋ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:2">yaa me kɔlara ke nyaŋee lee me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Walaŋ kamasɛ ŋon ɔ mo wose lɔ n dɔɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">desɛŋ be gyae ke kyaŋ e korakora ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:3">Mɔna desɛŋ gyae ke kyaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">bee dii akɛrɛɛ yakaa yakaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, wola maŋ n gbɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">wola maŋ n detɛese.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Mo maŋ ta nya anokoare keŋ man, na n ka wola maŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna ma nyeelɛɛre Wurubuarɛ ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">n dɔɔ te me loo gyakaa weeya pou.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɔɔse n waraŋase kewii na n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">nawolo nyi ŋe wulaa kyaa leenaŋ gyaŋgba gyaŋgba keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Naa tɔɔse me biatɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">na ma deŋeledoŋ keŋ mɔɔ yɛɛ nɛ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:7">Tɔɔse maŋ lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, n dei.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Degbeŋgyoo dei te ɔ tenɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">Mena dɔɔ te ɔ na wola nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ɔ gbɛɛneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Ɔ na mo baŋ bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose nɛ ta katenee gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">te ɔ na wola wɔ ɔ gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Degbeŋgyoo gbɛɛneŋ pou yɛɛ kegyae na anokoare kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">fa balaŋ baŋ bee di ɔ nɔɔkebakesee dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Degbeŋgyoo, lee n yele keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">doo nyi me nombiakumɛɛ boe koraŋ na mo ŋa kyɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Nɛnɛɛ amɔte ne yeena Degbeŋgyoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">Waa wola wɔ gbɛɛ keŋ man baa ta.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Ba kekyaabii man gyae ke de fa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">na be duuluŋmantena kaa mo tɛɛle keŋ ŋgba be dedii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Degbeŋgyoo na lese ɔ nyeeman nombia wola baŋ bee yee e nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">ɔ ne yele bɛɛ gyeŋ ɔ nɔɔkebakesee keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Me sia gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">nawolo nyi ŋon waageŋ ne gyaela waa lese me nawɔɔ lee kɔta man.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Besena n sia kɛɛ maŋ na n ke wii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">nawolo nyi teka maageŋ, te mɛɛ kaa.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Lese nombia ŋan ne takaa maŋ nɛ lee me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">na n ka lese maŋ lee ma wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Kɛɛ me kaale na me kayeyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">na n ka mo me nombiakumɛɛ pou kyɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Kɛɛ mena keŋ me kɔlara boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">na mena keŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Gyee maŋ na n ke lɛɛ ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">naa yele desɛŋ ke kyaŋ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">nawolo nyi ma te yeu kaa gyoo neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Yela anokoare na katenee ke gyee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ te me loo gyakaa.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, lɛɛ Iserae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">lee be kayeyɛɛ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Walaŋ kpaakpaa kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, fa maŋ deŋele kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">nawolo nyi me kyaawɔ keŋ dukum be doo me man ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:1">Ma moo ma wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">keŋ me ta lee ɔ wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Degbeŋgyoo, kɛɛse maŋ kɛɛ na n ka gyoo me man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">gyoo me konɔɔ na ma nyeempɔ man kɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Nawolo nyi n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ doo me siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">te me dɔŋ nya anokoare keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Mɔɔ na mo ma wose dona akɛrɛɛtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">yaa baŋ be dana nɔɔse ala ala nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Mɔɔ ne kyaa nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra degyaŋee man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">te daa na akpanyanyaŋtena bɛɛ kyaa debodokoloŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, ma te faafo me nyiŋmaase na ka wola nyi me nombia dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">me tɛɛwɔ kilisi n kedeesaboe keŋ,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />mɛɛ mo yeesa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">te mɛɛ yako n gyakoloŋ nombia ayɛɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ gyae dekpaŋalaŋ keŋ man n kyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">botɔɔ keŋ n gyoorobiiri kyaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Naa wɔlɛɛ maŋ kpuna nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">yaa n ke yela maa yeŋ kpuna baŋ bɛɛ koe balaŋ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />Baŋ bɛɛ mo be nyiŋmaase yɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ adao man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">abɔɔ kayolɛɛ te wulu be dunoluŋ nyiŋmaase.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ me tɛɛwɔ anokoare man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">lɛɛ maŋ na n ke wii me waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Ma seŋɛɛ tɛɛle tatarataa dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">maa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele botɔɔ keŋ balaŋ burum be gyaŋee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna ma keŋmaŋee na ma nyeekelɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">amɔte yaa maa yee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Degbeŋgyoo te me yeuwɔ kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">amɔte ne gyaela waa ŋmaase maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Akpaa akpanyanyaŋtena de kaa wuu me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">nyi baa wɔlɛɛ maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:2">me kɔlara na baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">ne gyaela baa sarakee na baa lee yala.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Doo nyi yoonɔɔtena te kaa tɔ maŋ do koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">me wɔe be gyae ke lɔ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:3">nyi yoo da koro me dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">keŋ gba te me wɔe ne fɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Kolo dokoloŋ te mɛɛ sola Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">keŋ kaageŋ gbɛɛ te me silana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">nyi maa som Degbeŋgyoo dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">ma kekyaa man pou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">na maa kɛɛ Gbeŋgyoo gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">na maa kɛo e wɔ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Nawolo nyi ma wose de kyaŋ maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">waa mo maŋ see wɔ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man wosefɛɛreŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:5">waa mo maŋ weese wɔ ɔsom deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ wuluŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">na waa gate maŋ gyakaa kpanaŋ dɔɔ adido.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Dekɔŋ mena na ma nyee gyae ka koro maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">kela me kɔlara baŋ pou bɔɔ kilisi maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:6">maa mo kenyaŋee yeesa yɛɛ kedeesa ɔ kanyaŋ deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, akpaa me baake neŋ na nyii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">wii me waraŋase na n ke kpa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Mee nyii me konɔɔ man nyi, &lt;&lt;Kɛɛ ɔ siaman.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">Degbeŋgyoo, n siaman te maa kɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Naa mo n sia weese maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">naa mo baŋ gegi n tobaale ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">nyaŋ yɛna ŋon n ne kyɔ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Naa bɛɛ maŋ yaa n ka lese n sia yela maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ma nyeelɛɛre Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Nyi me kya na me naa de bɛɛ maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">Degbeŋgyoo waa lɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Degbeŋgyoo, wola maŋ n gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">na n ka mo maŋ ta gbɛɛ teeŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">lee baŋ bɛɛ ŋere maŋ do nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Naa fa me kɔlara gbɛɛ baa yɛɛ maŋ ba kegyaebii ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">nawolo nyi akɛrɛɛ adansɛɛtena ta koro seŋ tia maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">bɛɛ mo akɛrɛɛ nombia gyakaa me dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Me dana lookegyakaa nideli nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">maa naa Degbeŋgyoo deeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">deni balaŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">seŋ keŋkeŋ na n ke nyiŋ konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">na n ke kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo siaman.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ yaa mɛɛ baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">nyaŋ yɛna me Kpanaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">naa tɔ n deŋele nyi n be tei maŋ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Nawolo nyi akpaa n te kpa maŋ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">maa yɛɛ ŋgba baŋ bɔɔ tisi gyoo yebɔɔ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Akpaa me wii baake neŋ nyi nyaa wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">te me gyina me nyiŋmaase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:2">tee n dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">nyii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Naa wɔŋee maŋ kpuna balaŋ kumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ nɛ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:3">Bee kolosi wosefɛɛreŋ nombia fa be tebia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">mɔna nombiakumɛɛ doola be konɔɔse man.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Tɔ wɔ kom lee ba ayɛɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">na be nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:4">Tɔ wɔ kom lee keŋ bɔɔ mo be nyiŋmaase yɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">na n ke tɔ wɔ kom ŋgba mena keŋ kaboena wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Nawolo nyi bɔɔ na mo Degbeŋgyoo abɔɔ ayɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">na keŋ ɔ ba mo ɔ nyiŋmaase yɛɛ nɛ yɛɛ kolo ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:5">waa wɔlɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ɔ be gyae waa gate wɔ seŋ bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">nawolo nyi me wiiwɔ baake e na ɔ wii me waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna me doŋ na me yoo nyeele pampasaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">Ma moo me loo gyakaa ɔ dɔɔ, te ɔ kyɔɔ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">Mɛɛ nyaŋee me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ma moo me nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Degbeŋgyoo na doona ɔ balaŋ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">ŋon ne lɛɛna ŋon ɔ be tiu e nuŋ nɛ nyee.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Lɛɛ n balaŋ na n ke hiraa n dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">yɛɛ be kɛɛre, na n ke kɛɛ be dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">Dawide nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ kyaa adido nɛ, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo gyoorobiiri na ɔ doŋ keŋ yele.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Ɛ mo gyoorobiiri keŋ kaboena Degbeŋgyoo yele nɛ fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Ɛ mo wose keyɔkɔse som Degbeŋgyoo wɔ ɔsom deni dinaa fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Degbeŋgyoo woya gyakaa loŋse dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">gyoorobiiri Wurubuarɛ ŋon woya ne seree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Degbeŋgyoo woya ne seree loŋse burum dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Degbeŋgyoo woya dana doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">gyoorobiiri doo Degbeŋgyoo woya man.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Degbeŋgyoo woya ne tekerii sida daase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">Degbeŋgyoo ne tekerii Lebanɔn sida daase kpetekpete.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Ɔ ne yele Lebanɔn na toŋee ŋgba nunkyue bu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">Siriyɔn na toŋee ŋgba ŋale man nam bu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Degbeŋgyoo woya ne ŋmaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">ŋgba boalaŋ laakemse nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Degbeŋgyoo woya ne wosi depampaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">Degbeŋgyoo ne wosi Kadese depampaa.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Degbeŋgyoo woya na meele kpeli daase dinaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">ɔ yelaa laa keŋ man doowɔ yakaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">Keŋte balaŋ baŋ fae yeesa ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɛ mo gyoorobiiri fa Wurubuarɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Degbeŋgyoo kyaa boo keŋ be wuu nɛ dɔɔ ɔ ne di gyoori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">Degbeŋgyoo kyaa ɔ gyooro gbeli dɔɔ ŋgba gyoo nɛ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Degbeŋgyoo na do ɔ balaŋ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">Degbeŋgyoo na mo wosefɛɛreŋ hiraa ɔ balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Karaŋ kefa nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, maa gyina neŋ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">nawolo nyi nyaŋ wɔŋana maŋ lese lee bɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">n te yele me kɔlara ke nyaŋee lee me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, me baake neŋ nyi nyaa kyɔ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">te n kyɔɔ maŋ me kawee.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ lesena maŋ lee woyadɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">n lɛɛ ma nyee keŋ me ta gyoo yebɔɔ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Ɛmɛɛ ɔ balaŋ baŋ ɛ ne di anokoare nɛ, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">ɛ lese ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Nawolo nyi ɔ baŋ bɛɛ kyare ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">mɔna ɔ bɛrɛɛ ne doo kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">Kewii gyae ke tale kyaa nelim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">mɔna kenyaŋee gyae ke kɔŋ nebo.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Debaŋ keŋ ma wose be fɛɛ maŋ nɛ me yakowɔ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">&lt;&lt;Mɔɔ gyae maa wosi korakora ya,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, n moo n bɛrɛɛ boele maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">n yelaa ma seŋawɔ keŋkeŋ ŋgba bula nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:7">Mɔna n ka mo n sia weese nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">ma wose yeŋa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ te me baakewɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">Degbeŋgyoo te ma solawɔ nyi waa wii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />&lt;&lt;Nyi akpaa me nɔɔ de wuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">yaa ma yem na woŋ tɔnɔɔ doola ke man?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">Woya baa tale lese n yele?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">Baa tale kolosi lee nya anokoare keŋ man?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Degbeŋgyoo, tei na n ke wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">Degbeŋgyoo, kyɔ maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />N te yele me kewii ta bese sɔɔre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">n ta kpee me titire, te n moo kenyaŋee do man.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Na maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lee me konɔɔ man lese n yele keŋ mɔɔ wuu me nɔɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, maa lese n yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa loo kamo kegyakaa Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ te me yeuwɔ kaa gyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">naa yele desɛŋ ke kyaŋ maŋ korakora ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">lɛɛ maŋ lee n katenee keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />See deŋele na n ke tei maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">kɔŋ bileŋ kaa lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">yɛɛ me kpanaŋ keŋ maa yeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">na dekyaŋ doŋte keŋ gyae ke lɛɛ ma nyee.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Nyaŋ yɛna me kpanaŋ na ma dekyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">lee n yele keŋ dɔɔ ta me siaman na n ke gyee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Lese maŋ lee kɔta keŋ bɔɔ nyɔɔ maŋ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna me keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Me ta mo ma nyeedoŋ do n nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ anokoarete lɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Mɛɛ kɔla baŋ bɛɛ som bɛɛneŋ behuhoona nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ te mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Gyae ke yɛɛ maŋ gyoŋ na maa nyaŋee lee n kegyae keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">nawolo nyi n naa me kaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">te n gyeŋ mena keŋ ma woo na yeyɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />N ta mo maŋ do me kɔlara nyiŋmaase man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">mɔna n moo maŋ ka seŋ botɔɔ keŋ fɛlɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, wii me waraŋase, nawolo nyi ma wose te kyaŋ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">Waraŋase te yele mɔɔ ne naa nideli ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">ma woo na ma wose ne nyii weeleŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Weeleŋ kedi te lɛɛ ma kekyaabii man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">te kemutii te lɛɛ me kulutooneŋ pou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:10">Kayeyɛɛ te yele me doŋ te taŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">te me ŋɔɔ mɔ te yɔkɔse.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Lee me kɔlara pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">me ta bese ohuhoo me tebia pou gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">me gyoona gbagba koraŋ ne yee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">baŋ bɛɛ naa maŋ abɔntere man nɛ ne yeu lee me gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Ba te wolee maŋ ŋgba ma yeŋae nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">Ma te yɛɛ ŋgba kyooli yaale nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Mee nyii balaŋ burum ne kolosi do dɔŋa deŋela man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">&lt;&lt;Gyakoloŋ dana maŋ yenaŋ kamasɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:13">Bɛɛ bake ma nyeeman nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">baa ko maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Mɔna me ta mo ma wose lɔ nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Ma debaŋ pou doo n nyiŋmaase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">lɛɛ maŋ lee me kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">na baŋ bee gegi maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Booli n sia fa n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">lɛɛ maŋ lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa yele desɛŋ ke kyaŋ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">nawolo nyi me wiiwɔ fa neŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">Mɔna yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">na be nɔɔse ke wuu woyadɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Do akɛrɛɛtena nɔɔse dokɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">nawolo nyi baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose te bɔɔ ne bu balaŋ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">bee kolosi agaŋtaŋ man tia baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />N deeli keyɛɛ boe nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">n moowɔ see fa baŋ bee yee neŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:19">te n lesewɔ wola balaŋ baŋ pou</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">bɔɔ yeu kaa gyoo neŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />N moo wɔ weese botɔɔ keŋ n kyaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">lee baŋ bɛɛ bake ba nyeeman nɛ gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:20">N moo wɔ see n gyaŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">lee laakemse ŋan ŋɛɛ gyae kale nɛ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">nawolo nyi ɔ lese ɔ kegyae keŋ dana gyakoloŋ nɛ wola maŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:21">debaŋ keŋ me kyaa donɔɔ keŋ bɔɔ tɔ wɔ do nɛ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Ma wose ke kyaŋ maŋ nɛ, me yakowɔ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">&lt;&lt;Be ta lese maŋ lee n sia man!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:22">Mɔna ma ke baake neŋ nyi nyaa kyɔ maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">n nyii me kasola.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ pou ɛ ne di anokoare fa Degbeŋgyoo nɛ ɛ gyae e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛ baŋ bee di anokoare fa e nɛ dɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">mɔna ɔ ne wɔŋ agaŋtaŋtena deŋele nideli.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ pou ɛ loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">ɛ nyiŋ konɔɔ na n ke yɛɛ doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ketɔlɛɛ na dukum kamo kyɛɛ nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Walaŋ ŋon bɔɔ mo ɔ dukum kyɛɛ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">te bɔɔ wuu ɔ nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Walaŋ ŋon Degbeŋgyoo bɛɛ mo ɔ dukum tia e ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">te dekara be doo ɔ man ya nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Debaŋ keŋ ma te tɔlɛɛta me nombiakumɛɛ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">ma wose na me ŋɔɔ pou yɔkɔse maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">te me kakeŋee weeya pou yelaa me nyɔewɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Nawolo nyi nelim na ke tɛɛkena pou na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">n ne wɔŋ ma deŋele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:4">me doŋ pou taŋawɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">ŋgba dugbututɛɛ feliŋ gyɔɔna maŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Keŋte me tɔlɛɛ me dukum fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">me te wuu me nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">Me yakowɔ nyi, &lt;&lt;Maa tɔlɛɛ me nombiakumɛɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">Te n moo me fɔɔkedi kyɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Mena dɔɔ baŋ pou bee di anokoare nɛ baa fane fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">debaŋ keŋ bɔɔ gyem nyi ba te yɛɛ dukum nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:6">Kenaŋ na booneŋ de wuu koraŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">be gyae ka mo wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Nyaŋ yɛna me dayoe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">n ke gyee maŋ lee ma wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">na n ka mo nyeekelɛɛ nɔɔneŋ kilisi maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Degbeŋgyoo kpa, &lt;&lt;Maa wola neŋ nombia, na maa wola neŋ gbɛɛ keŋ nyaa mo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">Maa fa neŋ nyeempɔ, na me sia ke gyakaa n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Naa yɛɛ ŋgba dɛɛkyɔŋ yaa kurumɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ŋon ɔ ba gyeŋ daale ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:9">te bɛɛ mo ŋmeleŋ na dokɔŋ do ba memɔɔ man wɔŋee wɔ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">na mena ya na bɔɔ gyae baa benaa neŋ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Akpanyanyaŋtena kaale boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo kegyae keŋ be taŋ ɔto ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">ne gyee walaŋ ŋon ɔ na mo ɔ wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ tenɛɛ nɛ, ɛ nyaŋee na ke yɛɛ ŋon gyoŋ Degbeŋgyoo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ konɔɔse man dei nɛ, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ tenɛɛ nɛ ɛ mo kenyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">Kaboena nyi baŋ be dei nɛ baa lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Ɛ mo adolɛɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">ɛ mo adolɛɛ keŋ ke dana ŋmeeseŋ kufu nɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa e.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ wɔle fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">ɛ mo adao gyɔ adolɛɛ keŋ na ɛ ka mo kenyaŋee fae yeesa.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo nɔɔwoya doona ke gbɛɛ, te ŋe yɛɛ anokoare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">ɔ ne di anokoare lee ŋan pou ɔ ne yɛɛ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Degbeŋgyoo ne gyae katenɛɛ na keŋ doona kegbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ te lɛɛ tɛɛle pou.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Nɔɔwoya te Degbeŋgyoo moowɔ yɛɛ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">ɔ nɔɔman weesɛɛ te ɔ moowɔ yɛɛ adido abɔɔ pou.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Ɔ yilaa ɛpo loŋse pou see debodokoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">ɔ moo siiliŋ see wa abɔɔ dɛɛsee man.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Tɛɛle kei pou baa yee Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">tɛɛle kei dɔɔ balaŋ pou baa mo obuo fa e.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Nawolo nyi ɔ kolosiwɔ te kɔŋawɔ mena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">ɔ faewɔ do te ka seŋawɔ keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Degbeŋgyoo ne wɔlɛɛ nombia ŋan tɛɛlese ne bake nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">ɔ ne yele ŋan bɔɔ bake nyi baa yɛɛ nɛ ne yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Mɔna ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be bake nɛ kyaa kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">ɔ konɔɔ man nombia doo fa kalola kegyakaare pou.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Tɛɛlese baŋ be Wurubuarɛ yɛna Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">na balaŋ baŋ ɔ ba lese wɔ nyi baa yɛɛ ɔ dedii nɛ baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛ lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">ɔ ne naa denibalaŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Ɔ kyaa ɔ dekyae man adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">ɔ ne naa balaŋ baŋ pou be kyaa tɛɛle dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Ŋon yɛɛna walaŋ kamasɛ konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">ɔ ne naa ŋan pou bɛɛ yɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Gyoo ŋolo keyoodi be doo ɔ yoonɔɔtena burum man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">yoonɔɔte doŋ be tale yela waa yoodi ya.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Loo kegyakaa be doo nyi dɛɛkyɔŋ waa lɛɛ neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">keŋ na ɔ doŋ koraŋ ɔ be gyae waa tale lɛɛ neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo sia gyakaa baŋ bee yee e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">na baŋ be loo gyakaa ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />nyi waa lɛɛ wɔ lee yeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">na waa yela baa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ tanam keyala man.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />De loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">ŋon yɛna de kyɔɔre na de yoo nyeele pampasaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Ɔ man te de konɔɔse ne nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">nawolo nyi de ta mo da wose lɔ ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ, ke kyaa de man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">ŋgba mena keŋ de loo gyakaa n dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ deeli keyɛɛ nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Maa hiraa Degbeŋgyoo debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">maa mo me nɔɔ lese ɔ yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ te mɛɛ gyɔ konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">ŋon ɔ ne naa diyem nɛ, waa nyii na waa nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Ɛ kpuna maŋ na dɛɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">ɛ yela dɛɛ yɛɛ nɔɔ gyina ɔ yele adido.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Me baake Degbeŋgyoo, te ɔ kpaa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">ɔ lese maŋ lee me gyakoloŋ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Baŋ be sia gyakaa ɔ dɔɔ nɛ siagbɛɛ ŋmaŋɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">desɛŋ be gyae ke kyaŋ wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Diyemte kei baakewɔ, te Degbeŋgyoo nyii e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">ɔ lese e lee ɔ wose kekyaŋ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Degbeŋgyoo kpilare ne gyee baŋ bee yee e nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">te ɔ ne lɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Ɛ gyoo ɔ man kɛɛ na, ɛ kena nyi Degbeŋgyoo dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">ŋon ɔ ne yeu kagyoo e nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ ɛ yee e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">nawolo nyi kolo bee hia baŋ bee yee e nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Tanam gyae ka ko dinaate bia na ba te gbalase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">mɔna baŋ bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ nɛ, kolo kpaakpaa kamasɛ be gyae ke hia wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Me bia, ɛ kɔŋ, ɛ tei maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">na maa wola ŋon Degbeŋgyoo keyee.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Ɛ man ɔkamasɛ ŋon ɔ ne gyae nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">na waa kyaa kyare na,<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />waa do ɔ laakem dokɔŋ lee nombiakumɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">na ɔ nɔɔ lee akɛrɛɛ kedi man.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Wɔŋ n wose lee dukum man, na n ke yɛɛ deeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">kɛo wosefɛɛreŋ na n ke sila ke.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Degbeŋgyoo sia gyakaa baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">te ɔ deŋela ne nyii be kewii.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo ne yase ɔ sia do baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">nyi waa munu wɔ lee tɛɛle dɔɔ, keŋ ŋolo be tɔɔse wɔ bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Baŋ be tenɛɛ nɛ ne wii baake, na Degbeŋgyoo te nyii wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">ɔ na lese wɔ lee be kaale pou man.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Degbeŋgyoo benaana baŋ bɔɔ yala koyololo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">te ɔ ne lɛɛ baŋ bɔɔ dana loo kegyakaa ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Walaŋ ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ kaale boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo na lese e lee ŋe popou man.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Ɔ ne gyee ɔ ŋɔɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">ŋe man dokoloŋ gba be tekeri ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 34:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:20">21 Dukum gyae ka ko akpanyanyaŋte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">baa wɔlɛɛ baŋ bɛɛ kɔla ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Degbeŋgyoo waa lɛɛ ɔ tewulɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">ɔ be gyae waa bu ŋon ɔ ne yeu kaa gyoo e nɛ fɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, kalana baŋ bɛɛ kalena maŋ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">yoona baŋ bee yoona maŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Mo n yoo nyeele pampasaŋ na n yookegba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">koro na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Wɔŋ nya apia na n debeŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">tɔ baŋ bee gegi maŋ nɛ gbɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:3">Yako maŋ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">&lt;Maŋ yɛna n nyeekelɛɛ.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Yela baŋ bɛɛ gyae maŋ baa ko nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">sia ka yeŋ na desɛŋ ke kyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:4">yela baŋ bɛɛ bake ma nyeeman dukum nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">ka mo desɛŋ bese be wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Yela baa yɛɛ ŋgba wura keŋ feliŋ ne gyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">te Degbeŋgyoo kpilare ne gegi wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Yela detiŋtɛɛ ka gyoo be gbɛɛ na ke sarakee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">na Degbeŋgyoo kpilare ke gegi wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Ma te yɛɛ wɔ kolo ya te be nyɔɔ maŋ kɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">ma te yɛɛ wɔ kolo ya, te be wula dowokom fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Yela kewɔlɛɛ kaa futaa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">yela be kɔta keŋ bɔɔ nyɔɔ weese nɛ ke kyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">yela baa yala gyoo dowokom keŋ bɔɔ wulu nɛ man na baa munu.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Kenaŋ na maa nyaŋee Degbeŋgyoo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">na ke yɛɛ maŋ gyoŋ lee ɔ nyeekelɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Ma wose pou gyae ke yako nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo, amɔte kyaala ŋgba nyaŋ nɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">N ne lɛɛ ayematena lee baŋ be dana doŋ kela wɔ nɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">diyemte na ŋon ɔ be dana kolo ya nɛ lee baŋ bɛɛ mo doŋ ŋmɛɛle wɔ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Akɛrɛɛ adansɛɛtena na koro tia maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">bɛɛ bɔɔse maŋ nombia ŋan mɔɔ gyeŋ ŋe man ya.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Bɛɛ mo dukum tɔ maŋ deeli kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">te be tina maŋ yela ŋgba walaŋ ŋon ɔ ne di waraŋsa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Mɔna be kɛɛ wee na, ma moo titire wuu ma wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">me yɔkɔse ma wose bake me nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:13">Mɔna me te nyii ke man daale ya,<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />mena dɔɔ me tɛɛwɔ waraŋsa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">ŋgba me gyoo yaa me naabu yaa mee wii fa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:14">Me wuluŋu ma nyee waraŋase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">ŋgba me gyoo yaa me naa yaa mee wii fa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Mɔna ma kegyɔ me nae nɛ, be yilaawɔ bɛɛ nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">balaŋ kumɛɛ yilaawɔ kilisi maŋ keŋ mɔɔ gyeŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">bɛɛ wɔlɛɛ maŋ keŋ bɔɔ ne tina yela ya.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Balaŋ behuhoona ne kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">ba te ŋɛɛ be kela tee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ ke kyaa kɛɛ wɔ kelii woromɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Lɛɛ maŋ lee ba kewɔlɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">ma nyeedoŋ lee dinaatese kɛwɔ nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Maa fa neŋ karaŋ balaŋ burum degyaŋee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">maa lese n yele balaŋ dikpii degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Naa yele baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ yakaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">ke nyaŋee lee me dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:19">naa yele baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ yakaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">ke baŋ maŋ deneŋkɔɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Bɔɔ ne kolosi wosefɛɛreŋ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">mɔna bee dii akɛrɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">gyakaa baŋ be kyaa tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ diiŋ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Bee gyuusu be nɔɔse yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Mbo, Mbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">Daa gbagba sia te naa ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Degbeŋgyoo, n te naa ke, naa wuu n nɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">Degbeŋgyoo, naa kyaana lem lee me gyaŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Me Wurubuarɛ na me Gbeŋgyoo, yoo fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">koro seŋ wosi n wose, na n ke yako me nombia fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, yela maa di deŋele lee n katenee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">naa yele baa nyaŋee lee me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Naa yele baa yako nyi, &lt;&lt;Mbo, kei yɛna keŋ dɛɛ gyae,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">yaa nyi, &lt;&lt;Da te wɔlɛɛ e korakora ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Baŋ pou bɛɛ nyaŋee me kayeyɛɛ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">kekolosi na desɛŋ dɛɛ kyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:26">baŋ pou bee gyina ba wose lee maŋ dɔɔ nɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">sia dɛɛ yeŋ na desɛŋ kekyaŋ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Mɔna yela baŋ me katenee ba gyoo be sia nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">ka mo gyoŋ na kenyaŋee fae yeesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:27">na baa yako debaŋ kamasɛ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo boe, ɔ ne yele abɔɔ ne gyu nideli fa ɔ tobaale.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Me laakem gyae ke kolosi n katenee nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">na maa lese n yele debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Walaŋ akpanyanyaŋ keyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Me dana nombii daale me konɔɔ man keŋ lee Wurubuarɛ gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">lee akpanyanyaŋte dukum keyɛɛ wose man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:1">Wurubuarɛ keyee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">be doo be man ya.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Baŋ gbagba gyaŋ na bee gyina ba wose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">beiŋ keŋ bɔɔ ne naa yaa baa kɔla dukum ya.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Be nɔɔman nombia yɛɛ akpanyanyaŋ na akɛrɛɛ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">ba te bɛɛ nyansa nombia na nombia kpaakpaa keyɛɛ yela.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Be doo ba afoŋoŋse dɔɔ koraŋ na bɛɛ bake nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">bɛɛ mo ba wose do nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">bɔɔ ne bɛɛ kpene keŋ be dei nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, n balaŋ kegyae ne lii adido adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">nya anokoare kedi mɔ ne lii ŋɔma man.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />N katenee yɛɛ ŋgba bula keŋ ka korɛɛ kela bulase pou nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">n nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ yɛɛ ŋgba ɛpo siiliŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">Degbeŋgyoo nyaŋ ne kɛɛna balaŋ na wonembia pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, n balaŋ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ na lee koya nideli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">Balaŋ ne yeu kaa gyoo n beŋkelɛɛ wuluŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Bee di be nɔɔ lee weenɛɛ ŋan be gbigi n dekpaŋalaŋ man nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">n ne fa wɔ loŋ bɛɛ nyɔɔ lee n kenyaŋee boo keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Nyaŋ yɛna nyeedoŋ pou nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">n keŋmaŋee man te dɛɛ naa keŋmaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Gyae baŋ ba gyeŋ neŋ nɛ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">na n ke yɛɛ katenee fa baŋ be konɔɔse man dei nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Naa yele baŋ bee gyina ba wose adido nɛ nae kaa tia maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">yaa akpanyanyaŋte nyiŋmaa ke gegi maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Kɛɛ mena keŋ balaŋ kumɛɛ be yale be doo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">Be te fuŋ wɔ lɔ keŋ bɔɔ ne tale baa koro ya!<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Naa yele ke takaa neŋ lee nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">yaa n sia keyɛɛ baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ keŋ be dei ya nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Nawolo nyi be gyae ke kyare ya baa boto ŋgba ŋale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">baa yekee ŋgba ŋalese nalaŋ nyiŋan nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Mo n wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ na n ke yɛɛ deeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">kyaa tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ na n ke di ke weenɛɛ wose kefɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Yela Degbeŋgyoo ayɛɛsa kagyoo n sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">na waa fa neŋ keŋ n konɔɔ ne gyae.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Mo n gbɛɛneŋ do Degbeŋgyoo nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">mo n wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ na waa yɛɛ kɛŋa,<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />waa yela n katenee ke ŋalakee ŋgba tɛɛkena nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">na n deŋele kedi ke yɛɛ ŋgba weese teŋteŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Kyaa yididi Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">na n ke nyiŋ konɔɔ daa e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">abɔɔ de dee fa baale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">te be nombiakumɛɛ kebake de kɔŋ mena fa wɔ nɛ, naa yele ke takaa neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Wɔŋ n wose lee baŋ man, na n ke tina baŋkum yela.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">naa gyeŋ baŋ ya, gyae ka mo neŋ gyu dukum man.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Nawolo nyi baa wɔlɛɛ balaŋ kumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">mɔna baŋ be loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ nɛ, baa mo tɛɛle keŋ ŋgba be dedii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Teka kyomii akpanyanyaŋtena be gyae baa tekaa kyaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">nyaŋ ke kɛo wɔ mɔna n be gyae n ke naa wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Mɔna baŋ bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose nɛ, baa mo tɛɛle keŋ bese be wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">na baa kyaa wosefɛɛreŋ man nyiŋ ba wose.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Akpanyanyaŋtena ne bake baŋ be tenɛɛ nɛ nyeeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">te ba te ŋɛɛ be kela tee wɔ,<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />mɔna Degbeŋgyoo na boŋo akpanyanyaŋtena bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">nawolo nyi ɔ gyeŋ nyi ba wee ne kɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />akpanyanyaŋtena ne wɔŋ be yoosila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">na ba te goo be baŋdaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:14">nyi baa wɔŋ ayematena na baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya nɛ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">na baa ko baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Mɔna be yoosilase ŋan gyae ke sɔkee baŋ gbagba konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">na be baŋdaŋse ŋan ke tekerii.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Kolobii keŋ walaŋ ŋon ɔ gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ dana nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">dei kela akpanyanyaŋtena abɔɔ burum ŋan be dana.<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Degbeŋgyoo waa yɔkɔse akpanyanyaŋtena baameŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">mɔna waa kɛɛ baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛna baŋ nombiikum be doo be man ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">te be dedii gyae ke doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Nyi nombiikum de yala wɔ na, baa seŋ keŋkeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">Tanam ke yala man na, baa nyiŋ weenɛɛ burum.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Mɔna akpanyanyaŋte waa munu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">ŋgba mena keŋ weese ne yele kyeŋkyeŋkɔɔse ne kpiisi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">baa ŋaalaa pou ŋgba nyɔɔse nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Akpanyanyaŋte ne paa kolo te ɔ bɛɛ tɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">mɔna walaŋ ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ ne faa lee ɔ konɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Baŋ Degbeŋgyoo be hiraa wɔ nɛ, baa mo tɛɛle keŋ ŋgba be dedii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">mɔna baŋ ɔ be falaa wɔ nɛ baa munu.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Walaŋ ŋon Degbeŋgyoo nombia na gyoo ɔ sia nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">waa kɛɛ ɔ nawɔɔ kekulu man.<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Nyi ɔ gyɔ ɔ nae koraŋ na, ɔ be gyae waa yala ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo dana e ɔ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Nafɔ me yɛɛ bu e, nɛnɛɛ me ta bee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">mɔna ma te naata nyi ba te bɛɛ walaŋ ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">yaa nyi ɔ bia keta solee weenɛɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Bɛɛ yɛɛ wɔe debaŋ kamasɛ, bɛɛ paa balaŋ abɔɔ lee be konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">mena dɔɔ baa hiraa be bia.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Wɔŋ n wose lee nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ man, na n ke yɛɛ deeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">na n ke kyaa tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo ne gyae baŋ be nombia doona ke gbɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">ɔ be gyae waa bɛɛ ɔ balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 37:28" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">Waa wɔlɛɛ baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ nombia kumɛɛ nɛ korakora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">waa munu akpanyanyaŋte duuluŋ man balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa mo tɛɛle keŋ bese be wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">na baa kyaa ke dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ na mo be nɔɔse kolosi nyansa nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">te be laakemse ne kolosi nombia ŋan doona ŋe gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Be Wurubuarɛ mmaraa doo be konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">te be nawɔɔ bɛɛ sarakee ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛre na deke ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">ɔ ne gyae nyi waa ko e,<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />mɔna Degbeŋgyoo be gyae waa yela akpanyanyaŋtena ke di be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">yaa baa bu wɔ fɔɔ nombia dedii man ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Daa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">na n ke ta ɔ gbɛɛneŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:34">Waa gyina neŋ adido, na n ka mo tɛɛle yɛɛ n dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">akpaa be wɔlɛɛ akpanyanyaŋtena na, nyaŋ kena ke.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Ma te naa akpanyanyaŋte na nyeeman doŋte ŋolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">ŋon ɔ be nyiŋ ɔ wose ŋgba daŋ keŋ seŋɛɛ tɛɛle kpaakpaa dɔɔ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />te kyare ya na, ɔ be kyaa bela ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">me kaa kɛo e mɔna ma te naa e bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Mo n sia kɛɛ walaŋ ŋon nombiikum be doo ɔ man ya, na n ka gyene ŋon ɔ gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">n kena nyi be duuluŋ man balaŋ baa kyaa wosefɛɛreŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Mɔna baa wɔlɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">bɔɔ gyae baa nyiŋ duuluŋmantena ya.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Degbeŋgyoo ne lɛɛna baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">nyi ba wose de kyaŋ wɔ na, ŋon te bee yeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kyɔ wɔ na ɔ te lɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">ɔ ne lɛɛ wɔ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man, na ɔ te lɛɛ ba nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">nawolo nyi ŋon te bee yeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide kasola nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa kalena maŋ n baŋ man</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">yaa n ka mo n baŋ nedoŋ wɔŋ ma deŋele ya.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />N baŋdaŋ nyeela te sɔkee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">te n baam gyɔɔ maŋ lɔ.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Lee n baŋ dɔɔ ma wose be dana maŋ doŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">lee me dukum dɔɔ, doŋ be doo me ŋɔɔ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Me dukum ta bese kasolɔ ma nyee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">ŋgba kasolɔ yuŋte keŋ mɔɔ tale seele ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Me gyamɛɛ ta poŋporoŋ na lee wɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">lee me nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Me te tisi buŋ te ma teneewɔ doo tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">wee dibiliŋ pou na me dɔŋ mee di waraŋsa.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Kpaŋalaŋ te gyɔ maŋ te ma wose pou na wee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">kawee dana maŋ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Ma te yɔkɔse te doŋ be doo me man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">mɛɛ keketee nawolo nyi mee nyii weeleŋ me konɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, n gyeŋ ŋan pou mɛɛ gyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">n ne nyii me kakeŋee.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Me wɔe ne lɔ maŋ, te me doŋ mɔ te taŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">detiŋtɛɛ gba ta gyoo me sia.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Me gyamɛɛ dɔɔ me gyoona na me dɔɔna te bɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">ma loŋtona mɔ bɛɛ tekaa benaa maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa ko maŋ nɛ te nyɔɔ maŋ kɔtase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">baŋ bɛɛ gyae maŋ dukum nɛ ne kolosi lee ma kewɔlɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">wee dibiliŋ pou na bɛɛ bake ma nyeeman di dekara.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Me yɛɛ ŋgba deŋela atɔɔsate ŋon ɔ bee nyii ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">yaa ŋgba omumuu ŋon ɔ be tale kolosi ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Ma te yɛɛ ŋgba walaŋ ŋon ɔ bee nyii ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">te ɔ be tale tiranɔɔ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ kɛɛ n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, nyaŋ ne gyaela n ke tiranɔɔ fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Nawolo nyi me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyi akpaa me sarakee nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">naa yela baa nyaŋee yaa baa gate ba wose me dɔɔ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Nawolo nyi mɛɛ gyae maa lee yala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">mee nyii weeleŋ debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Me ta toro me nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ yako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">ta wee maŋ ŋgba mɔɔ yɛɛ dukum nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Balaŋ burum te kaa bese me kɔlara keŋ ma te yɛɛ wɔ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ yakaa nɛ boe nideli.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Baŋ bɛɛ mo dukum tɔ maŋ me deeli keyɛɛ kom nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">ne kɛrɛɛ nombia gyakaa me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">keŋ mɛɛ gyae maa yɛɛ nombia kpaakpaa dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa bɛɛ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">me Wurubuarɛ, naa kyaana lem lee me gyaŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Me Gbeŋgyoo na ma nyeelɛɛre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">kɔŋ bileŋ na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Kaalete kasola</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;Maa kɛɛ ma keta man nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">nyi mɔɔ mo me laakem kolosi dukum ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:1">Maa do me nɔɔ dokɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">debaŋ keŋ me kyaa akpanyanyaŋtena man nɛ.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Mena dɔɔ me wuu me nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">keŋ ma te kolosi nombii kpaakpaa daale ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:2">mɔna mɛɛ bese nyii weeleŋ kpu.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Me wɔe ne lɔ maŋ bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:3">Nyi ma gyoo ke man nɛ, na me wɔe gyakaa ne lɔ maŋ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">keŋte me gyuusu me nɔɔ kolosi nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, wola maŋ ma nyeedoŋ ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">na ma weeya yaanɔɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">yela maa gyeŋ mena keŋ ma weeya ne yeu.<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />N te kɔɔkee ma weeya yɛɛ ŋgba nyiŋmaa tale man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">ma weeya te yɛɛ kolo ke n siaman ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:5">Walaŋ kamasɛ wɔɛ ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">mo kpuna baŋ ne yɛɛ wɔ nyi be te nyiŋ ba wose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Kɛɛ, ke yɛɛ ampaŋ nyi walaŋ kamasɛ dɔŋ bo ŋgba wɔŋtaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">bee gelee abɔɔ burum bo see yakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">mɔna bɔɔ gyeŋ ŋon waa kaa mo ŋa wee daale ya.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />&lt;Mɔna nɛnɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo, woŋ yaa mɛɛ kɛɛ gbɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Me ta mo me loo gyakaa n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee me nombiakumɛɛ pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">naa yele ayiŋtena ke kulu maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Me wuu me nɔɔ, keŋ me te gyuusu me nɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna ŋon n be yɛɛ kei.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Lese n dambila keŋ lee me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">n ketuku keŋ ta yee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Akpaa n kalena ŋolo te n wɔŋ ɔ deŋele lee ɔ dukum dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">n ne wɔlɛɛ ɔ dedii ŋgba paapaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">ke yɛɛ ampaŋ nyi walaŋ kamasɛ yɛɛ ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo, nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">na n ke tei me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">naa tɔ n deŋela lee me kewii baake dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">Me kyaa n gyaŋ bo ŋgba ŋɔɔle nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">me yɛɛ ŋɔɔle e ŋgba me naanaɔ pou nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Lese n sia lee me dɔɔ, na ma wose ke fɛɛ maŋ kyomii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">pɛna maa lee kɛbo, keŋ bɔɔ naa maŋ bela ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Me nyiŋa konɔɔ kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">ɔ besenaa ɔ sia tee maŋ te ɔ nyii me kewii.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Ɔ lese maŋ lee bɔɔ keŋ ne sarakee nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">lee depate tɛɛle keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:2">ɔ moo maŋ ka seŋ kpanaŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">te ɔ faa maŋ daseŋae kpaakpaa.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Ɔ moo nɔɔneŋ wɔle do me nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">nɔɔneŋ keŋ maa kpee lese Wurubuarɛ yele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Balaŋ burum baa naa na baa yee Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">na baa mo be loo gyakaa ɔ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Walaŋ ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ɔ na mo ɔ wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:4">te ɔ bɛɛ mo ɔ sia gyakaa baŋ bee gyina ba wose dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">yaa baŋ bɛɛ bese be wɔle kasom akɛrɛɛ wurubuarɛse ya nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">n gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">na abɔɔ ŋan n be bake nyi nyaŋ ke yɛɛ fa daa nɛ boe burum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">Ŋolo be kyaa keŋ baa mo maana neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">akpaa me yako nyi maa kaŋtee nya ayɛɛsa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ŋolo be tale kala ŋa ya.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Kedeesase na abɔɔ kefa bɛɛ gyoo n sia ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">mɔna n ta toro ma deŋela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">n bɛɛ bɔɔse katoo kedeesase na dukum kedeesase ya.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Keŋte me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Maŋ yaa, ma te kɔŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">Ba te ŋmarase ma wose man nombia do tɔne keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Me Wurubuarɛ, mɛɛ gyae nyi maa yɛɛ n kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">nyaŋ mmaraa keŋ doo me konɔɔ man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Ma te kolosi n nyeekelɛɛ nombia ŋan balaŋ burum degyaŋee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">Degbeŋgyoo, me te wuu me nɔɔ nyi mɔɔ kolosi ŋa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">ŋgba mena keŋ n gyeŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Me ta mo n katenee weese me konɔɔ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">me kolosi nya anokoare na n nyeekelɛɛ nombia ŋan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">me te wuu n kegyae na nya anokoare nombia ŋan dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">balaŋ burum degyaŋee man ya.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa lese n waraŋase kewii lee me dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">yela n kegyae na nya anokoare kedi ke gyee maŋ debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Nawolo nyi nombiakumɛɛ ŋan ŋolo be tale kala ya, te kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">me dukum ta boo kela maŋ te mɔɔ ne naa ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Ŋa boe kela ma nyeenyɔɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">ŋa te yele ma woo te yeu lee me gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela me nombia ka gyoo n sia na n ke lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">Degbeŋgyoo, yɛɛ bileŋ na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae ma yeŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">na kekolosi ka gyoo wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:14">yela baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae ma kewɔlɛɛ nɛ, ka mo desɛŋ bese be wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Yela baŋ pou bɛɛ yako maŋ nyi, &lt;Mbo, mbo&gt; nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">nɔɔ ke doo wɔ lee ba desɛŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Yela baŋ pou bɛɛ kɛo neŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">ke nyaŋee na ke yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ lee nyaŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">yela baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae n nyeekelɛɛ nɛ, ke yako debaŋ kamasɛ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">Degbeŋgyoo boe.<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, me yɛɛ diyemte e, te me nombia dana waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo na gyueŋ me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">nyaŋ ne kyɔɔna maŋ te n ne lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ, naa dɔɔ wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane kawee man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Baŋ bee wii ayematena nɛ, baŋna nyeebam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">Degbeŋgyoo ne lɛɛ wɔ ba wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛ be dɔɔ te ɔ ne yele bɛɛ kyaa kyare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">bɛɛ kala wɔ kpuna baŋ Degbeŋgyoo be hiraa wɔ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">ɔ bɛɛ mo wɔ do be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man ya.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛ be dɔɔ be kawee dofoŋoŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">te ɔ ne yele bee nyiŋ doŋ koro be kawee dofoŋoŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">kyɔ maŋ kawee, nawolo nyi ma te yɛɛ dukum tia neŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Me kɔlara ne kolosi nombia kumɛɛ lee ma wose man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">&lt;&lt;Woromɔ yaa waa yeŋ na ɔ yele ka yo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Akpaa be man ŋolo de kɔŋ kaa naa maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">ɔ na beo gyaabii maŋ, mɔna akɛrɛɛ nombia doo ɔ konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">na ɔ ta mo ma wose man nombia gyu ɔ ne kili.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Me kɔlara pou ne kolosi ma wose man nombia adadawoya man fa dɔŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">bɛɛ gyueŋ ma wose man dukum yako nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />&lt;&lt;Yeŋ kawee te gyɔ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">ɔ be gyae waa koro ɔ dofoŋoŋ keŋ dɔɔ ɔ doo nɛ bela ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Me dɔɔ gbagba koraŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ŋon mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:9">ŋon daa na e na do nyiŋmaa di nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ta besena ɔ wɔle tee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Mɔna nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">na n ke gate maŋ na maa nyiŋ tɔ wɔ kom.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Ma gyeŋ nyi me nombia na gyoo n sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">nawolo nyi me kɔlara be gyae baa di me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Lee me nombia kpaakpaa keyɛɛ dɔɔ n gate maŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">te n moo maŋ see n siaman kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo Iseraetena Wurubuarɛ ŋon yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PSA 41:13">Dɛɛkɔŋ mena, ayi, Dɛɛkɔŋ mena.<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">Tɔne Alate</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 42-72">Nɔɔneŋ 42—72</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋon ɔ doo yoogbeŋiri man nɛ kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Mena keŋ ŋaa ne yase ɔ sia kɛo boo man loŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">mena ke yaa ma woo ne kɛo nyaŋ me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Wurubuarɛ, ŋon ɔ yɛɛ nyeedoŋ Wurubuarɛ e nɛ loŋboaneŋ na ko ma woo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">Woromɔ yaa maa gyu kena Wurubuarɛ siaman?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Me siasaraŋ ta bese me weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">nelim na ka weese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:3">na balaŋ ne bɔɔse maŋ debaŋ kamasɛ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">&lt;&lt;N Wurubuarɛ ŋon kyaa aleŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Mɛɛ tɔɔse nombia kɛŋa pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">debaŋ keŋ mɛɛ gyoo ma wose man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">na mena keŋ daa na balaŋ dikpii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ne tɛɛ gyu Wurubuarɛ dɛɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">Daa na balaŋ burum na mo kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ lese Wurubuarɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">nɔɔkedi kpaakpaa man.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Ma woo, weera te n yala koyololo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Weera te n ne mutii me man?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Mo n loo gyakaa Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">nawolo nyi maa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">nyi ŋon yɛna ma nyeelɛɛre na me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Ma woo ne mutii me man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">mena dɔɔ maa tɔɔse neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6">lee Yɔɔdan tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">lee Hɛremon na Misare bulase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Siiliŋ ne baake siiliŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">lee loŋ keŋ ne gyɔɔ koro nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:7">ke kakpela na loŋse pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">te wuu me dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Tɛɛ de naa na Degbeŋgyoo na lese ɔ kegyae wola maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">nelim na mee kpee ɔ nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">na ma te fane fa Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne fa maŋ nyeedoŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Me bɔɔse Wurubuarɛ, me kpanaŋ ŋon nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">&lt;&lt;Weera te n wolee maŋ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:9">Weera te me kɔlara na ŋere maŋ do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">te me dɔŋ mee di waraŋsa?<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Me ŋɔɔ ne nyii weeleŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">lee me kɔlara kee kulu maŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:10">debaŋ kamasɛ na bɛɛ bɔɔse maŋ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">&lt;&lt;N Wurubuarɛ ŋon kyaa aleŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Ma woo, weera te n yala koyololo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Weera te n ne mutii me man?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Mo n loo gyakaa Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">nawolo nyi maa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">nyi ŋon yɛna ma nyeelɛɛre na me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋon ɔ doo yoogbeŋiri man kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Ao me Wurubuarɛ, fa maŋ deŋele kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">na n ke di me nombia fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">lee tɛɛlese baŋ bɔɔ ne yee Wurubuarɛ ya nɛ gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:1">Lɛɛ maŋ lee balaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">be yɛɛ akɛrɛɛtenawɔ na akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon mee yeu kagyoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">Weera te n bɛɛ maŋ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:2">Woŋ dɔɔ te maa ta na mee mutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">lee keŋ me kɔlara ba ŋere maŋ do dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Kpila n keŋmaŋee na nya anokoare keŋ kaa lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">yela ŋe kaa ta me siaman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:3">yela ŋe ka mo maŋ kɔŋ n bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">botɔɔ keŋ n kyaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Kenaŋ na maa gyu Wurubuarɛ kedeesaboe keŋ gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">maa gyu Wurubuarɛ ŋon mɛɛ nyaŋee te me sia na gye ɔ dɔɔ nɛ gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:4">Maa gyɔ adolɛɛ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">Oo Wurubuarɛ, me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Ma woo, weera te n yala koyololo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Weera te n ne mutii me man?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Mo n loo gyakaa Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">nawolo nyi maa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">nyi ŋon yɛna ma nyeelɛɛre na me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, de nyii ke na da deŋela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">de naanaɔ yako daa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:1">ŋan n be yɛɛ ba debaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">abɔɔ ŋan n be yɛɛ beneŋ beneŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />N moo n doŋ gegi tɛɛlese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">te n yelaa de naanaɔ kyaa gbeli botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">n yaasee balaŋ baŋ botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">te n yelaa de naanaɔ nyiŋa ba wose botɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Na be yoosila te ba moowɔ lɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">yaa be doŋ te ba moowɔ yoodi ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">mɔna n doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">na n siagbɛɛ keŋmaŋee keŋ lɛɛna wɔ, nawolo nyi n ne gyae wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Nyaŋ yɛna me gyoo na me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">nyaŋ yelela Yakɔbe yoowɔ di.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />N dɔɔ te de tɛɛwɔ tɛɛse de kɔlara lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">n yele man te de tɛɛwɔ sakatee de kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Me ta mo ma wose lɔ me baŋdaŋ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">te me yoosila be gyae ke yela maa yoodi ya.<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Mɔna n yelaa de dii de kɔlara dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">n yelaa desɛŋ kyaŋa baŋ bɛɛ kɔla daa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Wurubuarɛ man te dee gyina da wose wee kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">te dɛɛ lese n yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Mɔna nɛnɛɛ n te bɛɛ daa te n yɔkɔse daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">n bɛɛ tekaa sila de yoonɔɔtena gyu ya.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />N yelaa de yeuwɔ lee de kɔlara gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">te baŋ bɛɛ kɔla daa nɛ nyiŋa da abɔɔ kuu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />N moo daa fa nyi baa ko ŋgba namense nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">te n yaasee daa do tɛɛlese man.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />N te yɔɔ n balaŋ koyadoŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">te n te nyiŋ kolo lee ba keyɔɔ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />N te yele baŋ be kyaa benaana daa nɛ na boŋo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">baŋ be kyaa benaana daa nɛ ne kulu daa na bɛɛ boŋo daa.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />N te yele tɛɛlese bɛɛ tekaa mo daa yɛɛ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">be naa daa na bee kpiisi ba nyeeya.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Wee dibiliŋ pou na me doo bo sia kayeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15">te desɛŋ te wuu me siagbɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />lee baŋ bee kulu maŋ te bɛɛ boŋo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">na me kɔlara baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa tɔ maŋ kom nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Doo nyi da te wolee neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">da te bɛɛ nyi dɔɔ di n nɔɔkebakesee keŋ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">mɔna kɛŋa pou ne kɔŋ de dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />De konɔɔse ta lee n wɔle ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">te de nawɔɔ mɔ te kpase lee n gbɛɛ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Mɔna n te yɛlɛɛ daa kerekere gbougbouse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">te n moo detiŋtɛɛ tuum wuu de dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Nyi deŋ wolee de Wurubuarɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">yaa deŋ gyinaa de nyiŋmaase tee wurubuarɛ wɔle ŋolo na,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />nafɔ Wurubuarɛ ba gyem yee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">Nawolo nyi ɔ gyeŋ konɔɔ man nombia aweeseŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Mɔna lee nyaŋ dɔɔ be gyakaa bɛɛ koe daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">bɛɛ kɛɛ daa ŋgba namense baŋ bee gyu be kaa ko wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Degbeŋgyoo, foŋ. Weera te n doowɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Wosi n wose. Naa bɛɛ daa kekpaakekpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Weera te n moo n sia weese daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">te n wolee da diyem kena na be kɛɛ ŋere daa do?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Ba te wɔŋ daa lɔ akuŋkuŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">te da te dɔɔ tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Koro na n ke kyɔ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">lɛɛ daa lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Alowɔle keyɛɛ nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Nombii kpaakpaa daale te wulu me konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">keŋ mɛɛ gyae maa yako lee gyoo wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">me laakem gyae ke taŋee ŋgba ŋon ɔ gyeŋ keŋmarase nideli nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Nyaŋ leena tobiiri baala pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">n nɔɔ te kare nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ te hiraa neŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Nyaŋ baalebu, kpaŋ n yoosila n teŋa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">na n ka do gyoorobiiri na yele kelɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Mo n yele kelɛɛ ta gyu n siaman keyoodi man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">na n ke yoo lɛɛ anokoare na wose keyɔkɔse na nombia ŋan doona ŋe gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">yela n doŋ ka wola gyakoloŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Yela n baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋan na bee nideli nɛ ke sɔɔ gyoo kɔlara konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">yela tɛɛlese ke yala n nawɔɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Oo Wurubuarɛ, n gyoori gyae ke kyaa kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">n gyooro gbutu keŋ yɛɛ gyooro gbutu keŋ gyae ke di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />N ne gyae katenee, te n ne kɔla akpanyanyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">mena dɔɔ te Wurubuarɛ n Wurubuarɛ moo kenyaŋee nuŋ tiu neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">kela nya akoso pou.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Adudo na pɛperɛ na abɔɔ ofoŋnyiŋan na lee ofoŋ n kegbase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">na n gyooro dekpaŋalaŋ keŋ bɔɔ mo tuukela desina ke nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:8">nɔɔneŋ ŋan bɛɛ mo adolɛɛse gyɔ nɛ ne yɛɛ neŋ gyoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Gyoo bia alebia kpuɛ ala baŋ be dana obuo nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">gyoo wɛɛle doona Ofiiri kɔba yayam abɔɔ ɔ seŋɛɛ n dunoluŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Alebu, tei na n ka see deŋele nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">wolee n balaŋ na n kya dekpaŋalaŋmantena.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Yela gyoo kena n kyeo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">mo obuo fa e nawolo nyi ŋon yɛna n gbeŋgyoo.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Tirotena baa mo abɔɔ kefa kɔna neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">baŋ be dana kɔba nɛ baa kɔŋ nyi nyaa wii wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Gyoo bu alebu waa gyoo ɔ deni man gyoorobiiri man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">kɔba yayam ŋmeeseŋ te ba moowɔ gbili ɔ kegba wurikyim keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Ɔ doona kegba keŋ ka loŋse yɛɛ kpookpoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">ɔ tebia alebia keteŋse silana e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">te ba moo e gyina gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Ba moo kenyaŋee na gyoŋ kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">kaa gyoo gyooro dekpaŋalaŋ keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />N bia tewulɛɛ baa kyaa be kyaɔ nawɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">n ka mo wɔ see gyooneŋ tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Maa yela baa tɔɔse n yele kalola kegyakaare pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">mena dɔɔ tɛɛlese baa lese n yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ kpuɛna daa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Wurubuarɛ yɛna da keyeu kagyoo na de doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">ɔ ne kyɔ daa debaŋ kamasɛ da wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Mena dɔɔ akpaa tɛɛle de wosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">te bulase de kulii ke yala gyoo ɛpo tɔɔman,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />te ke man loŋ da koro yɛɛ afofose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">te bulase de wosi koraŋ na dɔɔ yee ya.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Boo daale kyaa keŋ ke boŋobiise ne yele Wurubuarɛ donɔɔ dinaa sia na gye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">botɔɔ yɛna Adidote ŋon dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Wurubuarɛ kyaa ke man, ka be gyae ke yala ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">Wurubuarɛ waa lɛɛ e tɛɛ kɛɛ bee kena man.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Tɛɛlese na koro wosi ba wose na gyooridediise te yale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">ɔ ne gyina ɔ woya na tɛɛle te yalakee.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere ŋon kpuɛna daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon yɛna da keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Ɛ kɔŋ kaa kɛɛ keŋ Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">ɛ kaa kɛɛ mena keŋ ɔ be wɔlɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Ɔ ne yele yoose ne kɔŋ ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">kelii tɛɛle ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:9">ɔ ne tekerii baŋdaŋse na apiase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">ɔ na too yoo nyeele pampasaŋse.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />Ɔ kpa nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɛ yɛɛ yididi, na ɛ ka gyeŋ nyi maŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">tɛɛlese balaŋ baa gyina maŋ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">baa gyina maŋ adido tɛɛle dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere ŋon kpuɛna daa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon yɛna da keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ gyoo dinaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Ɛ gyɔ ɛ nyiŋmaase, tɛɛlese pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">ɛ mo kenyaŋee yeesa lese Wurubuarɛ yele.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo Adidote ŋon wose dana gyakoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">ŋon yɛna gyoo dinaa tɛɛle kei pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Ɔ te yɔkɔse tɛɛlese do de tɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">ɔ moo balaŋ do de nawɔɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Ɔ ta lese de dedii fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">keŋ ke yɛɛ Yakɔbe ŋon ɔ ne gyae e nɛ wose kegate.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Wurubuarɛ ta mo kenyaŋee yeesa gyu adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">Degbeŋgyoo ta mo kaberɛse kewii gyu adido.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Wurubuarɛ yele, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese de gyoo yele, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele,<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ ne diina gyoori tɛɛle kei pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">ɛ mo alagyia kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Wurubuarɛ ne diina gyoori tɛɛlese dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">Wurubuarɛ kyaa ɔ gyooro gbeli fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Tɛɛlese kegyiise pou ne kaa yilaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">ŋgba Aberaham Wurubuarɛ balaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">nawolo nyi tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyooneŋ pou yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">be te gyina e adido nideli.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Siyɔn, Degbeŋgyoo donɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Degbeŋgyoo boe, ɔ kaboena nyi baa lese ɔ yele nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">de Wurubuarɛ donɔɔ dinaa keŋ, na ɔ bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Ke yɛɛ dekyae keŋ ke dana kyeo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">tɛɛle kei balaŋ pou ne nyaŋee lee ke dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:2">Siyɔn bula keŋ kyaa adogbɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">yɛna gyoo dinaa ŋon donɔɔ dinaa.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Wurubuarɛ kyaa ɔ dekagya keŋ man botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">ɔ ta lese wola nyi ŋon yɛna ŋon ɔ ne gyee donɔɔ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Kɛɛ, gyooneŋ te kaa gyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">ba te bake gbegyase bee gyu,<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />be naa e te ba wose gbirisi wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">gyakoloŋ gyoo wɔ te be yekiiwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Gyakoloŋ gyoo wɔ botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">te be nyii weeleŋ ŋgba alo kadoŋee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />N wɔlɛɛ wɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">ŋgba mena keŋ ado yenaŋ feliŋ ne gyɔ Taresisi pantuuse wɔlɛɛ ŋa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Mena keŋ dɔɔ nyii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">mena ke te de naawɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere ŋon donɔɔ dinaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">Wurubuarɛ donɔɔ dinaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">Wurubuarɛ ne yele ɔ ne kyaa gbeli nideli.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Wurubuarɛ, dɛɛ tɔɔse n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Oo Wurubuarɛ, mena keŋ n yele be lɛɛ tɛɛle pou nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">mena te baa lese n yele tɛɛle pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">katenee te wulu n nyiŋmaa dunoluŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Baŋ be kyaa Siyɔn bula dɔɔ nɛ ne nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">yela ke yɛɛ baŋ be kyaa Yuda nɛ gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">lee n nombia kedi keŋ doona ke gbɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Ɛ ta kilisi Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">ɛ kala wa akagyase.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />ɛ mo ɛ sia kɛɛ wa akyaŋse ŋan nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">ɛ gyene wa akagyase ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:13">na ɛ ka mo yako ɛ kalola kegyakaare man bia baŋ baa kɔŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ kei yɛna de Wurubuarɛ kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">waa yɛɛ de gyeere da kekyaabii man pou.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Diyiŋ nombia ŋan doo loo kamo gyakaa wose kenyiŋ dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Ɛmɛɛ balaŋ pou ɛ nyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">ɛmɛɛ baŋ pou ɛ kyaa tɛɛle kei dɔɔ nɛ ɛ tei,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />balaŋ yakaa nyibaŋ na kegyiise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">kɔbatena na ayematena pou.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Me nɔɔ gyae ke kolosi nyansa nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">nombia ŋan doo me konɔɔ man, gyae ke yela ɛ ke nyii nombia man.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Maa see deŋele maa nyii dudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">maa mo adolɛɛ kegyɔ lese ma deboloo man.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Nyi weeya kumɛɛ de kɔŋ na woŋ dɔɔ te maa yee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">nyi akpanyanyaŋtena baŋ bɛɛ beo balaŋ de kilisi maŋ<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />baŋ bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ ba wose kenyiŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">te bee gyina ba wose lee be kɔba keŋ be dana beiŋ dɔɔ nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Ŋolo be tale tɔ ɔ dɔɔ nyeeman kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">yaa waa mo kolo fa Wurubuarɛ mo lɛɛ ba nyee ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />Nawolo nyi nyeeman kom ketɔ keŋ dana koyadoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">keŋ ŋolo be tale tɔ ke,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />na waa kyaa kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">nyi ɔ ba gyoo yebɔɔ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Nawolo nyi dɛɛ naa nyi siakaralatena na yem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">mena te ayiŋtena na baŋ bɔɔ gyeŋ daale ya nɛ na yem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">na be te tina ba wose kenyiŋ see balaŋ wɔlɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Nafɔ baŋ gbagba dana tɛɛlese ba wose dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">mɔna nɛnɛɛ ba yebɔɔse ta bese be dɛɛse kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">keŋ baa kyaa botɔɔ be kalola kegyakaarese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Denibalaŋ na ba wosekenyiŋ koraŋ nɛ, bɔɔ gyae baa kyaa kyare ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">be yɛɛ ŋgba wonembia baŋ bɛɛ yekee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Mena ne gyaela kekɔŋ baŋ bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ baŋ gbagba dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">na baŋ be silana wɔ, te baŋ mɔ na mo ba wose lɔ be dɔɔ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Be yɛɛ ŋgba namense nɛ, ba te kpaŋ wɔ fa yeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">yeŋ ne gyaela ke kɛɛ be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">(mɔna baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ baa di be dɔɔ nebo).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:14">Be dinɔɔ gyae ke wɔlɛɛ yebɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">baa kyaa lemlem lee be gyooro akpaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Mɔna Wurubuarɛ waa lɛɛ ma nyee lee woyadɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">ke yɛɛ ampaŋ nyi waa mo maŋ gyu ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Nyi akpaa ŋolo de nyiŋ kɔba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">te ɔ nyiŋ akpaŋalaŋ kpaakpaa nɛ, naa yee ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Nawolo nyi akpaa ɔ yem na, ɔ be gyae waa mo kolo gyu ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">ɔ wose kenyiŋ be gyae ke sila e gyu ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Doo nyi ɔ kekyaa man na ɔ ne kɛlɛɛ ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">te balaŋ lese ɔ yele lee ɔ wose kenyiŋ dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />mɔna baa gyu ke tuŋ be naanaɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">bɔɔ gyae baa naa keŋmaŋee bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Balaŋ baŋ be dana ba wose, mɔna bɔɔ ne nyii nombia man ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">wɔɛ ŋgba wonembia baŋ bɛɛ yekee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Asafe nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">ne kolosi baake balaŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">lee weese dɛɛlee kelii weese dɛɛyalae.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Wurubuarɛ ne ŋalakee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">lee Siyɔn donɔɔ keŋ ke dana kyeo nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />De Wurubuarɛ ne kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ɔ be gyae waa yɛɛ yididi ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:3">boalaŋ degyapaa ne kpaa ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">te feliŋ dinaa mɔ te kilisi e.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Ɔ baake adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">na tɛɛle na waa di ɔ balaŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Ɛ yilaa balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ kɛwɔ fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">baŋ daa na wɔ be tɛɛ kedeesa dɔɔ yɛɛ nɔɔkebakesee nɛ.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Adido ne gyɔ ɔ nombia ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ ne di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />Ɛ tei maŋ, me balaŋ, na maa kolosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">mɛɛ gyae ma kolosi tia nyaŋ Iserae.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">Maŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ, n Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Na n kedeesase dɔɔ te mee kolosi tia neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">yaa n katoo kedeesase ŋan doo me siaman debaŋ kamasɛ nɛ dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Mɔɔ ne gyae nunkyue baale lee n dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">yaa asoose lee n debɔɔlɔɔ man ya,<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />nawolo nyi laaman wonembia pou yɛɛ me wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">te nunkyuese baŋ be kyaa bulasebia kakpoŋ dɔɔ pou yɛɛ me wui.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Ma gyeŋ gyebuse baŋ be kyaa bulase dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">te wonembia baŋ be dɔŋ ŋale man yɛɛ me wui.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Nyi akpaa tanam na ko maŋ nɛ, mɔɔ gyae maa yako neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">nawolo nyi tɛɛle kei na abɔɔ ŋan doo ke man pou yɛɛ me wui.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Mɛɛ tao nunkyuese naane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">yaa mɛɛ nyɔɔ asoose fatabo?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Ɛ mo karaŋ kefa deesi fa Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">na ɛ ke tɔ ya alaŋaŋ fa Adidote ŋon,<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />baake maŋ n wose kekyaŋ wee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">maa lɛɛ neŋ na n ka mo obuo fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Mɔna Wurubuarɛ yako akpanyanyaŋte nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:16">&lt;Gbɛɛ woŋti yaa n dana nyi n ke kala maŋ mmaraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">yaa n ka mo n nɔɔ kolosi me nɔɔkebakesee keŋ?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />N te bɛɛ nyi n be di ma mmaraase dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">te n moo me nombia nyaana n yii.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Akpaa n naa ŋmɛɛlate na, n na mo e dɔɔre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">n na mo n wose dona yale wɔlɛɛra.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />N nɔɔ na mo neŋ gyu dukum man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">te n na mo n laakem dii akɛrɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />N ne tisi kyaa kolosi tia n loŋtona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">n ne wɔlɛɛ n naa lolobu.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />N yɛɛ nombia kɛŋa pou te me yɛɛwɔ yididi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">te n gyeŋ nyi me yɛɛ ŋgba nyaŋ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">Mɔ nɛnɛɛ maa kyaŋ neŋ kyaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">na maa kalana neŋ debɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ be wolee Wurubuarɛ nɛ ɛ gyoo ke man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">na mena ya na maa tirii ŋon kyekpakyekpa, keŋ ŋolo be kyaa waa lɛɛ ŋon ya.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Baŋ bɛɛ mo karaŋ kefa deesi fa maŋ nɛ na mo obuo fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">maa lɛɛ ŋon ɔ gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ nyee.<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane sola dukum kamo kyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:1">lee n waraŋase kewii beiŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">gberaa me dukum leki.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Faafo ma ayimɛɛ pou leki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">na n ka feefo me dukum kamasɛ lee ma wose man.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Nawolo nyi ma gyeŋ me nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">te me dukum mɔ doo me siaman wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Nyaageŋ, nyaŋ nyaageŋ kooŋ te me yɛɛ dukum tia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">te me yɛɛ kolo kum n sia man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:4">mena dɔɔ nyi n bu maŋ fɔɔ na n nombia dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">nyi n di me nombia na, n nombia doona ke gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Ampaŋ ba lola maŋ bo dukum man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">dukum man te me naa kyaŋa maŋ fulu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Mɔna n gyaewɔ nyi ma kedoo me naa tɔɔ man koraŋ na, maa di anokoare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">n wola maŋ nyansa botɔɔ keŋ ma weesɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Mo agyora gberaa maŋ na maa lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">faafo maŋ na maa wolose kela akaralɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Yela maa nyii kenyaŋee na gyoŋkedi nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">yela ma wose keŋ be tekerii maŋ nɛ, ke nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Kyaŋ n sia wuu lee me dukum dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">na n ka feefo me nombiakumɛɛ pou.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, mo konɔɔ fereŋkyeŋte do maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">na n ka mo feliŋ kpaakpaate do maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Naa gegi maŋ lee n siaman ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">te naa lese n feliŋ fereŋkyeŋ ŋon lee me man ya.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Yela maa nyiŋ kenyaŋee keŋ doo n nyeekelɛɛ man bela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">na n ke fa maŋ kegyaebii feliŋ, na maa nyii n dei.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Kenaŋ na maa wola nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra n gbɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">na dukum yɛɛra ka bese kɔŋ n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, lɛɛ maŋ lee balaŋ kako fɔɔ kedi man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ma nyeelɛɛre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">na maa kpee n katenee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Degbeŋgyoo, gyuusu me nɔɔsebia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">na me nɔɔ ka toro n yele kalese yako.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Kedeesa bɛɛ gyoo n sia ya, nafɔ maa mo ŋa kɔna neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">n bɛɛ gyae katoo kedeesa mɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, kedeesa keŋ na gyoo n sia yɛna feliŋ keŋ ne yɔkɔse ka wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">n be gyae n ke bɛɛ konɔɔ keŋ ne yɔkɔse ka wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">te kɔ yala koyololo nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Yela Siyɔn kede ka gyoo n sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">na n ke baŋ Yerusalɛm akyaŋse ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Kenaŋ na baŋ be tenɛɛ nɛ kedeesase gyae ka gyoo n sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">baa mo wonembu dibiliŋ yɛɛ katoo kedeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">na baa mo nunkyue baala deesi n kedeesaboe keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ nombia kedi na ɔ bɛrɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Nyaŋ baalebu, weera n ne gate n wose lee dukum dɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Weera n ne gate n wose debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">nyaŋ ŋon n yɛɛ desɛŋ ke Wurubuarɛ siaman?<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Nyaŋ ŋon n na beo balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">n laakem ne bake nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">kɛɛ bee ŋgba hiresa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />N ne gyae nombiakumɛɛ kela nombia kpaakpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">dekara kedi kela anokoare ke kolosi.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Nyaŋ dekarate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">n ne gyae balaŋ kewɔlɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Ampaŋ, Wurubuarɛ waa mo neŋ lɔ kewɔlɛɛ kekpaakekpaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">waa kulu neŋ na waa lese neŋ lee n kanyaŋ deni man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">waa kulu neŋ lee deni balaŋ tɛɛle kei dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa naa na baa yee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">baa boŋo neŋ na baa yako nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />&lt;Ɛ kɛɛ baale ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ɔ ta mo Wurubuarɛ yɛɛ ɔ keyeu kagyoo ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:7">mɔna ɔ moo ɔ wose lɔ ŋon gbagba abɔɔ burum kenyiŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">te ɔ nyiŋa ɔ wose lee ɔ tebia kewɔlɛɛ man.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Mɔna maŋ yɛɛ ŋgba oliifi daŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">keŋ be nyiŋ ka wose Wurubuarɛ dɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:8">mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ Wurubuarɛ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Lee nya ayɛŋ dɔɔ maa lese n yele debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">n balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ siaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:9">Maa mo me loo gyakaa n yele dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">nawolo nyi n yele dei.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s1">Walaŋ Akpanyanyaŋ Keyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Diyiŋte ne yako ɔ konɔɔ man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">&lt;&lt;Wurubuarɛ be kyaa ya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:1">Ba te wɔlɛɛ te bɛɛ yɛɛ abɔɔ anekɔlaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">ŋolo be kyaa keŋ ɔ ne yɛɛ nombia kpaakpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Wurubuarɛ kyaa adido ɔ ne kɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">denibalaŋ pou tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:2">na waa kɛɛ nyi ŋolo kyaa keŋ ɔ gyeŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">yaa ŋolo kyaa keŋ ɔ ne kɛo Wurubuarɛ gbɛɛneŋ?<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Be popou ta yo gbɛɛ, be popou te wɔlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">ŋolo be kyaa keŋ ɔ ne yɛɛ kolo kpaakpaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">dokoloŋ kooŋ gba be kyaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Mena nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra kɛwɔ ba gyeŋ daale yee?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 53:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:4">Bɛɛ tao me balaŋ ŋgba bee di weenɛɛ bo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">bɔɔ na som Wurubuarɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Kɛɛ wɔ, gyakoloŋ dinaa ta gyoo wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">mɔna kolo bɛɛ ŋmaase wɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">Wurubuarɛ te yaasee baŋ bɔɔ seŋ tia ŋon nɛ ŋɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">ɛ ta do wɔ desɛŋ, nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ te bɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Ao, ma kegyae yɛna nyi Iserae nyeekelɛɛ dɛɛ lee Siyɔn kɔŋ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Wee keŋ Wurubuarɛ waa besena ɔ balaŋ see ba beneŋ man na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Yakɔbe waa nyaŋee, na ke yɛɛ Iserae gyoŋ!<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee lee kɔlara nyiŋmaa man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, mo n yele lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">fa maŋ deŋele kedi n doŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">tei me nɔɔman nombia.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Agaŋtaŋtena ne yoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">nyeeman doŋtena ne gyae baa ko maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">bɔɔ na mo Wurubuarɛ yɛɛ kolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Kɛɛ, Wurubuarɛ yɛna me kyɔɔre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">Degbeŋgyoo nyiŋmaa man te me nyeedoŋ doo.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Yela dukum ka bese gyu baŋ bɛɛ wɔlɛɛ maŋ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">lee nya anokoare kedi dɔɔ munu wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Maa lese me konɔɔ man deesi fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">Degbeŋgyoo, maa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">nawolo nyi n dei.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />N ta lese maŋ lee me kayeyɛɛ pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">te me sia naa mena keŋ mɔɔ di me kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋon gyoona ba lese e fa nɛ kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, tei ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">naa besena n wɔle tee me kasola ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Nyii maŋ na n ke kpa maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:2">Ma nyeeman nombia ta bese kasolɔ me dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />me kɔlara te yele gyakoloŋ ta gyoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">lee mena keŋ akpanyanyaŋtena ne ŋmaase maŋ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">nawolo nyi bɛɛ mo kaale kaa lɔ me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">be ta gyeŋ baŋ do maŋ te bɛɛ kɔla maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Me wɔe ne lɔ maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">te yeŋ ne ŋmaase maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Gyakoloŋ na keseree ta gyoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">ma wose te tekerii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ao, nyi meŋ dana beŋkelɛɛ ŋgba duwuluŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">nafɔ maa furufu gyu yenaŋ daale ke fɛɛfo.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Maa furufu gyu lemlem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">na me kaa kyaa depampaa man.<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Maa barase gyu ke gyae dayoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">keŋ dana lem lee feliŋ doŋte na ɔga kefae man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela kekolosi ka gyoo akpanyanyaŋtena, wɔlɛɛ ba kebake man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">nawolo nyi mɛɛ naa be nombiakumɛɛ, na be kale kegyae donɔɔ dinaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Nelim na ka weese na, be gyakaa ka akyaŋse dɔɔ bee gyu bɛɛ kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">nombiakumɛɛ na kayeyɛɛ doo ke man.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Donɔɔ keyɛlɛɛ nombia te wulu donɔɔ dinaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">balaŋ kaŋeredo na akɛrɛɛ bɛɛ taŋ ka abɔnterese man ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Nyi kɔlare ŋolo deŋ na teena maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">nafɔ maa nyiŋ konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:12">nyi kɔlare ŋolo deŋ ne tia maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">nafɔ maa yeu ka yo.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Mɔna nyaŋ deniwalaŋ ŋgba maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">me dɔɔ na me gyoo ŋon dee gyu dɛɛ kɔŋ,<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />ŋon nafɔ nɔɔdokoloŋ doo da nsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">Wurubuarɛ dɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:14">te daa na e ne tɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">baŋ bɛɛ som man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Yela yeŋ kaa futaa me kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">yela baa tisi gyu woyadɛɛ na be sia fonɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">nawolo nyi nombiakumɛɛ te wulu be man.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Mɔ maŋ dɔɔ, me baake Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">te Degbeŋgyoo lɛɛ ma nyee.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Nebo na weeseteŋteŋ na ke balinɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">mee mutii wii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">te ɔ nyii ma woya.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Nyi balaŋ burum da koro seŋ tia maŋ koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">ɔ ne lɛɛ maŋ keŋ kolokum bɛɛ yɛɛ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne di gyoori leenaŋ beneŋ beneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">te ɔ bɛɛ kyɛɛkee ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:19">waa nyii wɔ na waa yɔkɔse wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ keyee be doo be man ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Me dɔɔ ne yoo ɔ gyoona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">ɔ te yala ɔ nɔɔkebakesee keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Ɔ kekolosi dana yeliŋ ŋgba doosi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">mɔna yoo nombia doo ɔ konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:21">ɔ nɔɔwoya woɛ kela nuŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">mɔna ŋe yɛɛ yoosilase ŋan bɔɔ wɔm lese.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Mo n kasolɔ lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ŋon ne gyaela waa kɛɛ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:22">ɔ be gyae waa yela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ ke wosi ya.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Mɔna nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ, nyaŋ ka mo akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">do yebɔɔ man na baa dala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">awudiina na akɛrɛɛtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">be gyae baa di ba weeya yaale ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 55:23" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, maa mo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ kelɛɛdi nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">nawolo nyi me kɔlara te tɔ maŋ do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">wee kamasɛ na be gyakaa bee yoo maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Me kɔlara ne kuu kyaa me dɔɔ wee kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">balaŋ burum ne yoona maŋ wose kegate man.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Nyi gyakoloŋ da gyoo maŋ na, mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Wurubuarɛ ŋon mɛɛ kɛlɛɛ ɔ nɔɔwoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:4">mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ te mɔɔ ne yee ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Woŋ yaa deniwalaŋ waa tale yɛɛ maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Wee kamasɛ na bee tulii me nɔɔwoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">nyeempɔkum te bɛɛ moo lee ma wose man.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Bɛɛ yɛɛ nɔɔ yilaa bake ma nyeeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">bɛɛ gyene me nawɔɔ kekulii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">gyakaa loo nyi baa ko maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Lee ba akpanyanyaŋ nombia dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">wɔŋ ba deŋele tɔ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">O Wurubuarɛ, mo n baŋ wɔlɛɛ mena balaŋ benaŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Ŋmarase me waraŋase kedi see,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">mo me siasaraŋ do nyɔ ogele man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">Ŋa be doo n tɔne man yee?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Nyi me baake neŋ nyi nyaa kyɔ maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:9">kenaŋ na me kɔlara baa bese be wɔle.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">Botɔɔ te maa gyeŋ nyi Wurubuarɛ seŋɛɛ me wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Wurubuarɛ ŋon mɛɛ kɛlɛɛ ɔ nombii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">Degbeŋgyoo ŋon mɛɛ kɛlɛɛ ɔ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ te mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ te mɔɔ ne yee ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">Woŋ yaa walaŋ waa yɛɛ maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Ao me Wurubuarɛ, ma te sɛɛ kom fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">maa tɔ me karaŋ kefa alaŋaŋ fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Nawolo nyi n te lɛɛ maŋ lee yeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">n te yele maa gyɔ me nae ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:13">na maa ta Wurubuarɛ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">nyeedoŋ keŋmaŋee keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Wii me waraŋase, me Wurubuarɛ, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">nawolo nyi nyaŋ te me yeuwɔ kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:1">maa yeu kagyoo n beŋkelɛɛ wuluŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">kelii debaŋ keŋ nombiikum kei gyae ke laŋ.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Mee wii baake Wurubuarɛ Adidote ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne di me nombia fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Waa kpila lee adido kaa lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">waa kalana baŋ bɛɛ naase maŋ diyem nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">Wurubuarɛ waa kpila ɔ kegyae na wa anokoare kedi.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Me doo dinaatese nsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">me doo wonembia kumɛɛ baŋ bee tirii wonembia nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:4">balaŋ baŋ be kela yɛɛ apiase na baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">te be laakemse yɛɛ yoosilase ŋan na bee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, gyina n wose kela adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">yela n gyoorobiiri ke lɛɛ tɛɛle pou.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Ba te nyɔɔ maŋ kɔta me dɛɛtɛe man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">ba te yɔkɔse maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">Be te wula bɔɔ me gbɛɛnaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">mɔna baŋ gbagba te yale gyoo ke man.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Me wɔe bɛɛ lɔ maŋ ya, Ao Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">me wɔe bɛɛ lɔ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">maa kpee nɔɔneŋ kɛlɛɛ neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Ma woo, foŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">Adolɛɛ na akyakaa, ɛ koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">Maa karatɛɛ koro.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, maa lese n yele tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ fa neŋ balaŋ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Nawolo nyi n kegyae boe nideli kelii adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">nya anokoare kedi ne lii ŋɔma man.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, gyina n wose kela adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">yela n gyoorobiiri ke lɛɛ tɛɛle pou.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Wurubuarɛ na waa wɔŋ kɔlara deŋele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Ɛmɛɛ kegyiise ne kolosi nombii na anokoare?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Ɛ ne di balaŋ nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Koa, ɛ konɔɔse man na ɛ ne tulii nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">te ɛ na mo ɛ nyiŋmaase do awudiini nombia keyɛɛ man tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Akpanyanyaŋtena yoo gbɛɛ leenaŋ dokyoa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">leenaŋ be naɔ tɔɔman te ba yoo gbɛɛ bee dii akɛrɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Be dana teekum ŋgba dom wui nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">ŋgba wurale ŋon ɔ be gate ɔ nyee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />Ɔ bee nyii teete koraŋ kefae ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">be famenɛ na mena keŋ ɔ gyeŋ kekaŋtee ya.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, tekerii be kela be nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">Ao Degbeŋgyoo, kulii dinaatese benaŋ kela.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Yela baa yo ŋgba loŋ keŋ be lam nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">akpaa be wɔŋ be baŋdaŋse na, tekerii ŋa nyeela ŋan nɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Yela baa yɛɛ ŋgba dowelee ŋon ɔ detɛe ba yoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">ŋgba biikyaa ŋon bɔɔ lese e tɔɔ, keŋ ɔ te naa weese ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Pɛna sɔɔse ke kpa laŋe saabuse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">yela baa gberaa wɔ leki ŋgba ŋalese nalaŋ yaa awolɛɛ ŋan ne kpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Nyi n tɔ akpanyanyaŋtena kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">te baŋ ba tenɛɛ de tɛɛ be fatabo man nɛ, gyae ke yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Kenaŋ na balaŋ baa yako nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">&lt;&lt;Ampaŋ bɛɛ tɔ baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">ampaŋ Wurubuarɛ ŋolo kyaa keŋ ɔ ne di nombia tɛɛle kei dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa wosefɛɛreŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, lɛɛ maŋ lee me kɔlara nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">yɛɛ ma dekagya tia baŋ bɛɛ koro seŋ tia maŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee balaŋ kumɛɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">na n ke lɛɛ ma nyee lee baŋ bɛɛ gyae maŋ baa ko nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Degbeŋgyoo kɛɛ, bɛɛ deke maŋ baa ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">balaŋ kumɛɛ ne bake ma nyeeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">lee keŋ ma te yɛɛ dukum yaa kolokum daale ya.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Ma te yɛɛ dukum ya, mɔna ba te desina ba wose baa yoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">Koro kaa kyɔ maŋ, kɛɛ me kaale.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">nyaŋ yɛna Iserae Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:5">koro na n ke wɔŋ tɛɛlese pou deŋele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">naa wii akpanyanyaŋtena waraŋase ya.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Bɛɛ kɔŋ balinɔɔ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">bee gbesi ŋgba babaase nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">na bee kila donɔɔ dinaa keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Kɛɛ tuubia ŋan na lee be nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">be nɔɔse man nombia na bee ŋgba yoosilase nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">na bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;Amɔte ne nyiila?&gt;<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Mɔna nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo na boŋo wɔ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">n ne kulu tɛɛlese pou.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Nyaŋ yɛna me doŋ, mɛɛ kɛɛ n gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ me keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon maa tale mo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 59:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:10">Wurubuarɛ waa ta me siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">na waa yela maa naa mena keŋ waa di me kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo de yoo nyeele pampasaŋ, naa ko wɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">na mena ya na me balaŋ baa wolee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:11">Mo n doŋ yaasee wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">na n ke yɔkɔse wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Lee be nɔɔse man nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">lee nombia ŋan na lee be nɔɔsebia man dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">yela baa kyaŋ wɔ ba wose kegate man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">Lee kefaala na akɛrɛɛ ŋan bee dii dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />mo n baŋ nedoŋ wɔlɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">wɔlɛɛ wɔ kaboena baa munu pou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">Kenaŋ na balaŋ baa nyii ke kelii tɛɛle ɔto nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">Wurubuarɛ ne diina gyoori Yakɔbe dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Bɛɛ bese kɔŋ balinɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">bee gbesi ŋgba babaase nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">na bee kila donɔɔ dinaa keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Bee kili gyae weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">akpaa ba te baa ya na bɛɛ fae yeesa.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Mɔna maŋ maa kpee n doŋ keŋ nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">maa kpee n kegyae keŋ nɔɔneŋ nebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:16">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna ma dekagya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">na ma keyeu kagyoo wose ke kyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Nyaŋ yɛna me doŋ, maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ yɛna me gyeere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">me Wurubuarɛ ŋon maa tale mo ma wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kelɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Wurubuarɛ, n te bɛɛ daa te n yaasee daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">n ta gyeŋ baŋ do daa, nɛnɛɛ besena daa see da beneŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />N te wosi tɛɛle keŋ, te n bɛɛse ke man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">bese takee ke, nawolo nyi kee wosi.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Nyaŋ yelela n balaŋ gyoowɔ kayeyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">n faa daa waen de nyɔɔwɔ dɛɛse.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Mɔna baŋ bee yee neŋ nɛ, n gyinaa felage adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">na ke gyee wɔ lee baŋdaŋ keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Lɛɛ da nyee, na n ka mo n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa kyɔ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">na n ke nyiŋ lɛɛ baŋ n ne gyae wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Wurubuarɛ te kolosi lee ɔ fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">&lt;&lt;Maa nyaŋee, na maa kpala Sekem man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">na maa kpala Sukɔte detaŋgya keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Gileade yɛɛ me wui, te Manase mɔ yɛɛ me wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Ɛferayim yɛna ma nyeele kotɔtɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Yuda yɛna me gyooro gbutu.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Moabe yɛna me tasa anefaafoŋ abɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Ɛdom dɔɔ te mɛɛ mo ma nkyokota gyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Filisitena dɔɔ te mɛɛ fae keyoodi yeesa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa mo maŋ gyu donɔɔ dinaa keŋ bɔɔ baŋ dekyaŋ kilisi ke nɛ man?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Amɔte ne gyaela waa ta me siaman gyu Ɛdom?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Na nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ ŋon nɛnɛɛ n be bɛɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">keŋ n bɛɛ tekaa sila de yoonɔɔtena nɛ yee?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Seŋ de wɔle lee de kɔlara dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">nawolo nyi deniwalaŋ kekyɔ yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Nyi Wurubuarɛ kpuɛna daa na dee yoodi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">ŋon ne gyaela waa sakatee de kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, nyii me kewii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">Tei ma kefane.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Mɛɛ baake neŋ leenaŋ tɛɛle ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">debaŋ keŋ me konɔɔ be yɔkɔse nɛ te me baake neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">mo maŋ ke gyakaa kpanaŋ keŋ ka korɛɛ kela maŋ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna ma keyeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">dekagya doŋte tia me kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Yela maa kyaa nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa man kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">na maa yo n beŋkelɛɛ tɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ, n nyii ntam keŋ mɔɔ kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">n ta mo baŋ bee yee n yele nɛ dedii fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Yela gyoo ke kyaa kyare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">yela ɔ kulutooneŋ ka bo ke tuŋ ɔ kalola kegyakaarese burum.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Waa di gyoori Wurubuarɛ siaman kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">yela n kegyae na nya anokoare kedi ke gyee e.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Kenaŋ na maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">na maa tɔ ma alaŋaŋ wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Loo kamo gyakaa Wurubuarɛ kegyee dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Ampaŋ ma woo waa fɛɛfo Wurubuarɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">ma nyeekelɛɛ na lee bo ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Ampaŋ ŋon yɛna me kpanaŋ na ma nyeekelɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">ŋon yɛna me gyeere, kolo be tale tɛɛse maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Woromɔ yaa ɛ ke tina maŋ diyem kenaase yela?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">Ɛ popou ɛ ke tɛɛse maŋ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">ŋgba dekyaŋ keŋ be gɛɛse, yaa abaŋ keŋ ba woo nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Ampaŋ ba te bake nyi baa lese maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">lee ma dekyae kpaakpaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">akɛrɛɛ kedi dana wɔ gyoŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">Bɛɛ mo be nɔɔse hiraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">mɔna bɛɛ falaa lee be konɔɔse man.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Ampaŋ ma woo waa fɛɛfo Wurubuarɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">me lookegyakaa na lee bo ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Ampaŋ ŋon yɛna me kpanaŋ na ma nyeekelɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">ŋon yɛna me gyeere, kolo be tale tɛɛse maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Ma nyeekelɛɛ na me gyoorobiiri lee Wurubuarɛ gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">ŋon yɛna me kpanaŋ dekpataakpere, ŋon mee yeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Ɛmɛɛ balaŋ, ɛ mo ɛ wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">ɛ yako e keŋ doo ɛ konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ yɛna da keyeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Ampaŋ balaŋ yakaa nyibaŋ yɛɛ ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">balaŋ baŋ be dana yele nɛ yɛɛ akɛrɛɛtenawɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">Nyi n mo wɔ gyakaa sikeli dɔɔ na, be yɛɛ yakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">be popou yɛɛ yakaa ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Ɛ naa mo ɛ wose lɔ balaŋ kaŋeredo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">yaa ɛ ka mo ɛ loo gyakaa ŋmɛɛleŋ abɔɔ dɔɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:10">Nyi ɛ nyiŋ dedii burum koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ɛ naa mo ɛ konɔɔ lɔ ŋe dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Nombii dokoloŋ te Wurubuarɛ kolosiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">nombia ala te me nyiiwɔ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:11">&lt;Wurubuarɛ nyiŋmaa man te doŋ doo,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />te nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo man te kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:12">&lt;&lt;N ne tɔ walaŋ kamasɛ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">ŋgba mena keŋ ɔ be yɛɛ ɔ tom nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Sia keyɛɛ kɛo Wurubuarɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ, yɛna me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">me sia te yɛɛ mɛɛ kɛo neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">mɛɛ kɛo neŋ ŋgba loŋboaneŋ kɛɛ ko walaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">n ne gyɔ ma wose pou loo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">ŋgba depampaa tɛɛle dowolosa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">botɔɔ keŋ loŋ na loŋ be kyaa ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Me naa neŋ nyɔ ɔsom deni keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">te me naa n doŋ na n gyoorobiiri.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />N kegyae dei kela nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">mena dɔɔ me nɔɔsebia gyae ka lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Maa lese n yele ma kekyaabii man pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">maa gyina me nyiŋmaase adido n yele man.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Gyae ke baa maŋ ŋgba weenɛɛ kpaakpaa ŋaale te me diiwɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">na maa mo me nɔɔsebia kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Me doo ma dofoŋoŋ dɔɔ na mɛɛ tɔɔse neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6">mɛɛ gyueŋ n wose man nelim pou.<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ ne kyɔɔna maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">n beŋkelɛɛ wuluŋ tɛɛ te mɛɛ nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Ma te gɔtaa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa danaana maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa ko maŋ nɛ baa munu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">baa tisi gyoo woyadɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Baa mo yoosila koe wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">na baa bese gbougbouse weenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Mɔna gyoo waa nyaŋee lee Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">baŋ bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ nɛ baa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">mɔna baa wuu akɛrɛɛtena nɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Wurubuarɛ, nyii maŋ debaŋ keŋ mɛɛ toroŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">lɛɛ ma nyee lee me kɔlare keŋmaase man.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Weese maŋ lee akpanyanyaŋtena kebake man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">na nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra nyeempɔkum man.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Ba te sara be laakemse ŋgba yoosilase nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">be nɔɔwoya kumɛɛ yɛɛ ŋgba baŋdaŋ nyeela nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Bɛɛ yoo tɔ balaŋ baŋ be nombia dei nɛ baŋdaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">bɛɛ tɔ wɔ karatetee keŋ bɔɔ ne yee ya.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Bɛɛ do dɔŋa kakyeŋ lee nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">bee kolosi lee mena keŋ baa yo nyɔɔ kɔtase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;Amɔte ne gyaela waa naa daa?&gt;<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Bɛɛ bake nombiakumɛɛ yako nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">&lt;De bake de nombia ŋan nideli.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">Ampaŋ deniwalaŋ nyeempɔ na ɔ konɔɔ man dana detiŋtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Mɔna Wurubuarɛ waa mo ɔ baŋdaŋ tɔ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">baa gooli debokenaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Waa mo be nɔɔwoya bu wɔ fɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">na waa wɔlɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">baŋ pou baa naa wɔ nɛ, baa kpiisi ba nyeeya gyakoloŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Balaŋ pou baa yee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">baa gyɔ ŋan pou Wurubuarɛ be yɛɛ nɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">na baa gyueŋ ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ wose man.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ nɛ waa nyaŋee lee Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">na waa yeu kagyoo e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">baŋ pou be konɔɔse man dei nɛ, baa mo gyoorobiiri fa e.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese na karaŋ kefa Wurubuarɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Wurubuarɛ, n kaboena nyi baa lese n yele Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">nyaŋ te kaboena nyi baa tɔ alaŋaŋ fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Nyaŋ ŋon n ne nyii da kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">balaŋ pou baa kɔŋ n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />De nombiakumɛɛ kaa dii de dɔɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">nyaŋ moona ŋe popou kyɛɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Baŋ n ba lese wɔ, te n ba mo wɔ nyi be kaa kyaa nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">baŋna nyeebam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:4">N dekpaŋalaŋ man abɔɔ kpaakpaa ŋan te baa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa fereŋkyeŋ keŋ abɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Da nyeelɛɛre Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">n ne yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia mo kpa daa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">n dɔɔ te tɛɛle kei ɔto balaŋ, na baŋ pou be kyaa ɛpo wɔle nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">na mo be loo gyakaa.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Nyaŋ moona n doŋ see bulase mokɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">te n moo n doŋ bake gbegya.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />N ne yɔkɔse ɛpo dɔɔ feliŋ kegyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">na feliŋ keŋ ne gyɔɔ nɛ te tina yela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">n ne yele tɛɛlese yeesa kefae ne yɛɛ yididi.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />N gyakoloŋ nombia ne yele gyakoloŋ na gyoo tɛɛle dɔɔ balaŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">n ne yele baŋ be kyaa weese dɛɛlee na weese dɛɛyalae pou</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">ne kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />N ne kɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ, na n te woli ke loŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">n ne desina ke nideli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Loŋ te wulu Wurubuarɛ boŋobiise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">na ke yela balaŋ baŋ kenyiŋ weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">nawolo nyi mena te n doo ke.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />N ne woli ka adaŋse ŋan loŋ, na ŋa te doo kyɛɛkyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">n ne yele ɔga ne ŋɛɛ wooso ke, na n te hiraa ke weenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Kulutoo de gyu ɔto na weenɛɛ te gbigi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">wɔɔman abɔɔ te wulu nya anebiliŋiŋse pou.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Ŋalese ne tuu depampaa keŋ man burum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">kenyaŋee te wuu bulasebia pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Namense te lɛɛ wonembia dedii keŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">wamela te lɛɛ ataŋgyase ŋan man pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">be popou ne nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese na karaŋ kefa nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Tɛɛle pou, ɛ nyaŋee fae yeesa fa Wurubuarɛ,<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ gyoorobiiri yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">ɛ mo obuo fa e na ɛ ka lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Ɛ yako Wurubuarɛ nyi, &lt;Abɔɔ ŋan n ne yɛɛ nɛ dana gyakoloŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">N doŋ keŋ dokoso be kyaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">mena dɔɔ n kɔlara ne buŋii neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Tɛɛle kei pou ne buŋ neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">bee kpee yele kalese nɔɔneŋ fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">bee kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Ɛ kɔŋ kaa kɛɛ keŋ Wurubuarɛ be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">ɔ te yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia fa denibalaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Ɔ yelaa ɛpo bese tɛɛle dowolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">be tɛɛwɔna be nawɔɔ toŋ loŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">botɔɔ te de nyaŋeewɔ lee wa ayɛŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Ɔ na mo ɔ doŋ di gyoori kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">ɔ sia gyakaa tɛɛlese pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">baŋ bɛɛ seŋ tia e nɛ, naa gyina ba wose ya.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Ɛmɛɛ balaŋ pou ɛ lese de Wurubuarɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">ɛ lese ɔ yele na balaŋ ke nyii.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Ŋon yelela te de kyaa nyeedoŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">ɔ te yele de nawɔɔ ke sarakee ya.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ te kɛɛse daa kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">n te kyalase daa ŋgba kɔba wolom nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />N yelaa da gyoowɔ kɔtase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">te n moo kasolɔse yuŋ nyiŋan seele daa.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />N yelaa balaŋ tɛɛwɔ da nyeeya dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">de tɛɛwɔ boalaŋ na loŋse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">mɔna n moo daa kɔŋ botɔɔ keŋ abɔɔ be gbigi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Maa mo katoo kedeesa abɔɔ kɔŋ nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">na me kaa tɔ ma alaŋaŋ fa neŋ,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />abɔɔ ŋan mɔɔ gyuusu me nɔɔ yako te mɔɔ kaŋ ntam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">debaŋ keŋ ma wose be kyaŋ maŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Maa mo wonembia baŋ bɔɔ doo nuŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">na namense baala yɛɛ katoo kedeesa fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">maa mo nunkyue baala na asoose deesi fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ pou ɛ ne yee Wurubuarɛ nɛ ɛ kaa nyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">ɛ yela maa yako ŋon keŋ ɔ be yɛɛ fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Me lɔɔ nɔɔ baake e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:17">te ma moo me laakem lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Nyi nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ deŋ doo me konɔɔ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">nafɔ Wurubuarɛ be gyae waa nyii maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Mɔ ke gbagba na Wurubuarɛ nyii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">te ɔ tei ma kefane.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Ɛ lese Wurubuarɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">ɔ te bɛɛ ma kefane ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">te ɔ ta lese ɔ kegyae lee me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s1">Karaŋ kefa nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Wurubuarɛ waa wii daa na waa hiraa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">na waa gyuusu ɔ sia kɛɛ daa,<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />na balaŋ ka gyeŋ n gbɛɛneŋ tɛɛle kei dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">na n nyeekelɛɛ tɛɛlese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Wurubuarɛ, balaŋ baa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">balaŋ pou baa lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Dɛɛ yɛɛ tɛɛlese pou gyoŋ na baa kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">nawolo nyi n ne di balaŋ nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">te n na wola tɛɛle kei dɔɔ balaŋ gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Wurubuarɛ, balaŋ baa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">balaŋ pou baa lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Tɛɛle keŋ ne de weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">Wurubuarɛ, de Wurubuarɛ te hiraa daa.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Wurubuarɛ waa hiraa daa bela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">na baŋ be kyaa tɛɛle ɔto pou ke yee e.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s1">Iserae keyoodi nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Wurubuarɛ koro bileŋ, na n kɔlara ke yaasee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:1">yela n kɔlara ke yeu lee n siaman,<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Feefu wɔ leki ŋgba nyɔɔse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">ŋgba mena keŋ keeni ne yalakee boalaŋ gyaŋ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">akpanyanyaŋtena baa munu Wurubuarɛ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Mɔna baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa di gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">na baa nyaŋee Wurubuarɛ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">dɛɛ yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ na baa nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Wurubuarɛ, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">Ɛ gate ŋon ɔ dɔŋ ŋɔma man nɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">68:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaa ɛ desina gbɛɛ fa ŋon ɔ dɔɔ depampaa man nɛ</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ɛ nyaŋee fa e, ɔ yele yɛna Degbeŋgyoo.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Wurubuarɛ, ŋon ɔ kyaa ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">yɛna yoyolobiise be kya, na ŋon ɔ ne gyee liala.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Wurubuarɛ na moona baŋ bɔɔ dana walaŋ ya nɛ do balaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">te ɔ na lese baŋ bɔɔ kyaŋ wɔ tɔ deni nɛ gyoŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">mɔna baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ deŋeledoŋ nɛ, baa kyaa tɛɛle keŋ weese be gyɔ ke kpakparakpaa nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, debaŋ keŋ n be tɛɛ n balaŋ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">te n ba mo wɔ ta depampaa man nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />tɛɛle wosiwɔ te ŋɔma yelaa ɔga ŋɛɛwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">Sinai Wurubuarɛ ŋon siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">Iserae Wurubuarɛ ŋon siaman.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, n yelaa ɔga dinaa ŋɛɛwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">n kaa besewɔ fa n dedii keŋ be yɔkɔse nɛ doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />N balaŋ kaa kyaawɔ ke man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">Wurubuarɛ, n deeli dɔɔ n yelaa ayematena nyiŋa burum.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Degbeŋgyoo kolosi ɔ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">ala baŋ bɛɛ gyɔ ka dekpeŋkpeŋ nɛ boe.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />&lt;&lt;Gyooneŋ na be yoonɔɔtena ne yekii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">ala baŋ be kyaa dɛɛ nɛ kpala yoo man abɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />doo nyi be doo wonembia dedoi man koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">ke yɛɛ ŋgba duwuluŋ beŋkelɛɛ ŋan bɔɔ mo kɔba wolom yɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">te ɔ wona yɛɛ ŋgba kɔba yayam keŋ kɛɛ ŋalakee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Debaŋ keŋ Dekpataakpere ŋon be yaasee gyooneŋ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">ke yɛɛ ŋgba debuŋta ne yalala Salemɔn bula dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Basan bula, bula dinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">Basan bula, bulase ŋan ŋe dana kekpasese burum,<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />nyaŋ bula keŋ n dana kekpasese burum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">weera n sia ne yɛɛ bula keŋ Wurubuarɛ ba lese nyi ɔ dekyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">botɔɔ keŋ Degbeŋgyoo gbagba waa kyaa kekpaakekpaa nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Wurubuarɛ yookɔtase yɛɛ kakpoŋse burum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">kakpoŋ kakpoŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">te Degbeŋgyoo moowɔ lee sinai kaa gyoo ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />N kɛɛ gyem n ne gyu adido nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">n moo baŋ bɔɔ yoo kyaŋ wɔ nɛ burum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">n nyiŋa abɔɔ kefa burum lee baŋ koraŋ bɔɔ yoo tia neŋ nɛ gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">na Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ ke kyaa botɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele, Wurubuarɛ da nyeelɛɛre ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">wee kamasɛ na ŋon na seelena de kaalese,<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />De Wurubuarɛ yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne lɛɛ da nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee ne lɛɛna daa lee yeŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Ampaŋ, Wurubuarɛ waa yɛlɛɛ ɔ kɔlara nyeeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">baŋ ba nyeenyɔɔse boe te be gyakaa be dukum keyɛɛ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Degbeŋgyoo kpa, &lt;&lt;Maa mo wɔ lee Basan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">maa mo wɔ lee ɛpo siiliŋ man,<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />na n kenyiŋ ta baŋ bɛɛ kɔla neŋ nɛ fatabo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">na n babaase laakemse ke nyiŋ deŋee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, bɛɛ naa mena keŋ n ne gyina n baameŋse gaŋtee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">me Wurubuarɛ, me gyoo n ne lɔ baameŋse gyoo n deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Nɔɔneŋ kpeera dɔŋ siaman, baŋ wɔle yɛna suyagyɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">baŋ be kpuɛna wɔ yɛna alebia baŋ bee wosi akyakaase.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele balaŋ burum baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele Iseraetena degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Bɛneyamen dekpaŋalaŋ peperee keŋ dɔŋɛɛla be siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">na Yuda gyoorobia burum baŋ gyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">na Sebulɔn na Nafitali gyoorobia gyakaa.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, wola n doŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">n doŋ keŋ n ba mo seŋ de wɔle nyaŋ ŋon n be yɛɛ abɔɔ pou fa daa.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Lee nyɔ ɔsom deni keŋ kyaa Yerusalɛm dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">gyooneŋ baa mo abɔɔ kefa kɔna neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Kalana ŋale man wonembu ŋon ɔ doo morose man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">nunkyue baala na nunkyue bia baŋ be yɛɛ tɛɛlese wui nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Yɔkɔse wonembukum ŋon kelii debaŋ keŋ waa mo kɔba wolom kɔna neŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">Yaasee tɛɛlese baŋ bɛɛ gyae yoo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Baŋ ba seŋɛɛ Igyipite gyoo nawɔɔ man nɛ yɛna Kusitena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">baa kaa yɔkɔse ba wose Wurubuarɛ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Ɛmɛɛ tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyoori dediise, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />ŋon kyaala adido adido, beneŋ beneŋ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">ŋon na moona woya beeneŋ fae.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Ɛ gyɔ Wurubuarɛ doŋ keŋ dekpeŋkpeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">ɔ gyoorobiiri doŋ gyakaa Iserae dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">ɔ doŋ doo adido.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Wurubuarɛ, n wose dana gyakoloŋ n fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">Iserae Wurubuarɛ ne fa ɔ balaŋ doŋ, te ɔ na do wɔ kakyeŋ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">Ɛ lese Wurubuarɛ yele.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s1">Kewii fa kekyɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">69:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawide nɔɔneŋ </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ lɛɛ ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">nawolo nyi loŋ keŋ te wuu kaa lii me wɔŋe man.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Ma te dɔɔ depate keŋ ke dana siiliŋ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">me nawɔɔ bɛɛ baŋ tɛɛle ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:2">ma te kaa lii lee keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">boo te wuu kaa mo me dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />ma te gbalase keŋ mɔɔ ne tale baake ŋolo kaa kyɔ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">me lokotɛɛ ta wolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:3">me sia te laase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">mɛɛ kɛo me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ keŋ ma te yɛɛ wɔ kolo ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">boe kela ma nyeenyɔɔse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Me kɔlara ne di akɛrɛɛ tia maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">baŋ bɛɛ gyae maŋ baa ko nɛ boe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Bɛɛ ŋere maŋ nyi maa besena kpene keŋ ma te ŋmɛɛle ya nɛ kɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Ao Wurubuarɛ n gyeŋ me diyiŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">me dukum ba weesɛɛ n siaman ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">naa yele desɛŋ kekyaŋ baŋ be loo gyakaa n dɔɔ lee maŋ dɔɔ ya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:6">Iserae Wurubuarɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">naa yele desɛŋ ke kyaŋ baŋ bɛɛ kɛo neŋ lee maŋ dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Lee nyaŋ dɔɔ bee kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">te desɛŋ te tekeri me wɔŋe,<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Me ta bese ŋɔɔle maŋ gbagba ma loŋtona man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">ŋɔɔle, maŋ gbagba me naa lolo bia man,<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ te di ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">tuubia ŋan bɛɛ tee neŋ nɛ, kaa wuraa maŋ bo.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Nyi me wii te me bake me nɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">na bɛɛ boŋo maŋ bo.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />nyi ma mo titire wuu ma wose na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">balaŋ ne kulu maŋ bo.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Baŋ be kyaa donɔɔ keŋ denaanɔɔ man nɛ ne kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">te soloŋ nyɔɔra ta mo maŋ kara nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ fane fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">debaŋ keŋ nyaŋ ka boele maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:13">Ao Wurubuarɛ, lee n kegyae dinaa keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">mo nya anokoare nyeekelɛɛ keŋ kpa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee depate keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">naa yele maa munu ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">lɛɛ maŋ lee baŋ bɛɛ kɔla maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">lee loŋ keŋ ke dana siiliŋ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Naa yele loŋ ke wuu mo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">yaa maa dɔɔ lee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">yaa yebɔɔ ke wuu maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Degbeŋgyoo, lee n wɔe na n kegyae dɔɔ kpa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">lee n waraŋase kewii beiŋ dɔɔ besena n sia kɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Na mo n sia weese n tobaale ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">me doo kayeyɛɛ man dɔɔ, kpa maŋ bileŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Tuu benaa maŋ na n ke lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">lee me kɔlara dɔɔ lɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />N gyeŋ mena keŋ bee kulu maŋ, te bee fulu maŋ do maŋ desɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">n gyeŋ me kɔlara pou.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Tuubia te yɔkɔse ma wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">keŋ mɔɔ dana loo degyakae ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">me gyae ŋolo kaa wii maŋ, mɔna me te nyim ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">me gyae ŋolo kaa yakodo maŋ, mɔna me te nyiŋ ŋolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Ba moo teekum do me weenɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">te be faa maŋ soloŋ denyaŋesa nyi maa nyɔɔ ko loŋboaneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Ba see wɔ weenɛɛ na ke dɛɛ bese kɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">yela be siŋkiti kedi ka besena wɔ kɔtase.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Yela be sia ke yɛɛ wɔ fulaa na bɔɔ nyiŋ naa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">ba teŋase dee gokii kekpaakekpaa,<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Lese n baŋ wola wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">lese n baŋ nedoŋ keŋ wola wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Yela ba akyaese ka bese donɔɔ bene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">ŋolo na kyaa be kanyaŋ denɛɛ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Nawolo nyi bɛɛ naase baŋ n be wɔŋ ba deŋele nɛ diyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">te bee kolosi lee baŋ n be gooli wɔ nɛ weeleŋ wose man.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Wɔŋ ba deŋele, na n ka bese wɔŋ ke bela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">naa yele baa nyiŋ n nyeekelɛɛ keŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Yela baa lese ba yela lee nyeedoŋ tɔne keŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">naa yele baa ŋmarase ba yela kpuna baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Mɔ maŋ dɔɔ mɛɛ naa diyem te mee nyii weeleŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">Ao Wurubuarɛ, yela n nyeekelɛɛ ke gyee maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese Wurubuarɛ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">na maa mo karaŋ kefa lese ɔ gyoorobiiri debɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Kei gyae ka gyoo Degbeŋgyoo sia kela nunkyue baale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">kela nunkyue baale ŋon ɔ dana woo na awɔkatese.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Ayematena baa naa na ke yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne kɛo Wurubuarɛ nɛ, ɛ konɔɔse dɛɛ fɛɛ ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Degbeŋgyoo ne nyii ayematena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">te ɔ bee wolee ɔ balaŋ baŋ bɔɔ kyaŋ wɔ tɔ deni nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Adido na tɛɛle, ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">ɛpose na wonembia baŋ pou be doo ke man nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />nawolo nyi Wurubuarɛ waa lɛɛ Siyɔn nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">na waa bese baŋee Yuda donɔɔse dinaana ŋan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">Kenaŋ na balaŋ baa kyaa botɔɔ, na baa mo ke bese be wui.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Ɔ somera duuluŋ man balaŋ baa kaa mo ke bese be dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">na baŋ bɛɛ gyae ɔ yele nɛ ke kyaa botɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">70:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawide nɔɔneŋ fa nɔɔneŋ siamante</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, yɛɛ bileŋ na n kaa lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">Degbeŋgyoo, kɔŋ bileŋ na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Yela desɛŋ kekyaŋ baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa ko maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">na kekolosi ka gyoo wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:2">yela baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae ma yeŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">ka mo desɛŋ bese be wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Yela baŋ pou bɛɛ yako maŋ nyi, &lt;Mbo, Mbo&gt; nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">ka mo desɛŋ bese be wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Mɔna yela baŋ pou bɛɛ kɛo neŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">ke nyaŋee na ke yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ lee nyaŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">yela baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae n nyeekelɛɛ nɛ ke yako debaŋ kamasɛ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo boe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ me yɛɛ diyemte e, keŋ mɔɔ dana kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Ao Wurubuarɛ, yɛɛ bileŋ kɔŋ me gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">Nyaŋ yɛna ŋon n ne kyɔ maŋ te n ne lɛɛ maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Degbeŋgyoo, naa wɔŋ n wose lee wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s1">Kegyia kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ te me yeuwɔ kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">na yele desɛŋ kekyaŋ maŋ korakora ya.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Mo n katenee lese maŋ na n ke lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">tei maŋ na n ke lɛɛ ma nyee.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Yɛɛ ma keyeu kagyoo kpanaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ŋon gyaŋ maa tale gyu debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">fa mmaraa na baa lɛɛ ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna me kpanaŋ na me gyeere.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Me Wurubuarɛ lɛɛ maŋ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">lee nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra na nyeeman doŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee dɔɔ te me loo gyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">n dɔɔ te ma moo ma wose lɔɔ leenaŋ me biatɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Leenaŋ be kalola maŋ te ma moo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">nyaŋ lesena maŋ lee me naa tɔɔman.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">Maa lese n yele debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Me ta bese balaŋ burum kagyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">nyaŋ yɛna ma keyeu kagyoo doŋte ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />N yele kalese te wulu me nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">keŋ mɛɛ yako n gyoorobiiri nombia debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Akpaa me ŋmɛɛ nɛ, naa mo maŋ leki ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">nyi me doŋ de taŋ nɛ, naa bɛɛ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Nawolo nyi me kɔlara ne kolosi tia maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">baŋ bɛɛ gyae maŋ baa ko nɛ, ne yɛɛ nɔɔ bake ma nyeeman.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;Wurubuarɛ te bɛɛ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">ɛ gegi e na ɛ ke kyaŋ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">nawolo nyi ŋolo be gyae waa lɛɛ e ya.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Me Wurubuarɛ, na wɔŋ n wose gyu lem lee me gyaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">Wurubuarɛ, kɔŋ bileŋ na n kaa kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Yela baŋ bɛɛ kɛrɛɛ me nɔɔse nɛ ke munu desɛŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">yela baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa yɛɛ maŋ nombiikum nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">sia ka yeŋ na desɛŋ ke kyaŋ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, maa mo me loo gyakaa n dɔɔ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">maa lese n yele agbaatee agbaatee.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Maa yako n katenee nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">na n nyeekelɛɛ nombia wee dibiliŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">keŋ nyi mɔɔ tale kala ŋa gba ya.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee, maa kaa yako n nombia dinaana ŋan n ne yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">maa yako nyi nyaŋ nyaageŋ ne yɛɛna nombia ŋan doona ŋe gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Wurubuarɛ, leenaŋ me biatɛɛ te n na wola maŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">te mɛɛ yako n gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan n ne yɛɛ kaa lii gyɛŋ.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Me Wurubuarɛ, nyi me ta bee te ma nyee ta wolose koraŋ nɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">naa bɛɛ maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:18">kelii debaŋ keŋ maa yako n doŋ keŋ nombia fa kalola kegyakaare baŋ baa kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">na maa yako nombia dinaana ŋan n ne yɛɛ nɛ fa baŋ pou baa kaa lola wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Wurubuarɛ, n katenee te lii adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">nyaŋ yɛna ŋon n be yɛɛ nombia dinaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">Wurubuarɛ, amɔte kyaala ŋgba nyaŋ nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Doo nyi n yelaa ma moowɔ kayeyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">na kaale burum man koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">nyaŋ ke yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ bela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:20">lee tɛɛle tɔɔman tɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">nyaŋ ke gate maŋ bela.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Nyaŋ ke yela maa nyiŋ yele nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">na n ka bese yakodo maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Me Wurubuarɛ, maa mo adolɛɛ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">lee nya anokoare kedi dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">Maa mo akyakaa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">Iserae fereŋkyeŋte ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Maa gyuusu me nɔɔ mo kenyaŋee fae yeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">debaŋ keŋ mee kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">nawolo nyi nyaŋ lesena maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Maa yako balaŋ n nombia ŋan tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:24">Nawolo nyi baŋ bɔɔ gyae maŋ baa ko nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">desɛŋ te kyaŋ wɔ te kekolosi gyoo wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa gyoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">72:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Solomɔn nɔɔneŋ </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, yela gyooneŋ kedi nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">yela gyoorobu ke yɛɛ nombia ŋan tenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Yela waa di n balaŋ nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">waa di baŋ bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do nɛ nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ fa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Yela bulase ka mo wose kenyiŋ kɔna balaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">na bulasebia ka mo nombia keyɛɛ kegbɛɛ dɔɔ kɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Waa di lɛɛ ayematena balaŋ baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">na waa lɛɛ ayematena bia nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">waa di baŋ bɛɛ ŋere wɔ do nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Weese na gyaalaŋ nyiŋaa be kyaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">waa kyaa kalola kegyakaare pou man.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Waa yɛɛ ŋgba ɔga ne ŋɛɛla woli ŋalese ŋan bɔɔ kɛrɛɛ ŋe dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">ŋgba ɔga ne ŋɛɛla woli tɛɛle dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Balaŋ baa yɛɛ nombia ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ ɔ debaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">na baa nyiŋ ba wose kelii debaŋ keŋ gyaalaŋ ba tekaa kyaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Waa di gyoori lee ɛpo dɔɔ kelii ɛpo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">lee Eferatese boo dɔɔ kelii tɛɛle ɔto.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Baŋ be kyaa depampaa keŋ man nɛ baa buŋ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">na ɔ kɔlara kaa buŋii e.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Taresisi gyooneŋ na baŋ be kyaa boo nɔɔnɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">baa tɔ toto fa e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:10">Gyooneŋ baŋ be kyaa Saba na Seba nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">baa kaa fa e abɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Gyooneŋ pou baa buŋ e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">na tɛɛlese pou ka som e.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Nawolo nyi ŋon ne gyaela waa lɛɛ ayematena baŋ bee wii bake e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">na baŋ bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do, keŋ be taŋ ŋolo ke lɛɛ wɔ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Waa wii baŋ bɔɔ dana doŋ ya, na ayematena waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">na waa lɛɛ baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya nɛ lee yeŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Waa lese wɔ lee kaŋeredo na awudiina nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">nawolo nyi be fatabo na lee koya ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Waa kyaa kyare.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">Baa mo kɔba yayam lee Seba kɔna e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">Balaŋ baa fane fa e debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">na baa hiraa e wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Weenɛɛ dee gbigi tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">ŋe dɛɛ gbigi kelii bulasebia pou nyeeya dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">weenɛɛ dee de ŋgba Lebanɔn nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">ŋgba ŋalese ŋan kyaa wɔɔman nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Waa lɛɛ yele kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">weese nyiŋaa ɔ kyaa nɛ, ɔ yele mɔ dee doo mena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">Wurubuarɛ waa ta ɔ dɔɔ hiraa tɛɛlese pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">na baa baake e nyi nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ, Iserae Wurubuarɛ ŋon yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">ŋon waageŋ ne yɛɛna gyakoloŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Ɛ lese ɔ gyoorobiiri yele kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">ɔ gyoorobiiri dɛɛ lɛɛ tɛɛle pou dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="PSA 72:19">Dɛɛkɔŋ mena, Dɛɛkɔŋ mena.<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Yese bu Dawide kefane keŋ ɔto yaa.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">Tɔne Atoorote</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 73-89">Nɔɔneŋ 73—89</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">73:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asafe nɔɔneŋ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Ampaŋ, Degbeŋgyoo dei fa Iserae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">na baŋ be konɔɔse man dei nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, kaa kyomii na maa sarakee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">kaa kyomii na maa gyɔ me nae.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Nawolo nyi me yoo agaŋtaŋtena nuŋkurili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">debaŋ keŋ mɔɔ naa mena keŋ abɔɔ ne dee fa akpanyanyaŋtena nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Bɔɔ ne nyii weeleŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">be dana wosedoŋ te be dana doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Ba wose bɛɛ kyaŋ wɔ ŋgba balaŋ akaŋ baŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">kayeyɛɛ bɛɛ kɔŋ be dɔɔ ŋgba deniwalaŋ kawee ya.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Mena dɔɔ wose kegyina yɛna ba agbaraagbaraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">nyeeman doŋ yɛna kegba keŋ bɛɛ doo.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Nombiakumɛɛ te wulu be konɔɔse man</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">te ba nyeempɔkum be dana ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Bee kulu balaŋ, na bee kolosi nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">bɛɛ mo ba agaŋtaŋ do baŋ bɔɔ ŋere do nɛ gyakoloŋ.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Bee kolosi nombiakumɛɛ tia adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">te be laakemse ne diina doŋ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Mena dɔɔ be balaŋ ne nyii wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">te bɔɔ ne naa dukum be man ya.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Sena yaa Wurubuarɛ waa yɛɛ gyeŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">Adidote ŋon gyeŋ nombia?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Kɛɛ, nnɛ te akpanyanyaŋtena doo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">bɔɔ ne naase ba wose diyem ya, mɔna be gyakaa bee nyiŋ dedii kpu.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Ampaŋ ke yɛɛ yakaa te me yɛɛ n kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">te me faafo me nyiŋmaase deŋele kedi man.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Wee kamasɛ mɛɛ naa diyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">te bɛɛ wɔŋ ma deŋele nebo kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Nyi meŋ yakowɔ mena nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">nafɔ meŋ lese n bia fa.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Ma ke yɛɛ kakyeŋ maa nyii kɛŋa pou man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">ke kaa takaa maŋ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />kelii debaŋ keŋ mɔɔ gyoo Wurubuarɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">pɛte me naa botɔɔ keŋ ba mo wɔ kelii.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Ampaŋ n moo wɔ see botɔɔ keŋ ne sarakee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">n yela be yalawɔ gyoo kewɔlɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Be wɔlɛɛwɔ karatetee dokoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">gyakoloŋ te kuu wɔ pou laŋ.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Be yɛɛ ŋgba ŋolo foŋala lee dosɛɛ man nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">Degbeŋgyoo, akpaa n koro nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">nyaŋ ke yɛɛ wɔ ŋgba be foŋae lee dosɛɛ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Debaŋ keŋ mee nyii weeleŋ me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">te ma woo ne nyii weeleŋ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />ma bese diyiŋte ŋon mɔɔ gyeŋ daale ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">me yɛɛ ŋgba wonembu nɛ n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Mɔna me kyaa n gyaŋ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">n dana maŋ me dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />N moo n kagyeŋ wola maŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">kenaŋ wɔle na nyaŋ ke lɛɛ maŋ gyu n gyoorobiiri keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Nyaŋ wɔle na, amɔte yaa me dana adido?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">Te mɔɔ ne gyae ŋolo tɛɛle kei dɔɔ kpuna neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Ma wosenaane na me konɔɔ gyae ke tale yɔkɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">mɔna Wurubuarɛ na doona me konɔɔ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">me yɛɛ ɔ wui kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Baŋ bɔɔ wɔŋ ba wose lee n gyaŋ gyu lem nɛ baa munu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">nyaŋ ke wɔlɛɛ baŋ pou bɔɔ ne di anokoare fa neŋ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Mɔna maŋ dɔɔ, dei nyi maa benaa Wurubuarɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee te mee yeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">na maa gyɔ ŋan pou n ne yɛɛ nɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Iserae kelɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, woŋ dɔɔ te n bɛɛ daa kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">Woŋ dɔɔ te n gyeŋa baŋ nideli do n namense baŋ n ne kɛɛle nɛ mena?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Tɔɔse tɛɛlese baŋ n be lɛɛ gyaŋgba nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">balaŋ baŋ n be lɛɛ ba nyee mo yɛɛ n dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">Siyɔn bula botɔɔ keŋ n kyaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Kulu n nae kaa kɛɛ akyaŋse ŋan bɔɔ yɛlɛɛ kekpaakekpaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">Kɔlare ŋon te wɔlɛɛ kpene kamasɛ deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />N kɔlara ne fae yeesa botɔɔ keŋ n ne gyaŋeena daa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">be ta gyene botɔɔ na kawola nyi be te di de dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Bɛɛ yɛɛ ŋgba balaŋ baŋ bɔɔ gate abeŋase adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">baa tuŋii daase laaman nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Be ta mo abeŋase na kpɛkyɛɛse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">wɔlɛɛ daase ŋan bɔɔ mo adao yae ŋa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Be ta too n fereŋkyeŋ keŋ mɔnaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">ba te walaa n yele dedoi keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Bɛɛ yako be konɔɔse man nyiaa, &lt;Dee munu wɔ korakora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">ba te wɔlɛɛ botɔɔse ŋan pou bɛɛ som Wurubuarɛ nɛ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Da te naa kolo lee Wurubuarɛ gyaŋ keŋ dɛɛ mo gyene ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">Wurubuarɛ gbalara baale ba tekaa kyaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">te de man ŋolo ba gyeŋ debaŋ keŋ ke gyae ke kɔŋ ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Wurubuarɛ, woromɔ yaa n kɔlare ŋon waa tina neŋ kekulu yela?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">N kɔlare ŋon waa wɔlɛɛ n yele kekpaakekpaa?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Woŋ dɔɔ te n wɔŋa n nyiŋmaa lee wɔle, n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa keŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">Wɔŋ ke lese lee n kegba man na n ke wɔlɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Mɔna Wurubuarɛ yɛna me Gyoo leenaŋ gyaŋgba gyaŋgba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">ŋon ne lɛɛna balaŋ nyee tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Nyaŋ moona n doŋ kpase ɛpo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">n yɛlɛɛ wonembukum ŋon nyee loŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Nyaŋ yɛlɛɛna wonembukum ŋon nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">te n moo e fa wonembia baŋ be kyaa depampaa man nɛ nyi baa di.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Nyaŋ yelela te boŋobiise na atiribuŋse torowɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">te n yelaa booneŋ ŋan bɛɛ yoo ya nɛ yoowɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Tɛɛkena yɛɛ n wui, te nelim mɔ yɛɛ n wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">nyaŋ moona weese na gyaalaŋ see ŋa akyaese man.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Nyaŋ doona tɛɛle kei wuluse pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">nyaŋ seena dekpao na dugbutu.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɔɔse mena keŋ n kɔlara ne kulu neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">na mena keŋ ayiŋtena ne wɔlɛɛ n yele.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Na mo n duwuluŋ fa ŋale man wonembiakumɛɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">naa wolee n balaŋ baŋ bɛɛ naase wɔ diyem nɛ nyeedoŋ kekpaakekpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Tɔɔse n nɔɔkebakesee keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">nawolo nyi nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ te lɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ yenaŋ kamasɛ keŋ ba gyoo detiŋtɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Naa yele baa do baŋ bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do nɛ desɛŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">yela ayematena na baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya nɛ ka lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, koro yoo lɛɛ n wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">tɔɔse mena keŋ ayiŋtena ne kulu neŋ wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Naa wolee mena keŋ n kɔlara ne kolosina neŋ baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">na yeesa ŋan bɛɛ mo fae neŋ debaŋ kamasɛ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ nombiadiiri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Wurubuarɛ, dɛɛ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">dɛɛ lese n yele nawolo nyi n yele benaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:1">te balaŋ ne yako n gyakoloŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />N yakowɔ nyiaa &lt;&lt;Maa kɔŋ ma debaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">na me kaa di nombia na kegbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Nyi akpaa tɛɛle de wosi te baŋ be kyaa ke dɔɔ pou de seree na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">maŋ ne kyaŋana ka mokɔɔ seŋ keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Me yako baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose nɛ nyiaa, &lt;Ɛ naa gate ɛ wose ya&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">te me yako akpanyanyaŋte nyiaa, &lt;Naa gyina n woo adido ya&gt;<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Ɛ naa gyina ɛ woo tee adido ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">te ɛ na kolosi konɔɔyuŋ man ya.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Nombia kedi ta lee weese dɛɛlee yaa weese dɛɛyalae yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">yaa depampaa keŋ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Wurubuarɛ yɛna nombiadiiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">Ŋon ne yɔkɔsena walaŋ te ɔ ne gyina walaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Degbeŋgyoo dana leenɔɔ ɔ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">waen keŋ kɛɛ lee afofo te bɔɔ mo abɔɔ ofoŋnyiŋan kyakale ke man nɛ te wulu ke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:8">Ɔ toosi ŋaale fa tɛɛle kei dɔɔ akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">te be nyɔɔ ke popou.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Maŋ dɔɔ, maa kolosi n nombia kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">na maa kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon,<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />ŋon ɔ be yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Maa tekerii akpanyanyaŋtena pou woo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">mɔna maa gyina baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ woo adido.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ ŋon Ɔ be yoodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">76:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asafe nɔɔneŋ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Ba gyeŋ Wurubuarɛ Yuda, te ɔ yele kerɛɛ Iserae<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Ɔ kanyaŋ deni doo Salem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">te ɔ dekyae yɛna Siyɔn.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Botɔɔ te ɔ tekerii baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋan ne ŋalakee nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">na yoo nyeela pampasaŋse ŋan na yoosilase na yoo abɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Kanea ne ŋalakee n man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">te n yele te lɛɛ kela bulase te n dii n kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Be te kuu yoo abɔɔ lee dekpataakpere ŋon gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">Te be doowɔ yeŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:5">Yoonɔɔtena baŋ man ŋolo te tale fokaa ɔ nyiŋmaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ, n ke kalana wɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">dɛɛkyɔŋ na anebiliŋiŋ yeŋawɔ.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Nyaŋ te kaboena nyi baa yee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">Nyi akpaa n gyeŋ baŋ na amɔte ne gyaela waa tale seŋ n siaman?<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />N kolosi n nombiakedi lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8">te gyakoloŋ gyoo tɛɛle keŋ te be yɛɛwɔ diiŋ<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />Debaŋ keŋ nyaŋ, Wurubuarɛ n ba koro nyi n ke di nombia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">na n ke lɛɛ baŋ pou bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do tɛɛle kei man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Anokoare, n baŋ nedoŋ na mo yele kalese kɔna neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">te baŋ bɔɔ tale seŋ n baŋ man nɛ, baa di n nɔɔkedi keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Ɛ kaŋ ntam fa Degbeŋgyoo ɛ Wurubuarɛ na ɛ ke di ke dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">Ɛ yela baŋ bɔɔ kilisi ŋon pou nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ka mo abɔɔ kaa fa ŋon kaboena nyi baa yee e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Ŋon ne tekeriina siamantena awoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">te tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyooneŋ ne yee e.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s1">Kekolosido Wose Kekyaŋ Man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Me fae yeesa keŋkeŋ baake Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">me fae yeesa keŋkeŋ na Wurubuarɛ ke nyii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Ma wose kekyaŋ man me kɛo Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">nelim ma tenee me nyiŋmaase menɛɛ keŋ te takaa maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">me wɔe mɔ te fɛɛ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Wurubuarɛ me tɔɔse neŋ, te ma toroŋwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">ma gyueŋwɔ te ma wose yɔkɔse maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />N te kpeŋ ma dosoroŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">ma te yala koyololo keŋ ma te tale kolosi ya.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Me tɔɔse gyaŋgba keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">kulutooneŋ akaalaŋaŋ ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Me tɔɔse me nelim nɔɔneŋse ŋan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">Ma gyueŋwɔ te me bɔɔse ma wose nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo waa bɛɛ walaŋ kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Ɔ be gyae waa wii walaŋ bela yee?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ ta yoo kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">Ɔ keyakosee keŋ te taŋ kekpaakekpaa?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Wurubuarɛ te wolee nyi waa wii walaŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">Ɔ moo baŋ tɔ ɔ deeli keyɛɛ nɔɔ baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Te me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Keŋ ne takaa maŋ yɛna nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">gyaŋgba keŋ na nafɔ Adidote ŋon dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa dana yuŋ.<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Maa tɔɔse abɔɔ ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">Ayi, maa tɔɔse n gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan n be yɛɛ gyaŋgba gyaŋgba nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Maa tɔɔse n tomse ŋan n be yɛɛ nɛ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">na maa gyueŋ gyakoloŋ nombia dinaana ŋan n be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Wurubuarɛ, n gbɛɛneŋ yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">wurubuarɛ woŋti kereela ŋgba de Wurubuarɛ nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon n ne yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">n na lese n baalabiiri wola balaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />N moo n nyiŋmaa dekpataakpere lɛɛ n balaŋ nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">Yakɔbe na Yosɛfo duuluŋ man balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Wurubuarɛ, loŋse naa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">loŋse naa neŋ te gyakoloŋ gyoo ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">loŋse ateta wosiwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Ŋɔma ŋan yelaa ɔga ŋɛɛwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">ɔga faewɔ lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">n baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋalakeewɔ yenaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Be nyii nyɔ ɔga kefae koloŋoloŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">nyɔ ɔga keŋmaale ŋmaalewɔ tɛɛle pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">tɛɛle sereewɔ te ke wosiwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />N doo gbɛɛ ta ɛpo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">n gbɛɛ tɛɛwɔ booneŋ dinaana man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">mɔna ba te naa n nawɔɔ detɛe ya.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />N tɛɛwɔ Mosesi na Aarɔn dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">ta n balaŋ siaman ŋgba namense nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s1">Kawola Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Me balaŋ, ɛ nyii me kawola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">ɛ tei me nɔɔman nombia.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Maa gyuusu me nɔɔ kolosi aduya man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">maa yako gyaŋgba nombia ŋan ŋa weesɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />Nombia ŋan dɔɔ nyii na ŋan da gyeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">na ŋan de naanaɔ be yako daa.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Daa be gyae dɛɛ mo ŋa weese be bia ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">dɛɛ yako kalola kegyakaare keŋ ke gyae kekɔŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:4">abɔɔ kpaakpaa ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">ɔ doŋ na gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Ɔ see adansɛɛ kedi mokɔɔ fa Yakɔbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">te ɔ see mmaraa Iserae,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:5">te ɔ yako de naanaɔ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">baa wola be bia mena mmaraase ŋenaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />Na kalola kegyakaare keŋ gyae ke kɔŋ nɛ ka gyeŋ ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">na bia baŋ be ta lolata wɔ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">na baŋ mɔ ka wola be bia.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Kenaŋ na baa mo ba wose lɔ Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">na bɔɔ wolee abɔɔ ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">mɔna baa di wɔ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Baŋ be gyae baa yɛɛ ŋgba be kyaɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">kalola kegyakaare deŋele doŋtena na baŋ bɛɛ koro seŋ tia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:8">baŋ ba te lɛɛ Wurubuarɛ di nideli ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">te be te di anokoare fa e ya nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Doo nyi Ɛferayimtena baala moo baŋdaŋse baa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">mɔna be yeuwɔ yoo wee keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Be te di Wurubuarɛ nɔɔkebakesee keŋ dɔɔ ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">te be bɛɛwɔ be te di wɔ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Be wolee ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ wola wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Ɔ yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia be naanaɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">Soan tɛɛle dikpii dinaa keŋ kyaa Igyipite tɛɛle man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />ɔ kpase ɛpo man te ɔ moo wɔ toŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:13">ɔ yelaa loŋ seŋawɔ ŋgba dekyaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Tɛɛ de naa na ɔ na mo debuŋta ta be siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">tɛɛ de yuu na ɔ na mo boalaŋ keŋmaŋee bo.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Ɔ yɛlɛɛ kpanaŋse depampaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">te ɔ faa wɔ loŋ burum ŋgba ɛpose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Ɔ yelaa boŋobiise bɛɛwɔ lee kpanaŋse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">te ɔ yelaa loŋ waalewɔ ŋgba booneŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Mɔna be gyakaa bɛɛ yɛɛ dukum tia e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">ba seŋawɔ tia Adidote ŋon depampaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Be naawɔna sia kɛɛse Wurubuarɛ kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">te be bɔɔse e weenɛɛ ŋan ne gyɔ wɔ loo.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Be kolosiwɔ tia Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">be yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;Wurubuarɛ waa tale fa daa weenɛɛ depampaa kei man?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Ampaŋ ɔ gyɔɔ kpanaŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">te loŋ bɛɛwɔ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">booneŋ wuuwɔ waale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:20">mɔna waa tale fa daa weenɛɛ mɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">Waa tale fa ɔ balaŋ naane?&gt;<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Mena dɔɔ Wurubuarɛ kenyii mena nɛ, ɔ gyeŋa baŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">ɔ yelaa boalaŋ kpaa Yakɔbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">te ɔ gyeŋa baŋ do Iserae nideli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />nawolo nyi ba te lɛɛ Wurubuarɛ di ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">te be ta mo ba wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ nyi waa tale lɛɛ ba nyee ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Mɔna ɔ kolosiwɔ fa ŋɔma adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">te ɔ toro adido anaanɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />Ɔ yelaa maana yalawɔ lee adido fa wɔ te be diiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">ɔ faa wɔ adido weenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Denibalaŋ dii Wurubuarɛ kpilara weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">ɔ faa wɔ weenɛɛ ŋan gyae ka yee wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Ɔ yelaa weese dɛɛlee feliŋ gyɔɔwɔ lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">te ɔ moo ɔ doŋ yela ata yenaŋ feliŋ gyɔɔwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Ɔ yelaa naane yalawɔ be dɔɔ lee adido ŋgba akuŋkuŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">gyebuse ŋgba ɛpo nɔɔman aŋasa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Ɔ yelaa be yalawɔ be deyilae kyaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">mo kilisi ba dekyae keŋ gyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Be diiwɔ baa ba kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">nawolo nyi ɔ faa wɔ kpene keŋ be gyɔ wɔ loo.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Mɔna pɛ baa koro lee weenɛɛ ŋan tɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">keŋ weenɛɛ ŋan sɛɛ doo be nɔɔse man nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Wurubuarɛ gyeŋa baŋ do wɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">ɔ koe be man doŋ nyibaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">te ɔ gyɔɔ Iserae tewulɛɛ lɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Kɛŋa pou wɔle na, be gyakaa bɛɛ yɛɛ dukum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">lee gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ pou wɔle na, bɔɔ ne lɛɛ e di ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Mena dɔɔ ɔ kara ba weeya dɔɔ ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">te ba kulutooneŋ ŋaalaawɔ kayeyɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Akpaa Wurubuarɛ da koe wɔ na, bee sila ɔ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">bɛɛ kyɛɛkee lee be gbɛɛneŋ kumɛɛ man bese kɔŋ ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Be tɔɔsewɔ nyi Wurubuarɛ yɛna be kpanaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">nyi Wurubuarɛ Adidote ŋon lɛɛna wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Mɔna ba moo be nɔɔse gyaabii e bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">te ba moo be laakemse dii akɛrɛɛ fa e,<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />be te di anokoare fa e ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">be te di ɔ nɔɔkebakesee keŋ dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Mɔna ɔ wii be waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ɔ moo be nombiakumɛɛ kyɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">keŋ ɔ te wɔlɛɛ wɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:38">Debaŋ kamasɛ akpaa ɔ gyeŋ baŋ na ɔ ne nyiŋ konɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">keŋ ɔ bɛɛ mo ɔ baŋ nedoŋ keŋ wɔŋ ba deŋele ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Ɔ tɔɔsewɔ nyi be yɛɛ wosenaane ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">ŋgba feliŋ keŋ ne gyɔɔ gyu te bɛɛ bese kɔŋ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Ba korowɔ seŋ tia e depampaa keŋ man agbaatee agbaatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">te be yelaa waraŋase kyaŋa e depampaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Be kɛɛse Wurubuarɛ kɛɛ agbaatee agbaatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">ba doo Iserae fereŋkyeŋte ŋon baŋ.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Ba te tɔɔse ɔ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">wee keŋ ɔ be lɛɛ ba nyee lee be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man nɛ ya,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />wee keŋ ɔ be yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia Igyipite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">na nombia dinaana Soan tɛɛle man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Ɔ yelaa be booneŋ bese fatabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">ba te tale nyɔɔ ba loŋse ŋan ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Ɔ kpila keraase akpii akpiise kaa doŋee wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">te apɔtɔrɔse kaa wɔlɛɛ ba abɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Ɔ moo be wɔɔse man weenɛɛ fa akpataana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">te ɔ moo abɔɔ ŋan bɔɔ duu be wɔɔse man nɛ fa akpataanabia.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Ɔ yelaa akpeleŋkpeleŋbia wɔlɛɛ be gerepose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">na be fiigi daase.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Ɔ moo akpeleŋkpeleŋbia koe be nunkyuese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">ɔ moo ɔga keŋmaale koe be namense.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Ɔ lese ɔ baŋ nedoŋ wola wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">ɔ tɔɔman ŋan na ɔ sibii keyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">na Wurubuarɛ kpilara dikpii baŋ bɛɛ wɔlɛɛ abɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Ɔ lese ɔ baŋ wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">ɔ ta lese wɔ lee yeŋ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">mɔna ɔ yelaa yeŋ kawee kaa yala wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Ɔ koe Igyipitetena bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">be bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ lee Ham kanyaŋ deni man.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Mɔna ɔ lese ɔ balaŋ lee Igyipite ŋgba namense nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">ɔ tɛɛwɔ be siaman depampaa keŋ man ŋgba namense nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Ɔ gyee wɔ wɔe kefɛɛ man keŋ ba te yee ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">mɔna ɛpo keŋ wuu be kɔlara dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Ɔ moo wɔ kɔŋ ɔ tɛɛle fereŋkyeŋ keŋ wulu man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">kelii bula dɔɔ donɔɔ keŋ ɔ ba mo ɔ dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa lɛɛ ke nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Ɔ gegi tɛɛlese lee be siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">te ɔ moo be tɛɛlese fa wɔ ŋgba be dedii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">ɔ yelaa Iserae akpaŋalaŋse ŋan kyaawɔ be denɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Mɔna be kɛɛse Wurubuarɛ kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">te ba korowɔ seŋ tia Adidote ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">be te di wɔ mmaraase dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Mɔna be yɛɛ deŋele doŋ keŋ be te di anokoare ya ŋgba be naanaɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">ŋgba baŋdaŋ keŋ be goo ke na bee de ketɔ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Ba moo bulase ŋan dɔɔ bɛɛ som be bɛɛneŋ nɛ do e baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">be yelaa ɔ yoo nuŋkurili lee be bɛɛneŋ baŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Wurubuarɛ kenyii wɔ nɛ, ɔ gyeŋa baŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">ɔ bɛɛ Iserae korakora.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Ɔ bɛɛ ɔsom deni keŋ kyaa Silo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">kanyaŋ deni keŋ ɔ be bam denibalaŋ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Ɔ yelaa be kɔlara yoowɔ di ɔ doŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">ɔ moo ɔ doŋ na ɔ gyoorobiiri do ɔ kɔlare nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Ɔ yelaa ba moo yoosila koe ɔ balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">ɔ gyeŋa baŋ do ɔ dedii.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Boalaŋ kpaa be bia tewulɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">keŋ be bia alebia te kpee alowɔlere nɔɔneŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Ba moo yoosila koe be saese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">keŋ be liala te nyiŋ gbɛɛ wii ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Keŋte Degbeŋgyoo korowɔ ŋgba ɔ foŋae lee dosoroŋ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">ŋgba doŋte ŋon ɔ be dɛɛse doo foŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Ɔ yoo ɔ kɔlara yela ba besewɔ be wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">ɔ yelaa desɛŋ kyaŋa wɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Keŋte ɔ bɛɛ Yosɛfo ɔsom deni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">ɔ ta lese Ɛferayim dekpaŋalaŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Mɔna ɔ lese Yuda dekpaŋalaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">Siyɔn bula keŋ ɔ ne gyae nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Ɔ baŋa ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ ka korowɔ ŋgba adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">ŋgba ɔ ka see tɛɛle kei mokɔɔ kekpaakekpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Ɔ lese ɔ tobaale Dawide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">te ɔ moo e lee namense dɔɔ kekɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />Ɔ lese e lee namense dɔɔ kekɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">nyi ɔ kaa kɛɛ ɔ balaŋ Yakɔbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">na ɔ dedii Iserae dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Dawide lese ɔ konɔɔ man kɛɛ Iseraetena dɔɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">ɔ moo adao gbɛɛneŋ man ta be sia man.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Iserae kelɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, tɛɛlese te kaa gyoo n dedii man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">ba te walaa nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa fereŋkyeŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">ba te yɛlɛɛ Yerusalɛm pou.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Be te tina n tewulɛɛ woya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">lɔ gyebuse nyi baa di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">n balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ baŋ naane fa ŋale man wonembia.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Ba te kyɛɛkee n balaŋ fatabo leki ŋgba loŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">mo kilisi Yerusalɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">te ŋolo be kyaa waa wuu woya baŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Baŋ ba benaana daa nɛ, bɛɛ mo daa yɛɛ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">baŋ bɔɔ kilisi daa nɛ ne kulu daa.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, woromɔ? Nyaŋ ka gyeŋ baŋ kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">n nuŋkurili baŋ keŋ yɛɛ ŋgba boalaŋ ne kpaala nɛ, gyae ke doo kelii woromɔ?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Lese n baŋ wola tɛɛlese balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">baŋ bɔɔ gyeŋ neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:6">wola gyooridediise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">baŋ bɔɔ na som neŋ ya nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />nawolo nyi be ta ko Yakɔbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">te be wɔlɛɛ ɔ donɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Naa wɔŋ da deŋele lee de naanaɔ dukum keŋ bɔɔ yɛɛ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">kɛɛ daa na n ke wii de waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">nawolo nyi ta kela daa nideli.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Wurubuarɛ da nyeelɛɛre, kyɔ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">lee gyoorobiiri keŋ n yele be lɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:9">lɛɛ daa na n ka mo de dukum kyɛɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">lee n yele keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Woŋ dɔɔ te kaboena nyi tɛɛlese baa bɔɔse nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">&lt;&lt;Aleŋ yaa be Wurubuarɛ ŋon kyaa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 79:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:10">Yela dɛɛ naa tɛɛlese siaman nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">n te wɔŋ ba deŋele mo tɔ n tewulɛɛ baŋ bɔɔ koe nɛ kom.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Nyii baŋ bɔɔ kyaŋ wɔ tɔ deni nɛ kewii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">mo n doŋ keŋ ka dokoso be kyaa ya nɛ, gyee baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa ko wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, tɔ de tebia baŋ kom betabo nyetooro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">lee tuubia ŋan bɔɔ mo wuraa neŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Dekɔŋ mena na, daa n balaŋ baŋ de yɛɛ n namensewɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">dɛɛ lese n yele kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:13">de kalola kegyakaare man pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">dɛɛ lese n yele debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Wurubuarɛ na waa besena Iserae seŋ bela</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Nyaŋ Iserae namensekɛɛlere, nyii daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">nyaŋ ŋon n ne tɛɛ Yosɛfo siaman ŋgba namense dikpii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:1">nyaŋ ŋon n ne kyaa kerubise dɔɔ gyoorobiiri man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">lese n wose debɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Ɛferayim na Bɛneyamen na Manase siaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:2">Lese n wɔɔle wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">kɔŋ na n kaa lɛɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, besena daa see de daseŋae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">booli n sia fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">na dee nyiŋ nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">nyaŋ ka gyeŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">do n balaŋ kefane kelii woromɔ?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />N moo siasaraŋ besena weenɛɛ fa wɔ be diiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">n yelaa be nyɔɔ siasaraŋ leenɔɔtɔɔ ŋgba loŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />N te yele de tebia ne kulu daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">te de kɔlara mɔ na boŋo daa.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere, besena daa see de daseŋae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">booli n sia fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">na dee nyiŋ nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Nyaŋ moona gerepo woŋ lee Igyipite kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">nyaŋ gegina tɛɛlese te n duu ke.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />N desina tɛɛle keŋ fa ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">te ke nyiŋa lila lɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Ke wuluŋ wuu bulase ŋan dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">te ke tombia wuu sida daase dinaana dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Ke tombia fɛlɛɛwɔ kelii ɛpo nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">te ka poteewɔ kelii boo nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Weera n tekerii ka akyaŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">te baŋ pou bɛɛ lam nɛ ne fiu ke bia?<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Kɔŋgbɛɛse ta lee laaman kaa wɔlɛɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">te ŋale man wonembia kaa dii ke bia.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere, bese kɔŋ de gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">Tisina n sia lee adido kɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:14">Kaa kɛɛ gerepo wɔɔ kei dɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />gerepo keŋ n ba mo n dunoluŋ duu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">te n be kɛɛle ke fa n wose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Ba te kara n gerepo keŋ lɔ, be ta too ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">n kalawɔna wɔ te be munuwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Mo n nyiŋmaa gyakaa ŋon ɔ kyaa n dunoluŋ dɔɔ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">deniwalaŋ bu ŋon n be gyina e fa n wose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Kenaŋ na dɔɔ gyae dɛɛ lee n wɔle ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">do daa doŋ, na dɛɛ baake n yele.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere, besena daa see de daseŋae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">booli n sia wola daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">na dee nyiŋ nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s1">Weekedi nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Ɛ mo kenyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Wurubuarɛ de doŋ ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">ɛ fae yeesa keŋkeŋ fa Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Ɛ lɔ nɔɔneŋ, ɛ wosi akyakaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">ɛ gyɔ adolɛɛ na ɛ ke wosi akyakaase.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Ɛ wola nam baale woi gyaalaŋ wɔle weekedi keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">na gyaalaŋ kaseŋ dɛɛ, keŋ dee di da weekedi keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Kei yɛna kawola keŋ doo fa Iserae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">na Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon mmaraa.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Wurubuarɛ kakoro seŋ tia Igyipite nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">ɔ moo ke yɛɛ mmaraa fa Yosɛfo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 81:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:5">Me nyii woya ŋan mɔɔ gyeŋ ŋa ya nɛ yakowɔ nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />ma lese kasolɔse ŋan lee ba nyeeya dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">ma lese be nyiŋmaase lee doŋa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />N wose kekyaŋ man n baake maŋ te ma lese neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">me kpaa neŋ lee ɔgakefae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">me kɛɛse neŋ kɛɛ Meriba boo gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Me balaŋ, ɛ tei maŋ na maa faree ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">Iserae, ma kegyaebii yɛna nyi yaa nyii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Ɛ naa nyiŋ wurubuarɛ wɔle ŋolo ɛ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">ɛ naa som wurubuarɛ ŋolo kpuna maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Maŋ yɛna Degbeŋgyoo ɛ Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">ŋon mɔɔ lese ŋon lee Igyipite tɛɛle man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:10">Ɛ wola ɛ nɔɔ, na maa mo abɔɔ do wulu.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />Mɔna me balaŋ bee nyii maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Iserae te bɛɛ ɔ be nyii me dei ya.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Mena dɔɔ me tinaa wɔ yela lee be konɔɔyuŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">nyi baa yɛɛ baŋ gbagba kegyaebii.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Ao, ma kegyaebii yɛna nyi me balaŋ baa nyii me dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">nyi Iserae waa sila me gbɛɛ na,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />nafɔ maa yɛɛ bileŋ yɔkɔse be kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">na maa besena me nyiŋmaa tia be kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Baŋ bɛɛ kɔla Degbeŋgyoo nɛ baa yɔkɔse ba wose ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">na maa wɔŋ ba deŋele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Maa mo aboŋ kpaakpaate weenɛɛ fa ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">maa mo teebɔɔ kpaakpaate lee kpanaŋ man fa ŋon ɛ ke di baa.<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ gyoo dinaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">82:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asafe nɔɔneŋ </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Wurubuarɛ kyaa gbeli man adidotena degyaŋee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">ɔ ne di wurubuarɛse nombia.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Woromɔ yaa ɛ ke tina balaŋ kumɛɛ wɔle kaseŋ yela?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">Woromɔ yaa ɛ ke tina balaŋ siaman kekɛɛ yela?<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Ɛ di seŋ baŋ bɔɔ dana doŋ ya, na yoyolobia wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">ɛ di lɛɛ ayematena, na baŋ bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Ɛ lɛɛ baŋ bɔɔ dana doŋ ya na ayematena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">ɛ lɛɛ wɔ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Wurubuarɛse baŋ ba gyeŋ daale ya, te bɔɔ ne nyii kolo man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">be dɔŋ bo detiŋtɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">tɛɛle mokɔɔ kasee pou ne wosi.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɛ yɛɛ &lt;wurubuarɛsewɔ&gt;,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">ɛ popou yɛɛ Adidote ŋon bia tewulɛɛwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Mɔna ɛ ka yeŋ ŋgba deniwalaŋ kamasɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">ɛ nyeedoŋ gyae ke gyu ɔto ŋgba gyoo kamasɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, koro di tɛɛle kei nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">nawolo nyi tɛɛlese pou yɛɛ n wui.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Iseraetena kɔlara dɔɔ kedi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, naa kyaa yididi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">naa tɔ n deŋela ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">Ao Wurubuarɛ, naa kyaa yakaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Kɛɛ mena keŋ n kɔlara ne di deboŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">kɛɛ mena keŋ n kɔlara ne gyina ba nyeeya.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Bɛɛ mo adao gbɛɛ bake n balaŋ nyeeman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">bɛɛ bake mena keŋ baa di baŋ n ne gyee wɔ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;Ɛ kɔŋ, na dee munu balaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">na ŋolo be tɔɔse Iserae yele bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Bɛɛ yɛɛ nɔɔdokoloŋ bake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">bɛɛ bake n nyeeman.<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Baŋ yɛna Ɛdomtena na Isimaeletena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6">na Moabetena na Hagaritena,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebaletena na Amonitena na Amaleketena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:7">Filisitena na Tirotena.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Asiriyatena mɔ te gyu ke kpuna wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">na baa do Lɔte duuluŋmantena doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Yɛɛ wɔ ŋgba mena keŋ n be yɛɛ Midiatena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">na Siseratena na Yabinetena Kison boo nɔɔman nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />N munu wɔ Endore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">te ba bese woŋsila tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Yɛɛ be gyoorobia ŋgba n ke yɛɛ Orebo na Seebe nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">be gyooneŋ ŋgba Seba na Salemuna nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />Bɛɛ yako nyi, &lt;Ɛ yela dɛɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">Wurubuarɛ tɛɛle keŋ bese de dedii.<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Me Wurubuarɛ, yɛɛ wɔ ŋgba koloŋoloŋ man akuŋkuŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">ŋgba wura te feliŋ gyɔɔwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Mena keŋ boalaŋ ne kpa laa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">yaa boalaŋ laakemse ne yele bulase ne kpaa nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />mena te mo n feliŋkum gyakaa be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">na n ka mo n feliŋ nɔɔdoŋte keŋ ŋmaase wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">na baa nyiŋ sila n yele gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ wɔ, na ba wose ke gbirisi wɔ kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">na baa munu ba desɛŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Yela baa gyeŋ nyi nyaŋ ŋon n yele yɛna Degbeŋgyoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">nyaŋ nyaageŋ yɛna Adidote tɛɛle kei pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s1">Sia keyɛɛ kɛo Wurubuarɛ ɔsom deni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">n dekyae dana kyeo nideli.<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Degbeŋgyoo dekpaŋalaŋ man kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">ne gyɔ ma woo loo nideli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ kyaa kekpaakekpaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">ne gyɔ me konɔɔ na ma wose pou loo nideli.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Akpeelee gba koraŋ dana dedoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">te kamelegyagyaa dana desaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">keŋ man ɔ na mo ɔ bia see,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">botɔɔ benaana n kedeesaboe keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere yɛna me Gyoo na me Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Baŋ be kyaa n dekpaŋalaŋ man nɛ baŋna nyeebam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">bee kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Baŋ be doŋ ba lee n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">te be konɔɔse gyakaa Siyɔn gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ nɛ baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Nyi be dɔŋ Siasaraŋ detaŋgya keŋ man na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">bee yele botɔɔ na bese depaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">ɔga gyaŋgbate ne yele botɔɔ na bese depaa.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Bee nyiŋ doŋ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">kelii debaŋ keŋ baa kaa lee Wurubuarɛ siaman Siyɔn.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere, nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ, tei maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, kɛɛ de yoo nyeele pampasaŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">wii walaŋ ŋon n be tiu e nuŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />N dɛɛ kekyaa wee dokoloŋ dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">kela yenaŋ daale kekyaa weeya burum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">Ma kegyae yɛna nyi maa kyaa me Wurubuarɛ dɛɛ ŋgba denaanɔɔ gyeeri nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">kela nyi maa kyaa akpanyanyaŋtena dɛɛgyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ yɛɛ ŋgba weese na yoo nyeele pampasaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ɔ na boele walaŋ te ɔ na do e obuo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:11">ɔ bɛɛ bɛɛse baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">kolo kpaakpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Degbeŋgyoo Dekpataakpere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">ŋon ɔ na mo n wose lɔ n dɔɔ nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa Iserae deeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ wiina n balaŋ baŋ be kyaa tɛɛle kei dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">te n besenaa Yakɔbe dedii fa e.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />N moo n balaŋ nombiakumɛɛ kyɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">te n wuu be nombiakumɛɛ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />N moo n baŋ pou see yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">te n tinaa n baŋ nedoŋ keŋ yela.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Ao Wurubuarɛ da nyeelɛɛre, besena daa see da dekyae bene man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">na n ka lese n baŋ lee de dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Nyaŋ ka gyeŋ baŋ do daa kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">Nyaŋ ke yela n baŋ ke doo kelii de kalola kegyakaarese dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />N ba do daa doŋ bela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">na n balaŋ ke nyaŋee lee n man yee?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, lese n kegyae keŋ be taŋ ɔto ya nɛ wola daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">na n ke yela dee nyiŋ n nyeekelɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Maa tei keŋ Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ waa yako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">ɔ yakowɔsee nyi waa fa ɔ tewulɛɛ baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ wosefɛɛreŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">mɔna be naa bese keyɛɛ diyiŋ nombia ya.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Ampaŋ, ɔ nyeekelɛɛ benaana baŋ bee yee e nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">na ɔ gyoorobiiri ke kyaa de tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Kegyae na anokoare kedi gyae ke gyaŋeena dɔŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">na nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ na wosefɛɛreŋ ke pukaa dɔŋa.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Anokoare kedi gyae ketu lee tɛɛle keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">na nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ ka lee adido.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Ampaŋ Degbeŋgyoo waa fa daa abɔɔ kpaakpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">na de tɛɛle ke de weenɛɛ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ gyae ke ta ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">na ke desina gbɛɛ ɔ nawɔɔ kekulu man.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyii maŋ na n ke kpa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">nawolo nyi me yɛɛ diyemte e, te me nombia dana waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Gyee ma nyee, nawolo nyi mee di anokoare fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">lɛɛ n tobaale ŋon ɔ na mo ɔ wose lɔ n dɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:2">Nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ,<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">nawolo nyi nyaŋ te mɛɛ baake wee pou.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela n tobaale ke nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">nawolo nyi mɛɛ mo me loo gyakaa n dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, n dei te n na mo nombia kyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">n ne gyae baŋ pou bɛɛ baake neŋ nɛ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">tei me kasola.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Ma wose kekyaŋ man, me baake neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">nawolo nyi n ne kpa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Degbeŋgyoo, wurubuarɛse pou man na, ŋolo be kyaa ŋgba nyaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">ŋolo be tale yɛɛ tomse ŋan nyaŋ ne yɛɛ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɛɛlese baŋ pou n be yɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">baa kaa buŋ som neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">na baa mo obuo fa n yele.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Nawolo nyi n boe, te n ne yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">nyaŋ nyaageŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Degbeŋgyoo, wola maŋ n gbɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">na maa nyiŋ ta nya anokoare man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:11">yela maa mo me konɔɔ gyakaa nyaŋ nyaageŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">na maa nyiŋ yee n yele.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, maa mo me konɔɔ pou lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">maa kɛlɛɛ nya akelegyi kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Nawolo nyi n ne gyae maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">nyaŋ lesena maŋ lee yeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">lee woyadɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Wurubuarɛ, baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose nɛ ne yoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">akpanyanyaŋtena ne gyae baa ko maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">bɔɔ ne kala neŋ do kolo man ya.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Mɔna nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ, ŋon n ne wii balaŋ te n na boele wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">n bɛɛ gyeŋ baŋ bileŋbileŋ ya, balaŋ kegyae na anokoare kedi doo n man nideli.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Besena n sia kɛɛ maŋ, na n ke wii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">lese n doŋ wola n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:16">lɛɛ ma nyee nawolo nyi mɛɛ som neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">ŋgba mena keŋ me naa be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Yɛɛ kolo na ka wola nyi n ne gyae maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">na me kɔlara kena na desɛŋ kekyaŋ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo kyɔɔna maŋ te n fɛɛ me wɔe.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalɛm kekɛlɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Ɔ ta see ɔ donɔɔ dinaa keŋ mokɔɔ bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Degbeŋgyoo ne gyae Siyɔn anaanɔɔse ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">kela Yakɔbe akyaese akaŋ ŋan pou.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Wurubuarɛ donɔɔ dinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">bee kolosi nombia kpaakpaa lee n wose man.<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Maa ŋmarase Rahabe na Babilɔn yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">kpuna balaŋ baŋ ba gyeŋ maŋ nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 87:4">Filisitena na Tirotena kpuna Itopiyatena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">na maa yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ba lola kɛwɔ bo Siyɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Baa yako lee Siyɔn wose man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">&lt;Ba lola walaŋ kei na walaŋ ŋonaŋ bo botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">Degbeŋgyoo Adidote ŋon gbagba waa yela baa kyaa gbeli.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Degbeŋgyoo waa ŋmarase do balaŋ baŋ yela tɔne man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">&lt;&lt;Ba lola kei bo Siyɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Baa kpee nɔɔneŋ na baa sɔe nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">&lt;&lt;Ma wose kenyiŋ pou lee n man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s1">Kewii baake</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon n ne lɛɛ ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">nyaŋ te mee wii baake nelim na ka weese.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Yela ma kefane kelii n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">see deŋele na n ke tei me kewii.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Nombia ne takaa maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">te mɛɛ benaa yeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Bɛɛ kala maŋ kpuna baŋ bee gyu yebɔɔ man nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">me yɛɛ ŋgba walaŋ ŋon ɔ be dana doŋ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Be ta lese maŋ see yenaŋ kpuna woya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ŋgba baŋ bɔɔ koo mo wɔ do yebɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:5">baŋ bɔɔ lese wɔ lee n nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">keŋ n bɛɛ tɔɔse wɔ bela ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />N ta mo maŋ do bɔɔ kyilimkyilim keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">bɔɔ keŋ detiŋtɛɛ tuum doo nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />N baŋ gyakaa me dɔɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">n baŋ te wuu maŋ ŋgba kakpela nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />N te wɔŋ ma akoso pou lee ma wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">me ta bese duwaare kolo be gyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:8">n te tɔ maŋ do keŋ mɔɔ tale lee ya.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Kewii te yele me sia bɛɛ naa nideli ya,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 88:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:9">Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ baake neŋ wee kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">me te gyina me nyiŋmaase tee neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Nyaŋ ke yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia wola balaŋ ayeŋɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">Ba woya baa koro lese n yele?<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Baa kolosi n kegyae nombia yebɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">yaa nya anokoare kedi woyadɛɛ?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Ŋolo ne naa n gyakoloŋ nombia detiŋtɛɛ man</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">yaa n katenee ayɛɛsa woyadɛɛ?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ te mee wii baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">nebo na ma kefane ne lii n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Degbeŋgyoo, weera te n bɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">te n moo n sia weese maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Leenaŋ me biatɛɛ te me naa diyem te ma benaa yeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">gyakoloŋ ta gyoo maŋ te ma wose tekerii maŋ lee nya ayɛŋ maŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />N baŋ nedoŋ te gbirisi ma wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">nya ayɛŋ maŋ te wɔlɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Wee dibiliŋ pou na be te kilisi maŋ ŋgba boo kewuu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">ba te tɔ maŋ do yenaase pou.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />N te yele me gyoona na me dɔɔna te wɔŋ ba wose lee me gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">detiŋtɛɛ yɛna me gyoo ŋon ɔ benaana maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s1">Nɔɔneŋ debaŋ keŋ Iserae doo wose kekyaŋ man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lee Degbeŋgyoo kegyae dinaa keŋ wose man kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">maa gyuusu me nɔɔ yako nya anokoare kedi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">fa kalola kegyakaarese pou.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Maa toro yako nyi n kegyae seŋɛɛ keŋkeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">n ta see nya anokoare kedi mokɔɔ adido gbagba.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />N yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;Daa na walaŋ ŋon mɔɔ lese nɛ te bakenɔɔsee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">Ma te kaŋ ntam fa me tobaale Dawide.<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />Maa yela n duuluŋman balaŋ ke kyaa gbeli kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">maa yela n duuluŋman balaŋ ke di gyoori kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, adido na lese n yele lee n gyakoloŋ nombia dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">na nya anokoare kedi n balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ baŋ degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Nawolo nyi amɔte kyaala ŋɔma man keŋ baa mo e maana Degbeŋgyoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">Amɔte wɔela ŋgba Degbeŋgyoo adidotena baŋ man?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ baŋ degyaŋee man na, Wurubuarɛ te bɛɛ mo obuo fa nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">ɔ wose man dana gyakoloŋ kela baŋ pou bɔɔ kilisi e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Degbeŋgyoo Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere, amɔte yɛɛla ŋgba nyaŋ nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">Nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Dekpataakpere, te nya anokoare kedi te kilisi neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Nyaŋ ne diina doŋ ɛpo doŋse dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">akpaa ɛpo de gyɔɔ koro na, nyaŋ ne yɔkɔsena ke.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Nyaŋ yɛlɛɛna Rahabe bogobogo, ŋgba ŋon bɔɔ koo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">n moo n doŋ keŋ yaasee n kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Adido yɛɛ n wui, te tɛɛle keŋ mɔ yɛɛ n wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">nyaŋ seena tɛɛle na ŋan pou doo ke man nɛ mokɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Nyaŋ yɛɛna ado yenaŋ na ata yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">Tabɔ na Hɛremon ne kpee nɔɔneŋ nyaŋee lee n yele dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Doŋ doo n baam man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">n nyiŋmaa dana doŋ, n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa te gyina adido.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Katenee na nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ te n moowɔ see n gyoorogbeli mokɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">kegyae na anokoare kedi dɔŋ n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Degbeŋgyoo, baŋ ba gyeŋ nyi kaboena baa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">te bɛɛ tɛɛ n keŋmaŋee keŋ man nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Wee dibiliŋ na bɛɛ nyaŋee lee n yele dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">na bɛɛ kɛlɛɛ n katenee.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna be gyoorobiiri na be doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">n bɛrɛɛ dɔɔ te dee di de kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Ampaŋ de yoo nyeele pampasaŋ yɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">de gyoo yɛɛ Iserae fereŋkyeŋte ŋon wui.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Gyaŋgba n kolosiwɔ kalesewola man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">fa n tewulɛɛ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:19">&lt;Me ta do yoonɔɔte ŋolo doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">me ta lese tobaale ŋolo lee balaŋ baŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Me ta lese me tobaale Dawide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">me ta mo me nuŋ fereŋkyeŋ keŋ tiu e.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Me nyiŋmaa gyae ke gyakaa ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">ayi, me baam gyae ka do e doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Kɔlare be gyae waa di ɔ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">akpanyanyaŋte be gyae waa ŋere e do ya.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Maa naŋ ɔ kɔlara ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">na maa tuku baŋ bɛɛ kɔla e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Ma anokoare kegyae gyae ke kyaana e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">na maa yela waa di ɔ kɔlara dɔɔ lee ma yele man.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Maa mo ɔ nyiŋmaa gyakaa ɛpo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">ɔ dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa gyakaa booneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Waa baake maŋ nyi, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me kya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">me Wurubuarɛ, na ma nyeekelɛɛ kpanaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Maa lese e yɛɛ me bu gyaŋgbate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">tɛɛle dɔɔ gyooneŋ pou nyee.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Maa gyae e kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">nɔɔ keŋ daa na e be bake nɛ, gyae ke doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Maa yela ɔ duuluŋ man balaŋ kekyaa gbeli kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">ɔ gyoorogbeli gyae kekyaa ŋgba adido nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />&lt;&lt;Akpaa ɔ bia de bɛɛ ma mmaraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">te be te sila me kawola dɔɔ ya,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />akpaa be wɔlɛɛ me kawolase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">te be te di ma mmaraase dɔɔ ya na,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />kenaŋ na maa mo dambila wɔŋ ba deŋele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">maa tuku wɔ lee be nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Mɔna mɔɔ gyae maa lese ma kegyae lee ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">yaa maa bɛɛ nyi mɔɔ di anokoare fa e ya.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Mɔɔ gyae maa lee me nɔɔkebakesee keŋ wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">yaa kyɛɛkee nombii keŋ mɔɔ gyuusu me nɔɔ yako nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Ma te kaŋ ma yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ ntam dokoloŋ kooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">te mɔɔ gyae maa beo Dawide ya.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Ɔ duuluŋ man balaŋ baa di gyoori kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">ɔ gyoorogbeli gyae ke kyaa me siaman ŋgba weese nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Ke gyae ke kyaa gbeli ŋgba gyaalaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">ŋon ɔ ne di adansɛɛ anokoare man adido nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Mɔna n te bɛɛ e te n gegi e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">n ta gyeŋ baŋ nideli do n walaŋ ŋon bɔɔ tiu e Wurubuarɛ nuŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />N ta lee nɔɔkebakesee keŋ ɛmɛɛ na n tobaale be bakesee nɛ wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">n ta mo ayimɛɛ wuu ɔ gyooro kotɔtɔɔ keŋ aŋasa man.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />N te yɛlɛɛ wa akyaŋse ŋan pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">te n tekerii akyaŋse ŋan ne gyee wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Baŋ bɛɛ lam botɔɔ nɛ pou kuu wa abɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">ɔ tebia pou ne kulu e.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />N te gyina ɔ kɔlara dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">n te yele ɔ kɔlara pou ne nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Ke gbagba na, n te tulii ɔ yoosila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">n te yele waa nyiŋ daseŋae yoo man ya.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />N te yele ɔ gyoorobiiri te kɔŋ ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">te n tuŋa ɔ gyoorogbeli keŋ lɔ tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />N te kɔɔkee ɔ tobiiritɛɛ weeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">te n moo desɛŋ wuu e.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Degbeŋgyoo, kelii woromɔ? Nyaŋ ka weese n wose kekpaakekpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Kelii woromɔ yaa n baŋ gyae ke kpa ŋgba boalaŋ nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Tɔɔse nyi ma weeya ta boo ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">Tɔnɔɔ woŋti dɔɔ te n yɛɛ denibalaŋ!<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa kyaa keŋ ɔ ba yem ya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">Amɔte ne gyaela waa tale lɛɛ ɔ wose lee yebɔɔ doŋ keŋ man?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Degbeŋgyoo, n gyaŋgba kegyae keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">dɔɔ n ba sem kaŋ ntam fa Dawide anokoare man nɛ kyaa aleŋ?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɔɔse mena keŋ bee kulu n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">mena keŋ mɔɔ mo tɛɛlese pou nombia gyakaa me konɔɔ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Degbeŋgyoo, n kɔlara ne kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">yenaŋ kamasɛ keŋ n tobaale ŋon n be tiu e nuŋ nɛ de kulu nae na bee kulu e.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:52">Dɛɛkɔŋ mena, Dɛɛkɔŋ mena.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Tɔne Anaarate</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 90-106">Nɔɔneŋ 90—106</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosesi Wurubuarɛ walaŋ ŋon kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ yɛna da keyeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">lee kalola kegyakaarese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Pɛ n ke yɛɛ bulase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">yaa tɛɛle kei pou nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">na nyaŋ yɛna Wurubuarɛ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />N ne yele balaŋ na bese tɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">te n ne yako nyiaa, &lt;Ɛmɛɛ denibalaŋ, ɛ bese gyoo tɛɛle man.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />N siaman na kulutooneŋ kakpoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">wɔɛ ŋgba dana wee keŋ be kaa lam nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">yaa ŋgba nelim kadeke debaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />N ne yele balaŋ ne lam ŋgba dosɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">be yɛɛ ŋgba ŋalese ŋan na potee nebo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />Nebo na ŋɛɛ potee wɔlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">balinɔɔ na, ŋɛɛ boto na ŋe te kpiisi.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />N baŋ te munu daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">te n baŋ beiŋ te yele dee seree.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />N ta lese de nombiakumɛɛ see n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">de nombiakumɛɛ ŋan weesɛɛ nɛ doo n siaman teŋteŋeleŋ.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Da weeya pou te lam lee n baŋ nedoŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">kakeŋee dɔɔ da weeya pou te taŋ.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Da kulutooneŋ yaanɔɔle yɛɛ sɔŋotooro na kufu (70),</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">nyi da kela mena na te dee nyiŋ kulutooneŋ sɔŋonaara (80),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:10">mɔna kaale na waraŋsa te wulu ŋe man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">nawolo nyi ŋɛɛ lam bileŋbileŋ na de ta yem.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Ŋolo ba gyeŋ n baŋ keŋ doŋ ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">N dana baŋ nedoŋ keŋ kaboena nyi baa yee neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Wola daa na dɛɛ gyeŋ da weeya yaanɔɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">na dee nyiŋ nyansa.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyiŋ konɔɔ! N baŋ gyae kedoo kelii woromɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Wii n tewulɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Mo n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ, boele daa nebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">na dee nyiŋ nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ na ke yɛɛ daa gyoŋ da kekyaabii man pou.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Yela dee di gyoŋ tɔ weeya burum ŋan n be naase daa diyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">na kulutooneŋ burum ŋan dɔɔ naa diyem nɛ kom.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Lese nya ayɛɛsa debɔɔ wola n tewulɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">na be bia kena n gyoorobiiri doŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ waa mo ɔ bɛrɛɛ boele daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">yela de nyiŋmaa man tom ke de fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ayi, yela de nyiŋmaa man tom ke de fa daa.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ de gyeere</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Walaŋ ŋon ɔ kyaa Adidote ŋon dekyae man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">waa fɛɛfo Dekpataakpere ŋon wuluŋ tɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />Maa yako Degbeŋgyoo nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me keyeu kagyoo na me gyeere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">me Wurubuarɛ ŋon mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Ampaŋ waa lɛɛ neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">lee kɔtase nyɔɔre kɔta man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">na yeŋ kawee kamasɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Waa mo ɔ wona wuu n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">na n ke yeu kagyoo ɔ beŋkelɛɛ tɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">wa anokoare kedi yɛna n yoo nyeele pampasaŋ keŋ ne gyee neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />N be gyae n ke yee ŋan ne ŋmaase balaŋ nelim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">yaa baŋdaŋ nyeela ŋan ne furufu tɛɛkena,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />yaa yeŋ kawee keŋ dɔŋ detiŋtɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">yaa kayeyɛɛ keŋ ne wɔlɛɛ abɔɔ weese teŋteŋ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Kakpoŋ baa yala n yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">na kakpoŋse kufu (10) ke yala n dunoluŋ yenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">mɔna ŋa be gyae ka benaa neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Nyaŋ ka mo n sia bo kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">na n kena mena keŋ baa tɔ akpanyanyaŋtena kom.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Akpaa n yako nyi, &lt;Degbeŋgyoo te mee yeu kagyoo,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">te n mo Adidote ŋon yɛɛ n dekyae nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />dukum be gyae ke kɔŋ n dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">te nombiikum be gyae ka benaa n kanyaŋ deni ya.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Nawolo nyi waa lese ɔ kpilara dona neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">nyi baa gyee neŋ n gbɛɛneŋ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Baa gyina neŋ adido be nyiŋmaase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">keŋ nyi n be gyae n ka mo n nae gyɔna boe ya.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Nyaŋ ka betee dinaate na wurale dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">nyaŋ ke sakatee dinaate dinaa na doma.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Degbeŋgyoo kpa, keŋ ɔ ne gyae maŋ dɔɔ maa lɛɛ e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">Maa gyee e nawolo nyi ɔ gyeŋ ma yele.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Waa baake maŋ, na maa kpa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">maa kpuna e ɔ wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">maa lɛɛ e na maa mo obuo fa e.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Maa yela waa kyaa kyare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">na maa yela waa naa ma nyeekelɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Ke dei nyi baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">Ao Adidote, dei nyi baa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Baa gyɔ n kegyae keŋ dekpeŋkpeŋ nebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">na nya anokoare kedi nelim,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />adolɛɛ ŋmeeseŋ kufute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">na akyakaa nɔɔneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo, nya ayɛɛsa dana maŋ gyoŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">Me kpee nɔɔneŋ nyaŋee lee n nyiŋmaa man tomse dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, n tomse boe nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">n nyeempɔ man nombia dana siiliŋ.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Baŋ bɔɔ gyeŋ nombia ya nɛ ba gyeŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">ayiŋtena bee nyii nombia man ya,<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />nyi akpanyanyaŋtena da potee ŋgba ŋalese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">te nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra de nyiŋ ba wose ŋgba kyeŋkyeŋkɔɔse koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">baa wɔlɛɛ wɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo, n kerɛɛ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, kɛɛ n kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">ampaŋ n kɔlara baa munu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra pou baa yaasee.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />N te yele me te nyiŋ doŋ ŋgba ŋale man nam nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">n ta mo nuŋ kpaakpaa woli maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Me sia te naa mena keŋ mɔɔ di me kɔlara dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">ma deŋela te nyii akpanyanyaŋtena baŋ bɔɔ seŋ tia maŋ nɛ yeesa.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa nyiŋ ba wose ŋgba baa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">baa bee ŋgba Lebanɔn sida daase,<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />ŋan bɔɔ duu Degbeŋgyoo dekpaŋalaŋ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">baa nyiŋ ba wose de Wurubuarɛ dekpaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Baa se bia ba keŋmɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">baa yɛɛ ŋgba daase nalaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Na kawola nyi Degbeŋgyoo gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">ŋon yɛna me kpanaŋ, te akpanyanyaŋ be doo ɔ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ yɛna gyoo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori, ɔ wuuna gyoorobiiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">Degbeŋgyoo ta mo gyoorobiiri wuu ɔ wose, te ɔ moo doŋ kpaŋ gbegya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">ampaŋ tɛɛle keŋ seŋɛɛ keŋkeŋ, keŋ be gyae ke wosi ya.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Ba see n gyoorogbeli leenaŋ beneŋ beneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">n kyaa leenaŋ gyaŋgba gyaŋgba.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, ɛpose ta koro adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">ɛpose ne fae yeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">ɛpose te gyina ŋa woya ŋɛɛ seree.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />N dana doŋ kela loŋse dinaana yeesa kefae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">doŋ kela ɛpose burum kegyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">Degbeŋgyoo ŋon ɔ kyaa adido yɛna Dekpataakpere.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ mmaraase seŋɛɛ ŋe daseŋae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">n dekpaŋalaŋ yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ nombiadiira pou nyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne tɔ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">Ao Wurubuarɛ ŋon n ne tɔ kom, lese n wose wola.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Tɛɛle kei nombiadiiri, koro seŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">tɔ baŋ bee gyina ba wose nɛ kom ŋgba mena keŋ kaboena wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Kelii woromɔ Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">Kelii woromɔ te akpanyanyaŋtena baa nyaŋee?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Bee kolosi agaŋtaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ne kolosi gyɔ konɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, bɛɛ yɛlɛɛ n balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">bɛɛ ŋere n dedii do.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Bɛɛ kɛrɛɛ liala na ŋɔɔla nyeeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">bɛɛ koe yoyolobia.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Bɛɛ yako nyiaa, &lt;Degbeŋgyoo bɛɛ naa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon bɛɛ gyene ya.&gt;<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Ɛ gyene, ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ba gyeŋ daale ya balaŋ baŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">ɛmɛɛ ayiŋtena, woromɔ yaa ɛ sia gyae kekara?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ deŋele nɛ, ɔ bee nyii yee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">Ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ sibii nɛ, ɔ bɛɛ naa yee?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Ŋon ɔ ne wɔŋ tɛɛlese deŋele nɛ, ɔ be wɔŋ ɛ deŋele yee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">Ŋon ɔ na wola denibalaŋ nombia nɛ, ɔ be dana nyeempɔ yee?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Degbeŋgyoo gyeŋ denibalaŋ nyeempɔse pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">ɔ gyeŋ nyi ŋe yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Degbeŋgyoo, walaŋ ŋon n ne kalena e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">te n na wola e lee nyaŋ mmaraase man nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />N ne yele bee nyiŋ ba wose lee ba wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">kelii debaŋ keŋ baa wula bɔɔ fa akpanyanyaŋtena.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo be gyae waa bɛɛ ɔ balaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">ɔ be gyae waa bɛɛ ɔ dedii ya.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Baa di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ fa baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">te baŋ be konɔɔse man dei nɛ baa sila ke.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa seŋ tia akpanyanyaŋtena dɔɔ fa maŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Amɔte ne gyaela waa seŋ tia nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra dɔɔ fa maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Na Degbeŋgyoo kyɔɔna maŋ ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">nafɔ nnɛ me ta yem me doo woyadɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Akpaa me yako nyi, &lt;Me nawɔɔ ne sarakee nɛ,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ, ne kyaŋana maŋ seŋ keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Nyi nombia de takaa maŋ me konɔɔ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">n kekolosido ne yele me wɔe ne fɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Gyoorogbeli keŋ bee di anokoare ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">gyoorogbeli keŋ ɔ dana kawolase kumɛɛ nɛ, waa tale mo ɔ wose dona neŋ?<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Akpanyanyaŋtena ne yɛɛ nɔɔ tia baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">bu baŋ be nombia dei nɛ fɔɔ nyi baa ko wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo yɛna me gyeere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">te me Wurubuarɛ yɛna kpanaŋ keŋ mee yeu kagyoo.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Waa tɔ wɔ be nombiakumɛɛ keyɛɛ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">na waa wɔlɛɛ wɔ lee ba akpanyanyaŋ keyɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ waa wɔlɛɛ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Ɛ kɔŋ, ɛ yela dee kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">ɛ yela dɛɛ fae yeesa keŋkeŋ fa da nyeekelɛɛ kpanaŋ ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Ɛ yela dɛɛ mo karaŋ kefa kɔŋ ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">na dɛɛ mo nɔɔneŋ kekpee gate ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ dinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">Gyoo Dinaa wurubuarɛse pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Ɔ nyiŋmaa man te tɛɛle dɔɔ abɔɔ pou doo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">bulase dɔɔ abɔɔ pou yɛɛ ɔ wui.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Ɛpo yɛɛ ɔ wui, nawolo nyi ŋon yɛɛna ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">ɔ nyiŋmaase te ɔ moowɔ yɛɛ tɛɛle dowolosa keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Ɛ kɔŋ, ɛ yela dee buŋ som e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">ɛ yela dee tisi buŋ da doona dɔɔ Degbeŋgyoo ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ daa nɛ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Nawolo nyi ŋon yɛna de Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">de yɛɛ balaŋ baŋ ɔ ne kɛɛ de dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">de yɛɛ namense baŋ ɔ ne kɛɛ de dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:7">Akpaa ɛ nyii ɔ woya gyɛŋ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />Ɛ naa yɛɛ konɔɔyuŋ ŋgba mena keŋ ɛ be yɛɛ Meriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">na mena keŋ ɛ be yɛɛ Maasa wee kenaŋ depampaa keŋ man nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Botɔɔ te ɛ naanaɔ kɛɛse maŋ kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">doo nyi be naa keŋ mɔɔ yɛɛ koraŋ nɛ, ba teese me nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Ma gyeŋa baŋ do mena kalola kegyakaare man balaŋ benaŋ kulutooneŋ sɔŋola (40),</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">Me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Be yɛɛ balaŋ baŋ be konɔɔse ba yo gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">be ta gyeŋ me gbɛɛneŋ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Mena dɔɔ ma gyeŋa baŋ kaŋ ntam nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">&lt;&lt;Bɔɔ gyae baa gyoo ma kefɛɛfo man korakora ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ gyoo dinaa ŋon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ wɔle fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">tɛɛle pou ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo. <verse eid="PSA 96:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo, ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">ɛ gyɔ ɔ nyeekelɛɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ wee kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Ɛ gyɔ ɔ gyoorobiiri keŋ dekpeŋkpeŋ tɛɛlese pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia keyɛɛ balaŋ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo kerɛɛ, te ɔ kaboena nyi baa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">kaboena nyi baa yee e kela wurubuarɛse pou.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Nawolo nyi tɛɛlese dɔɔ wurubuarɛse pou yɛɛ bɛɛneŋwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo yɛɛna adido.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Obuo na gyoorobiiri doo ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">doŋ na gyoorobiiri doo ɔ fereŋkyeŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Ɛmɛɛ tɛɛlese pou, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">ɛ mo obuo na doŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Ɛ mo obuo keŋ kaboena Degbeŋgyoo yele nɛ fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">ɛ mo kedeesa abɔɔ kɔŋ ɔ dekpaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Ɛ mo wose keyɔkɔse fereŋkyeŋ som Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">tɛɛle pou ɛ mo wose keseree kɔŋ ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Ɛ yako tɛɛlese man nyiaa, &lt;Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">Tɛɛle seŋɛɛ ke nawɔɔ dɔɔ, be gyae ke wosi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">waa di balaŋ pou nombia kyɛɛkyɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Ɛ yela adido ke nyaŋee, na ke yɛɛ tɛɛle gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">ɛpo na ŋan pou doo ke man nɛ dɛɛ fae yeesa.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Ɛ yela wɔɔse na ŋan pou doo ŋe man nɛ, ke nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:12">daase na laaneŋ pou, ɛ nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />Abɔɔ ŋan pou Wurubuarɛ be yɛɛ nɛ, ɛ nyaŋee Degbeŋgyoo siaman, nawolo nyi ɔ ne kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ɔ ne kɔŋ ɔ kaa di tɛɛle kei dɔɔ nombia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">Waa di tɛɛle kei nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">na waa di balaŋ nombia anokoare man.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori, tɛɛle pou dɛɛ nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 97:1">ɛ yela akpiisebia tɛɛlese pou ke nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Debuŋta na detiŋtɛɛ tuum te kilisi e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">katenee na nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ yɛna ɔ gyoorogbeli mokɔɔ kasee.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Boalaŋ dɔŋ ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">keŋ ne kpa ɔ kɔlara yenaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Ɔ keŋmaale ne ŋmaale tɛɛle pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">tɛɛle naa ke te ke sereewɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Bulase ne yalakee ŋgba keeni nɛ Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">tɛɛle kei pou Gbeŋgyoo siaman.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Adido ne gyɔ ɔ katenee dekpeŋkpeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">te balaŋ pou naa ɔ gyoorobiiri.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Desɛŋ te kyaŋ baŋ pou bɛɛ som bɛɛneŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose lee bɛɛneŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">ɛmɛɛ wurubuarɛse pou ɛ som e.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Siyɔn nyiiwɔ te ɔ nyaŋeewɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">yɛɛ baŋ be kyaa Yuda akuraase man nɛ gyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">Degbeŋgyoo, lee n nombia kedi dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, yɛna Adidote tɛɛle pou dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">be te gyina neŋ adido kela wurubuarɛse pou.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne gyae Degbeŋgyoo nɛ, ɛ kɔla nombiakumɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">nawolo nyi ɔ ne gyee baŋ bee di anokoare fa e nɛ nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">na ɔ te lɛɛ wɔ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Keŋmaŋee ne ŋmaŋee baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">te baŋ be konɔɔse man dei nɛ nyaŋeewɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ tenɛɛ nɛ, ɛ nyaŋee lee Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">na ɛ ka lese ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ ne diina tɛɛle pou dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ wɔle fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">nawolo nyi ɔ te yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">ɔ dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa na ɔ bam fereŋkyeŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">te yele ɔ te yoodi.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Degbeŋgyoo ta lese ɔ nyeekelɛɛ wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">te ɔ lese ɔ katenee wola tɛɛlese balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Ɔ te tɔɔse ɔ kegyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">na wa anokoare kedi fa ɔ balaŋ Iseraetena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:3">Tɛɛle ɔto pou naa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">de Wurubuarɛ nyeekelɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Tɛɛle pou ɛ nyaŋee fae yeesa fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">ɛ fae yeesa kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Ɛ mo adolɛɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">adolɛɛ na nɔɔneŋ kekpee dee wii.<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Ɛ wola kaberɛse na nambaale woi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">ɛ fae yeesa nyaŋee Degbeŋgyoo Gyoo ŋon siaman.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Ɛpo na ŋan pou doo ke man nɛ dɛɛ fae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">tɛɛle na baŋ pou be kyaa ke man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Ɛ yela booneŋ ke gyɔ ŋe nyiŋmaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">ɛ yela bulase pou ke yɛɛ nɔɔ nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />Baa kpee nɔɔneŋ Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">nawolo nyi ɔ ne kɔŋ ɔ kaa di tɛɛle nombia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:9">Waa di tɛɛle nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">na waa di balaŋ nombia kyɛɛkyɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ gyoo dinaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Degbeŋgyoo ne diina gyoori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">tɛɛlese baa seree,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">ɔ kyaa kerubise nsana ɔ ne di gyoori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">tɛɛle dee wosi.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Degbeŋgyoo kerɛɛ Siyɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">be te gyina e adido kela tɛɛlese pou.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Yela baa lese n yele dinaa keŋ ke dana gyakoloŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">Ɔ yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Gyoo ŋon yɛɛ dekpataakpere, ɔ ne gyae nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">nyaŋ seena nombia kedi kyɛɛkyɛɛ mokɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:4">nyaŋ ne diina nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">te n yɛɛ keŋ doona ke gbɛɛ Yakɔbe.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Ɛ gyina Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ ŋon adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">na ɛ ka som e ɔ nawɔɔtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">ɔ yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Mosesi na Aarɔn kpuɛ ɔ saese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">Samuɛle kpuɛ baŋ bɔɔ som e nɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:6">be baake Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">te ɔ kpaa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Ɔ kolosiwɔ fa wɔ lee debuŋta tuum man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">be dii wɔ mmaraase na ɔ kawolase ŋan ɔ be fa wɔ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">n kpaa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:8">nyaŋ yɛna Iseraetena Wurubuarɛ ŋon n na mo dukum kyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">mɔna nyi be yɛɛ dukum na n ne wɔŋ ba deŋele tɔ kom.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Ɛ gyina Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ ŋon adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">na ɛ ka som ɔ bula fereŋkyeŋ keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ ŋon yɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Tɛɛle pou, ɛ nyaŋee fae yeesa fa Degbeŋgyoo.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Ɛ mo gyoŋ som Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">ɛ mo kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ kɔŋ ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Ɛ gyeŋ nyi Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">Ŋon yɛɛna daa, te de yɛɛ ɔ wui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">De yɛɛ ɔ balaŋwɔ, ɔ wonembia dedii man namense.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Ɛ mo karaŋ kefa gyoo ɔ denaanɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">na ɛ ka mo yele kalese gyoo ɔ dekpaŋalaŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">Ɛ fa e karaŋ na ɛ ka lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo dei, te ɔ kegyae kyaa kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">wa anokoare kedi doo fa kalola kegyakaarese pou.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s1">Gyoo keyakosee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Maa kpee kegyae na nombia kedi kegbɛɛ dɔɔ nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ te maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Maa kɛɛ nideli nyi maa kyaa keŋ nombiikum be doo me man ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">Woromɔ te nyaŋ ke kɔŋ me gyaŋ?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:2">Maa mo konɔɔ keŋ nombiikum be doo ke man ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">kyaa ma dekpaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Mɔɔ gyae maa kɛɛ nombia ŋan taŋ tɔnɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">ke kɔŋ me dɔɔ ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:3">Mɛɛ kɔla ŋan nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ne yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">Mɔɔ gyae maa mo ma wose do ŋe man ya.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Konɔɔ keŋ ne tulii nombia naa benaa maŋ ya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">Mɔɔ gyae maa lɛɛ keŋ ke yɛɛ dukum ke do ya.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Ɔkamasɛ ŋon ɔ yoo wɔlɛɛ ɔ dɔɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">maa wɔlɛɛ e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:5">Ɔkamasɛ ŋon ɔ dana agaŋtaŋ te ɔ ne gate ɔ wose nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">mɔɔ gyae maa sɛɛ e ya.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Me sia gyae ke gyakaa baŋ bee di anokoare tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">na baa kyaa me gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">ŋon nombiikum be doo ɔ wose man ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">waa som maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Ŋon ɔ na beo balaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">be gyae waa kyaa ma dekpaŋalaŋ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:7">ŋon ɔ ne di dekara nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">be gyae waa seŋ me siaman ya.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Nebo kamasɛ maa lese akpanyanyaŋtena pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">lee tɛɛle keŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:8">Maa munu nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">lee Degbeŋgyoo donɔɔ dinaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋon ɔ ne kaa nɛ kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, tei ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">yela me kewii baake kelii n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Naa lese n sia yela maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ma wose kekyaŋ man ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:2">tei maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">wee keŋ me baake neŋ na, kpa maŋ bileŋ.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Nawolo nyi ma weeya ne ŋaalaa ŋgba nyɔɔse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">me ŋɔɔ te laŋe ŋgba kosɔ man nyewalaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Me konɔɔ te laŋe te ma botowɔ ŋgba ŋale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">ma te wolee me weenɛɛ kedi gba.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Me kɛɛ keŋee keŋkeŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">ma te kaa ŋɔɔŋɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Me yɛɛ ŋgba depampaa man ɔpɛtɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">ŋgba kpilim ŋon ɔ kyaa donɔɔ keŋ bɔɔ tu lee ke man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Mɔɔ ne doo ya, ma te yɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">ŋgba gyebu ŋon ɔ kyaa deni nyee dɔɔ waageŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Wee pou na me kɔlara na tee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">baŋ bee kulu maŋ na mo ma yele faalaa.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Nawolo nyi mee di tɔŋ ŋgba me weenɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">te mɛɛ mo siasaraŋ kyakale keŋ mɛɛ nyɔɔ nɛ man,<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />lee n baŋ nedoŋ keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">nawolo nyi n ta fokaa maŋ fuŋ lɔ yenaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ma weeya yɛɛ ŋgba balinɔɔ wɔŋtaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">Me ta wolo ŋgba dugbututɛɛ ŋale nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Mɔna nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo, n kyaa gyoorogbeli dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">n yele doo kalola kegyakaarese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Nyaŋ ka koro na n ke wii Siyɔn waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">nawolo nyi debaŋ te lii nyi nya wii e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">debaŋ kenaŋ te lii.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Nawolo nyi ɔ boya na lee koya fa n tewulɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">wa akuŋkuŋ ne yɛɛ wɔ waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Tɛɛlese baa yee Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">tɛɛle dɔɔ gyooneŋ pou baa mo obuo fa n gyoorobiiri.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo waa bese baŋ Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">na waa lese ɔ wose ɔ gyoorobiiri man.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Waa nyii ayematena kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">ɔ be gyae waa bɛɛ be kasola ya.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Ɛ yela baa ŋmarase kei see kalola kegyakaare baŋ baa kɔŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">nyi balaŋ baŋ be ta lolata wɔ ya nɛ baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo kyaa ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man adido te ɔ tisinaa ɔ sia kɛɛ tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">ɔ kyaa adido te ɔ kɛɛ tɛɛle keŋ,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />na waa nyii balaŋ baŋ bɔɔ kyam tɔ deni nɛ katoroŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">na waa yela baa tina baŋ bɔɔ bu wɔ yeŋ fɔɔ nɛ yela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Na baa gyɔ Degbeŋgyoo yele dekpeŋkpeŋ Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21">na baa lese ɔ yele Yerusalɛm,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />debaŋ keŋ balaŋ na gyooridediise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">de gyaŋee nyi baa som Degbeŋgyoo.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Me biatɛɛ te Degbeŋgyoo yɔkɔse me doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">ɔ te kɔɔkee ma weeya.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Mena dɔɔ me yakowɔ nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:24">&lt;&lt;Ao me Wurubuarɛ, naa lese maŋ lee ma weeya nsana ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">n kulutooneŋ doo kalola kegyakaarese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Leenaŋ kewalaŋ te n see tɛɛle kei mokɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">te adido mɔ yɛɛ n nyiŋmaa man tom ke.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Ŋe gyae ke wɔlɛɛ, mɔna nyaŋ kyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ŋe gyae ke lɔɔree ŋgba kanyaŋ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Nyaŋ ke kyɛɛkee ŋa ŋgba kanyaŋse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">na ŋa te wɔlɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Mɔna nyaŋ doo n kedoobii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">te n kulutooneŋ be dana ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />N tewulɛɛ baŋ bia baa baŋ lila n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">be duuluŋ man balaŋ baa kyaa gbeli n siaman.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ kegyae keŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Ma woo lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">ŋan pou doo me man nɛ, dɛɛ lese ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ. <verse eid="PSA 103:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Ma woo lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">te naa wolee wa abɔɔ kpaakpaa ŋan pou ya,<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Ŋon na moona n nombiakumɛɛ pou kyɛɛ neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">te ɔ ne kyɔ neŋ n kaweese pou.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Ŋon lɛɛna n nyee lee yebɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">ŋon moona kegyae na waraŋase kewii gyooro kotɔtɔɔ wuu neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Ɔ na mo abɔɔ kpaakpaa ŋan n ne gyae nɛ fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:5">na n tobiiritɛɛ kabese wɔle ŋgba otoloku wui nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Degbeŋgyoo ne di nombia ŋan tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">te ɔ ne di nombia ke gbɛɛdɔɔ fa baŋ bɛɛ ŋere wɔ do nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Ɔ yelaa Mosesi gyeŋa ɔ gbɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">te Iseraetena naa wa abɔɔ ayɛɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Degbeŋgyoo ne wii balaŋ te ɔ na boele balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">ɔ bɛɛ gyeŋ baŋ bileŋbileŋ ya, te ɔ kegyae mɔ boe.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Ɔ be gyae waa kalana balaŋ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">yaa waa mo baŋ do ɔ konɔɔ man kekpaakekpaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Ɔ bɛɛ yɛɛ daa ŋgba mena keŋ de dukum kaboena daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">yaa waa tɔ daa kom ŋgba mena keŋ de nombiakumɛɛ doo nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Nawolo nyi mena keŋ adido korɛɛ kela tɛɛle nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">mena mɔ te ɔ kegyae boe fa baŋ bee yee e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Mena keŋ weese dɛɛlee dana lem lee weese dɛɛyalae nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">mena te ɔ yelaa de nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛ lem lee de gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Mena keŋ kya ne wii ɔ bia waraŋase nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">mena te Degbeŋgyoo ne wii baŋ bee yee e nɛ waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Nawolo nyi ɔ gyeŋ da keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">ɔ ne tɔɔse nyi de yɛɛ akuŋkuŋ ke.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Deniwalaŋ nyeedoŋ yɛɛ ŋgba ŋale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">ŋɛɛ lee ŋgba ŋale man kyeŋkyeŋkɔɔ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />Feliŋ de gyɔ ke na ka te lam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">na ka dekyae ta yoo korakora.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo kegyae doo fa baŋ bee yee e nɛ kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">te ɔ katenee doo fa be naana naanasebia,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />doo fa baŋ bee di ɔ nɔɔkebakesee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">te bɛɛ tɔɔse di wɔ mmaraase dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Degbeŋgyoo ta see ɔ gyoorogbeli mokɔɔ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">te ɔ gyooridedii ne di abɔɔ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo kpilara, ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ɛmɛɛ baalabia baŋ ɛ ne di ɔ nombia dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">te ɛ ne nyii ɔ dei.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Degbeŋgyoo yoonɔɔtena pou ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">ɛmɛɛ ɔ tewulɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne yɛɛ ɔ kegyaebii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo nyiŋmaa man tomse pou ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">yenaase ŋan pou ɔ ne di gyoori.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:22">Ma woo lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Ma woo lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:1">Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, n boe nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">n wuuna obuo na gyoorobiiri.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Degbeŋgyoo ta mo keŋmaŋee milii ŋgba kanyaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">ɔ ne fɛlɛɛ adido ŋgba kanyaŋ deni nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />te ɔ baŋa ɔ deni daase loŋse dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:3">ɔ moo ŋɔma yɛɛ ɔ yookɔtase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">te ɔ ne kyaa feliŋ beŋkelɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Ɔ moo feliŋ yɛɛ ɔ kpilara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:4">boalaŋ laakemse yɛɛ ɔ tewulɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Ɔ see tɛɛle ka mokɔɔ kasee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">keŋ kɔɔ tale wosi korakora ya.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />N moo loŋ siiliŋ wuu ke dɔɔ ŋgba kanyaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">loŋse ŋan korowɔ wuu bulase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Mɔna n kalawɔna loŋse ŋan te ŋe yekiiwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">n faewɔ te be yekiiwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />ŋa korowɔ kela bulase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">ŋe tisiwɔ gyoo ataŋgyase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">gyu botɔɔse ŋan n ba see fa ŋa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />N doo wulu keŋ bɔɔ tale gbaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">keŋ ŋɔɔ wuu tɛɛle dɔɔ korakora bela ya.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Ɔ ne yele loŋse ne puu lee ataŋgyase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">ŋɛɛ lam bulase nsana.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />ŋɛɛ fa ŋale man wonembia pou loŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">ŋale man afurumse na mo ko ba loŋboaneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Adido gyebuse na loo ba asaase loŋse ŋan gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">bee kpee nɔɔneŋse daase tombia ŋan man.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Ɔ ne yele loŋse na lee wa adido adido woli bulase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">ɔ nyiŋmaa man tom ne yele tɛɛle ne baa.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Ɔ ne yele ŋalese ne tuu fa nunkyuese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">te balaŋ ne nyiŋ weenɛɛ duuluŋ fara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">na baa nyiŋ weenɛɛ lee tɛɛle man,<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />na waen keŋ ne yele walaŋ ne di gyoŋ ɔ konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">na nuŋ keŋ gyae ke yela be siagbɛɛ ke ŋalakee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">na weenɛɛ ŋan ne fa wɔ doŋ.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Bɛɛ do Degbeŋgyoo daase ŋan loŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">Lebanɔn sida daase ŋan ɔ be duu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Botɔɔ te gyebuse na loo ba asaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">akyakyaboŋase dana ba adoise kateenaa daase ŋan man.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />bulase ŋan korɛɛ dɔɔ yɛna ŋale man asoose dekyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">gbegyagbegyase ne yeu kagyoo kpanaŋse.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Ɔ yɛɛ gyaalaŋ na waa wola debaŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">weese gyeŋ debaŋ keŋ ɔ na gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />N ne yele detiŋtɛɛ na gyoo, na tɛɛ te yuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">na ŋale man wonembia pou ta lee debɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Dinaatese ne muusu kɛo kolo baa kyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">bɛɛ kɛo be weenɛɛ lee Wurubuarɛ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Weese de bɛɛ na ba te wɛɛlee ba wose laŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">bɛɛ bese ke doo ba adoise man.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Na balaŋ ta lee gyu ba tomse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">bɛɛ yɛɛ ba tomse kelii balinɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Degbeŋgyoo, n tomse boe nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">n nyansa man te n yɛɛ ŋe popou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">nya abɔɔ ayɛŋ te lɛɛ tɛɛle kei pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Ɛpo yaa, ka boe te ke fɛlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">ke man wonembia, ŋolo be tale kala ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">wonembia dinaana na buruburu pou.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Botɔɔ te pantuu dinaana na gyem tisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">Ɛpo man wonembu dinaa ŋon n be yɛɛ nyi waa yoi ke man nɛ doo ke man.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Be popou ne kɛɛ n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">nyi nya fa wɔ weenɛɛ debaŋ kpaakpaate man.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Akpaa n mo ke fa wɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">bee yilaa ŋa see,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:28">akpaa n gyuusu n nyiŋmaa na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">abɔɔ kpaakpaa ne baa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Akpaa n mo n sia weese na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">gyakoloŋ na gyoo wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:29">akpaa n lɛɛ be weesɛɛ lee be man na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">bɛɛ yem na be ta bese gyoo tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Akpaa n fa wɔ weesɛɛ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">be ta lola wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">na kpene kamasɛ ta bese wɔle tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Degbeŋgyoo gyoorobiiri dɛɛ kyaa kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">Degbeŋgyoo dɛɛ nyaŋee lee ɔ tomse dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Ŋon ne kɛɛna tɛɛle na ka te seree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">ɔ tina bulase na ŋɛɛ lee nyɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo ma kekyaa man pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese me Wurubuarɛ yele ma kekyaa man pou.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Ŋan mɛɛ gyueŋ pou dɛɛ gyoo ɔ sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">debaŋ keŋ mɛɛ nyaŋee Degbeŋgyoo man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Mɔna yela nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ke taŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">na akpanyanyaŋtena ke munu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Ma woo, lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ na Ɔ balaŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele, ɛ mo ɔ yele gyɔ dekpeŋkpeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">ɛ yela tɛɛlese ka gyeŋ kpene keŋ ɔ be yɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa e, ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">ɛ kolosi lee gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan pou ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Ɛ gate ɛ wose ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">yela baŋ pou bɛɛ kɛo Degbeŋgyoo nɛ ke nyaŋee be konɔɔse man.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Ɛ kɛo Degbeŋgyoo na ɔ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">ɛ kɛɛ ɔ siaman debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Ɛ tɔɔse gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia, na ɔ nombia kedi keŋ ɔ be dii,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />ɛmɛɛ ɔ tewulɛɛ Aberaham duuluŋ man balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:6">ɛmɛɛ Yakɔbe bia baŋ ɔ ba lese ŋon mo yɛɛ ɔ wui.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Ŋon yɛna Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">ɔ nombia kedi doo tɛɛle pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Ɔ ne tɔɔse ɔ nɔɔkebakesee kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">keŋ ɔ be yakosee fa kalola kegyakaarese kakpoŋ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />nɔɔkebakesee keŋ ɛmɛɛ na Aberaham be bake nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">na ntam keŋ ɔ be kam fa Yisake nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Ɔ seŋawɔ ke dɔɔ fa Yakɔbe ŋgba kawola nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">fa Iserae ŋgba nɔɔkebakesee kekpaakekpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />&lt;&lt;Nyaŋ te maa mo Kaana tɛɛle fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">ŋgba dedii keŋ gyae ke yɛɛ n wui nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Debaŋ kenaŋ be ta boo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">be yɛɛ kyomii nɛ te be yɛɛ ŋɔɔlawɔ botɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />be tɛɛwɔ yeyɛɛ lee tɛɛlese man gyu tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">lee gyooridedii daale man gyu wɔle man.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Ɔ te fa ŋolo gbɛɛ waa ŋere wɔ do ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">lee baŋ dɔɔ te ɔ kalawɔna gyooneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />&lt;&lt;Ɛ naa tina ŋon mɔɔ tiu e nuŋ nɛ ya,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">ɛ naa yɛɛ me gbalara dukum daale ya.<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Ɔ yelaa tanam yalawɔ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">te ɔ wɔlɛɛ be weenɛɛ kenyiŋ gbɛɛneŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Ɔ kpila walaŋ ŋolo kyaŋa wɔ gbɛɛ gyu botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">Yosɛfo ŋon bɔɔ yɔɔ e ŋgba gbeŋi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Ba moo akyakaase do e gyamɛɛ ɔ nawɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">ba moo nyeela bibiini do e ɔ wɔŋe man,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />kelii debaŋ keŋ nombii keŋ ɔ be yako nɛ kɔŋawɔ mena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">kelii debaŋ keŋ Degbeŋgyoo nombia ŋan ɔ be yako kaalaŋ nɛ lesewɔ wola nyi ɔ nombia dei.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Gyoo ŋon kpilawɔ te be ka lese e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">ŋon ɔ ne di balaŋ dɔɔ nɛ yelaa be tinaa e yela.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Ɔ moo e yɛɛ ɔ denimantena kegyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">na wa abɔɔ pou dɔɔ kɛɛre,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />na waa wola ɔ kyaraabia keŋ ɔ ne gyae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">na waa wola ɔ kegyiise nombia.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Keŋte Iserae gyoowɔ Igyipite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakɔbe kyaawɔ Ham tɛɛle man ŋgba ŋɔɔle nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Degbeŋgyoo yelaa ɔ balaŋ wukuwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">te ɔ yelaa ba boowɔ kela be kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Ɔ kyɛɛkee be konɔɔse nyi baa kɔla ɔ balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">te ba moo adao gbɛɛ tia ɔ tewulɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Ɔ kpila ɔ tobaale Mosesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">na Aarɔn ŋon ɔ ba lese e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Be yɛɛ ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia be man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">na ɔ nombia dinaana Ham tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Ɔ kpila detiŋtɛɛ te detiŋtɛɛ gyoo tɛɛle keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">nawolo nyi ba korowɔ seŋ tia ɔ nombia ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Ɔ yelaa ba loŋse bese fatabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">te yela be kpebia yekeewɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Apɔtɔrɔse kaa lɛɛ be tɛɛle keŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">yela ba gyoowɔ be gyooneŋ denɛɛ anedoŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Ɔ kolosiwɔ te kyɔɔse dikpii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">na keraase kaa lɛɛ be tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Ɔ yela akpeleŋkpeleŋbia yalawɔ ɔga nawɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">te ɔga keŋmaale lɛɛ be tɛɛle keŋ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />Ɔ wɔlɛɛ be gerepo wɔɔse na fiigi daase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">te ɔ tekerii be tɛɛle man daase.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Ɔ kolosiwɔ te akpataana leewɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">akpataana baŋ ŋolo be tale kala wɔ ya,<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />be tao ŋalese laŋ nyiŋan pou tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">be tao weenɛɛ pou be tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Keŋte ɔ koe bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ pou be tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ baŋ pou bɔɔ lee ba teŋa man.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Ɔ lese Iserae na ɔ dana kɔba wolom na kɔba yayam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">ŋolo be kyaa ba dekpaŋalaŋ man keŋ ɔ na wee ya.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Yɛɛ Igyipitetena gyoŋ ŋgba bɔɔ lam nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">nawolo nyi na Iseraetena keyee doo be man.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Ɔ fɛlɛɛ ŋɔma wuu be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">na boalaŋ keŋ ne fa wɔ keŋmaŋee nelim.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Be bɔɔsewɔ te ɔ faa wɔ kooliise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">ɔ faa wɔ weenɛɛ lee adido be diiwɔ baa.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Ɔ bɛɛse kpanaŋ man te loŋ puuwɔ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">ke laŋawɔ ŋgba boo nɛ depampaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Nawolo nyi ɔ tɔɔse ɔ keyakosee fereŋkyeŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">ɔ be yako fa ɔ tobaale Aberaham nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Ɔ lese ɔ balaŋ lee botɔɔ na bɛɛ nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">ɔ balaŋ baŋ ɔ ba lese nɛ moo kenyaŋee yeesa laŋ.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Ɔ moo tɛɛlese tɛɛle pou fa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">te ba moo ŋan baale be kaa nyiŋ nɛ bese be dedii,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />na baa nyiŋ di ɔ kawolase dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">na baa di wɔ mmaraase dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ deeli fa Ɔ balaŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">Ɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ, nawolo nyi ɔ dei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">ɔ kegyae kyaa kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa tale yako nombia dinaana ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">yaa waa tale kɛlɛɛ e nideli?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Balaŋ baŋ bee di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">te bɛɛ yɛɛ abɔɔ ŋan tenɛɛ debaŋ kamasɛ nɛ baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, akpaa n boele n balaŋ na tɔɔse maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">akpaa n lɛɛ wɔ na kyɔ maŋ,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />na maa nyiŋ ma wose ŋgba n balaŋ baŋ n ba lese nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">na maa di gyoŋ keŋ n tɛɛle kei dɔɔ balaŋ ne dii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">na maa kpuna n balaŋ na dɛɛ lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Da te yɛɛ dukum ŋgba mena keŋ de naanaɔ be yɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">da te yɛɛ keŋ be dei ya, te de yɛɛ akpanyanyaŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />De naanaɔ kekyaa Igyipite nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">be ta mo n gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan yɛɛ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">ba te tɔɔse n wɔe keŋ n be yɛɛ fa wɔ nɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">te ba korowɔ seŋ tia neŋ Ɛpo Yayam keŋ nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Mɔna ɔ lɛɛ wɔ lee ɔ yele dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">na waa lese ɔ doŋ keŋ ka dokoso be kyaa ya nɛ wola.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Ɔ kalawɔna Ɛpo yayam keŋ, te ka yoowɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">ɔ moo wɔ ta ke man lee ŋgba depampaa man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Ɔ lɛɛ wɔ lee be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">ɔ lɛɛ ba nyee lee be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Loŋ keŋ wuuwɔ mo be kɔlara pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">be man dokoloŋ gba te nyiŋ nyeedoŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Keŋte be lɛɛ ɔ keyakosee keŋ di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">te be kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Mɔ te di weeya ya te be wolee wa ayɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">keŋ ba te daa waa lese ɔ nyeeman nombii debɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Weenɛɛ gyɔɔ wɔ loo nideli depampaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">be kɛɛse Wurubuarɛ kɛɛ depampaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Mena dɔɔ ɔ faa wɔ keŋ bɔɔ bɔɔse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">mɔna ɔ yelaa kaweekum kaa gyɔɔ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Be deyilae kyaa keŋ man nɛ be yoo Mosesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">na Aarɔn ŋon Degbeŋgyoo be gberaa e nɛ nuŋkurili.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Tɛɛle bɛɛwɔ te ke lila Datane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">te ke wuu Abiram na ɔ balaŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Boalaŋ mɔ kaa yalawɔ be balaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">boalaŋ kpaa akpanyanyaŋtena baŋ.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Be yɛɛ nunkyuebu Horɛbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">te ba som bane ŋon bɔɔ mo nyeele yɛɛ e nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Ba yɛɛ nunkyuebu ŋon ɔ ne tao ŋale nɛ dinɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">mo kyɛɛkeena be gyoorobiiri Wurubuarɛ ŋon.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Be wolee Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ be lɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ nombia dinaana Igyipite,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />te ɔ be yɛɛ gyakoloŋ nombia Ham tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">na nombia dinaana Ɛpo Yayam keŋ nɔɔman nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Mena dɔɔ ɔ yakowɔ nyi waa munu wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">mɔna Mosesi ŋon ɔ ba lese e nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:23">seŋawɔ Wurubuarɛ siaman sola fa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">na ɔ baŋ nedoŋ be nyiŋ munu wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Keŋte be bɛɛ tɛɛle kpaakpaa keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">ba te lɛɛ ɔ keyakosee keŋ di ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Ba toroŋwɔ be kanyaŋ denɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">te be te nyii Degbeŋgyoo dei ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Mena dɔɔ ɔ gyinaa ɔ nyiŋmaa kaŋ ntam fa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">nyi waa yela baa yekee depampaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />Waa yela ɔ duuluŋ man balaŋ ka yekee tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">na waa yaasee wɔ do tɛɛle keŋ man pou.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Ba moo ba wose ka do Peo Baal ɔsom man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">te be dii weenɛɛ ŋan bee deesi fa bane ŋon ɔ be dana nyeedoŋ ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Ba moo ba akpanyanyaŋ nombia keyɛɛ do Degbeŋgyoo baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">te kaweekum kaa yala wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Mɔna Finihase korowɔ gyoo ke man pataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">te kaweekum keŋ taŋawɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Kei yelaa ɔ nyiŋa yele nyi ɔ tenɛɛ Wurubuarɛ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">kelii kalola kegyakaarese dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Ba doo Degbeŋgyoo baŋ Meriba boo nɔɔman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">te Mosesi nyiŋa nombia lee baŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Nawolo nyi ba korowɔ seŋ tia Wurubuarɛ feliŋ ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">te nɔɔwoya ŋan tekaboena ya leewɔ Mosesi nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Ba te wɔlɛɛ balaŋ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">ŋgba mena keŋ Degbeŋgyoo be yako wɔ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />Mɔna ba moo ba wose dona wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">te be kasee ba abɔɔ ayɛɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Ba som be bɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">te ŋe kaa bese kɔta kyaŋ wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Ba moo be bia alebia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">na be bia tewulɛɛ deesi fa bɛɛneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Be kyɛɛkee fatabo keŋ dukum be doo ke man ya nɛ leki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">be bia alebia na be bia tewulɛɛ fatabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:38">ŋan bɔɔ mo deesi fa Kaana bɛɛneŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">te fatabo keŋ walaa tɛɛle keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Be walaa ba wose, lee ba abɔɔ ayɛɛsa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">te be yɛɛ kafoŋ lee ba abɔɔ ayɛɛsa man.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Mena dɔɔ Degbeŋgyoo gyeŋa baŋ nideli do ɔ balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">te ɔ kɔla ɔ dedii.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Ɔ moo wɔ do tɛɛlese nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">te baŋ bɛɛ kɔla wɔ nɛ dii be dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Be kɔlara ŋere wɔ do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">te be yɔkɔse wɔ do be doŋ tɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Ɔ lɛɛ wɔ agbaatee agbaatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">mɔna be gyakaa bo bɛɛ yɛɛ deŋele doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">te be yɔkɔse ba wose ba dukum keyɛɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Mɔna ɔ naa be kayeyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">debaŋ keŋ ɔ be nyii be kewii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Lee baŋ dɔɔ ɔ tɔɔse ɔ nɔɔkebakesee keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">te lee ɔ kegyae dinaa keŋ dɔɔ ɔ kyɛɛkee ɔ nyeempɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Ɔ yelaa baŋ pou bɔɔ kyaŋ wɔ yoo gbeŋa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">wii be waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ lɛɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">na n ke yilaa daa lee tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:47">na dɛɛ mo karaŋ fa n yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">na dɛɛ nyaŋee lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo, Iseraetena Wurubuarɛ ŋon yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Ɛ yela balaŋ pou ke yako nyi, &lt;&lt;Dɛɛkɔŋ mena.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="ms">Tɔne Anoŋte</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 107-150">Nɔɔneŋ 107—150</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ deeli yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Ɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ, nawolo nyi ɔ dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">te ɔ kegyae mɔ kyaa kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Yela baŋ Degbeŋgyoo be lɛɛ ba nyee nɛ ke yako be nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">baŋ ɔ be lɛɛ ba nyee lee be kɔlara nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />baŋ ɔ be yilaa lee tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">lee weese dɛɛlee na weese dɛɛyalae, lee ado yenaŋ na ata yenaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Be man baale tɛɛwɔ yeyɛɛ depampaa ŋɛŋerɛŋɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">be te nyiŋ gbɛɛ gyu donɔɔ dinaa daale man be kaa kyaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Tanam na loŋboaneŋ koo wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">te be gbalasewɔ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Be wiiwɔ baake Degbeŋgyoo lee ba wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">te ɔ lese wɔ lee be kaale man.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Ɔ moo wɔ ta gbɛɛ keŋ tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">gyu donɔɔ dinaa keŋ baa kyaa ke man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Ɛ yela baa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ lee ɔ kegyae keŋ be taŋ ɔto ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">na ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ fa denibalaŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Nawolo nyi ɔ ne fa baŋ loŋboaneŋ na ko wɔ nɛ loŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">te ɔ ne fa baŋ tanam na ko wɔ nɛ abɔɔ kpaakpaa.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Baale kyaawɔ detiŋtɛɛ na detiŋtɛɛ tuum man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">be tɔɔ wɔ deni te be doowɔ nyeela akyakaase man naa diyem,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />nawolo nyi ba korowɔ seŋ tia Wurubuarɛ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">te be ta mo Adidote ŋon kawola yɛɛ kolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Mena dɔɔ ɔ ŋere wɔ yela be yɛɛ tom nedoŋ naa diyem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">be kpaŋtewɔ yala keŋ ŋolo be kyaa waa kyɔ wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Keŋte be wiiwɔ baake Degbeŋgyoo lee be kayeyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">te ɔ lɛɛ wɔ lee ba wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Ɔ lese wɔ lee detiŋtɛɛ na detiŋtɛɛ tuum man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">te ɔ tekerii ba agbaragbarase ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Ɛ yela baa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ lee ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">na ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ ne yɛɛ fa denibalaŋ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Nawolo nyi ɔ te tekerii kɔbere anaanɔɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">te ɔ kɛrɛɛ ŋa nyeela bibiina ŋan man aguŋ aguŋ.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Baale bese ayiŋtena lee ba deŋele doŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">te be naa diyem nideli lee be nombiakumɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Weenɛɛ kamasɛ dana wɔ duwaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">te ba benaa yeŋ denaanɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Keŋte be wiiwɔ baake Degbeŋgyoo lee ba wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">te ɔ lɛɛ wɔ lee be kayeyɛɛ kenaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Ɔ kpila ɔ nombii ke kyɔɔ wɔ be kaweese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">ɔ lese wɔ lee yebɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Ɛ yela baa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ lee ɔ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">na gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ ne yɛɛ fa denibalaŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Ɛ yela baa yɛɛ karaŋ kefa kedeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">na baa kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ yako ɔ tomse ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Baale kyaawɔ pantuuse dinaana man ɛpo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">di kebu booneŋ dinaana dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Be naa Degbeŋgyoo tomse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ ɛpo ateta.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Nawolo nyi ɔ kolosiwɔ te feliŋ dinaa gyɔɔwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">te yelaa ɛpo kegyɔ korowɔ adido.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Ŋa korowɔ gyu adido, te ŋe tisiwɔ kɔŋ ateta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">baŋ be kyaa ŋe man nɛ sereewɔ te ba wose yeŋa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Be gyɔɔ be nawɔɔ kpaŋte ŋgba baŋ bɔɔ dɛɛse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">bɔɔ gyeŋ kpene keŋ baa yɛɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Keŋte be wiiwɔ baake Degbeŋgyoo lee ba wose kekyaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">te ɔ lese wɔ lee be kayeyɛɛ kenaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Ɔ yelaa feliŋ dinaa keŋ fɛɛwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">te feliŋ kegyɔ keŋ tinaa kegyɔ yela.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Te yɛɛ wɔ gyoŋ nyi ka te yɔkɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">te ɔ moo wɔ kelii be dɛɛseŋae man ŋgba mena keŋ bɛɛ gyae nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Ɛ yela baa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ, lee ɔ balaŋ kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">na ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan ɔ ne yɛɛ fa denibalaŋ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Ɛ yela baa gyina ɔ yele adido balaŋ degyaŋee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">na baa lese ɔ yele donɔɔ kegyiise degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Ɔ yelaa booneŋ bese depampaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">booneŋ nyee bese tɛɛle dowolosa.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Tɛɛle kpaakpaate bese tɛɛlekum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">lee baŋ be kyaa ke dɔɔ nɛ akpanyanyaŋ nombia keyɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Ɔ besena depampaa yɛɛ depaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">te dugbutu tɛɛle bese booneŋ nyee.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Ɔ yelaa baŋ tanam na ko wɔ nɛ ke kyaawɔ botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">te be kara donɔɔ dinaa kyaa ke man.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Be fara wɔɔse duu gerepo ŋe man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">te be nyiŋa weenɛɛ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Ɔ hiraa wɔ yela be wukuwɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">ɔ te yele be nunkyuese ke kɔɔkee ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Keŋte be yaanɔɔle kɔɔkeewɔ te be yɔkɔse wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">lee kaŋeredo na kaale na waraŋsa kedi dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Ɔ doo be siamantena desɛŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">ɔ yelaa be tɛɛwɔ yeyɛɛ depampaa man botɔɔ keŋ gbɛɛ be doo ya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Mɔna ɔ gyinaa ayematena adido lee be kaale man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">te ɔ yelaa ba loŋtona wukuwɔ ŋgba namense dikpii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ Wurubuarɛ siaman nɛ naawɔ te be nyaŋeewɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">mɔna akpanyanyaŋtena pou wuu be nɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Walaŋ kamasɛ ŋon ɔ sia be kare nɛ, waa gyoo nombia kɛŋa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">na waa gyueŋ Degbeŋgyoo kegyae ayɛɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ lee kɔlara dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, me wɔe te fɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">Maa kpee nɔɔneŋ na maa lese n yele lee me konɔɔ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Adolɛɛ na akyakaa, ɛ foŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">maa gyuusu tɛɛkena.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, maa lese n yele tɛɛlese man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">maa kpee yele kalese nɔɔneŋ fa neŋ balaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Nawolo nyi n kegyae boe, te ka korɛɛ kela adido adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">nya anokoare kedi ne lii ŋɔma man.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Ao Wurubuarɛ, gyina n wose kela adido adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">yela n gyoorobiiri ke lɛɛ tɛɛle pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Mo n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa lɛɛ daa na n ke kyɔ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">na n ke lɛɛ baŋ n ne gyae wɔ nideli nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Wurubuarɛ te kolosi lee ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">&lt;&lt;Maa mo keyoodi kpase Sekem man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">na maa kpase Sukɔte detaŋgya keŋ mɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Gileade yɛɛ me wui, Manase mɔ yɛɛ me wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Ɛferayim yɛna ma nyeele kotɔtɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Yuda yɛna me gyooro gbutu.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Moabe yɛna me tasa anefaafoŋ abɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Ɛdom dɔɔ te mɛɛ kpee maŋ nkyokotase fuŋ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">maa fae keyoodi yeesa Filisitena dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Amɔte ne gyaela waa mo maŋ gyu donɔɔ dinaa keŋ bɔɔ baŋ dekyaŋ kilisi ke nɛ man?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">Amɔte ne gyaela waa ta me siaman gyu Ɛdom?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Na nyaŋ Wurubuarɛ ŋon n be bɛɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">te n bɛɛ tekaa kpuna de yoonɔɔtena nɛ yee?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Kyɔ daa na dɛɛ tale seŋ de kɔlara siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">nawolo nyi deniwalaŋ kekyɔ yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Nyi Wurubuarɛ kpuɛna daa na dee yoo di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">ŋon ne gyaela waa sakatee de kɔlara baŋ.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋolo kaŋorokotee wose kekyaŋ man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ ŋon mɛɛ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">naa kyaa yididi ya,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />nawolo nyi akpanyanyaŋtena na akɛrɛɛtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">te wola be nɔɔse tee maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">be ta mo akɛrɛɛ laakemse kolosi tia maŋ,<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Be ta mo kekɔla nɔɔwoya kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">bee yoo maŋ keŋ ma te yɛɛ wɔ kolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Lee maŋ kɛɛ gyae wɔ nɛ, baŋ na mo nombia bo gyakaa me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">mɔna maŋ ne fane bo fa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Bɛɛ mo dukum tɔ me deeli keyɛɛ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">kekɔla tɔ ma kegyae kom.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Lese walaŋkum ŋolo kaa seŋ tia me kɔlare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">yela ŋon waa kara ɔ nɔɔ nɛ kaa seŋ ɔ dunoluŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Nyi be di ɔ nombia na, yela waa di fɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">yela ɔ kefane ke bu e fɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Ɔ weeya naa boo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">walaŋ wɔle waa mo ɔ dekyae ŋgba siamante nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Ɔ bia baa bese yoyolobiise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">na ɔ wɛɛle ka bese lia alo.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Ɔ bia baa ta yeyɛɛ solee abɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">baa gegi wɔ lee ba akpaŋalaŋ ŋan be yɛlɛɛ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Ɔ komte waa lɛo wa abɔɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">ŋɔɔla baa kuu wa abɔɔ ŋan pou ɔ be yɛɛ tom nyiŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Ŋolo naa yɛɛ deeli fa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">yaa waa wii ɔ bia yoyolobiisi baŋ waraŋase ya.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Ɔ duuluŋ man balaŋ baa munu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">baa lese ba yela lee kalola kegyakaare keŋ gyae ke kɔŋ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Baa tɔɔse ɔ naanaɔ nombiakumɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">be na feefo ɔ naa nombia kumɛɛ ŋan ɔ be yɛɛ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Be nombia kumɛɛ dee doo Degbeŋgyoo siaman kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">na waa nyiŋ lese ba yela lee tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Nawolo nyi ɔ ta gyueŋ nyi waa yɛɛ deeli ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">mɔna ɔ naase ayematena na baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">na baŋ nombia ne takaa wɔ be konɔɔ man nɛ diyem kelii yeŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Ɔ ne gyae balaŋ ke falaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">ŋe dɛɛ bese kɔŋ ɔ dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:17">Ɔ bɛɛ gyae kehiraa nombia ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">ke dee gyu lem lee ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Ɔ doona kefaala ŋgba kegba nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">ke ta gyoo ɔ wose man ŋgba loŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">ke ta gyoo ɔ ŋɔɔ man ŋgba nuŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Ke dɛɛ yɛɛ ŋgba kanyaŋ te ɔ moowɔ milii ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">ŋgba abɔsɔɔ te ɔ moowɔ kpaŋ kekpaakekpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Kei dɛɛ yɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo kom ketɔ fa baŋ bɛɛ mo nombia gyakaa me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">na baŋ bee kolosi ma wose man nombia kumɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Mɔna nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">kyɔ maŋ lee n yele keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">lɛɛ maŋ lee n deeli na n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Nawolo nyi me yɛɛ diyemte e, te mɔɔ dana kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">te me konɔɔ te nyiŋ gyam.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Mɛɛ ŋaalaa ŋgba balinɔɔ wɔŋtaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">ba te gberaa maŋ leki ŋgba dekpataa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Nɔɔ kebake dɔɔ ma doona ne seree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">ma te nyɔe kaase ŋɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Baŋ bɛɛ kɛrɛɛ me nɔɔse nɛ ne kulu maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">be naa maŋ na bee kpiisi ba nyeeya.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Degbeŋgyoo me Wurubuarɛ, kyɔ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">lɛɛ maŋ lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela baa gyeŋ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">n nyiŋmaa te n moowɔ yɛɛ ke.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Baa tale falaa, mɔna nyaŋ n ke hiraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ baŋ bee yoo maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">mɔna yela n tobaale kenyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Desɛŋ dee wuu baŋ bɛɛ kɛrɛɛ me nɔɔse ŋgba mena keŋ bee wuu kanyaŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">na desɛŋ ke milii wɔ ŋgba kegba wurikyim nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Maa mo me nɔɔ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">maa lese ɔ yele balaŋ dikpii dinaa keŋ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Nawolo nyi ɔ seŋɛɛ diyemte dunoluŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">nyi waa lɛɛ e lee baŋ bɔɔ bu e yeŋ fɔɔ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo na Ɔ gyoo ŋon ɔ ba lese nɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Degbeŋgyoo yako me gbeŋgyoo nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:1">&lt;&lt;Kyaa me dunoluŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">kelii debaŋ keŋ maa mo n kɔlara do n nawɔɔtɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Degbeŋgyoo waa fɛlɛɛ n gyooridedii doŋ keŋ lee Siyɔn, na waa yako nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">&lt;&lt;Di gyoori n kɔlara man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />N yoonɔɔtena baa mo ba wose fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">n yoo wee keŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:3">Baa desina ba wose gyoorobiiri fereŋkyeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">n tewulɛɛ baa kɔŋ n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">ŋgba nebo nebo obosuo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Degbeŋgyoo te kaŋ ntam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">te ɔ be gyae waa kyɛɛkee ɔ nyeempɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:4">&lt;&lt;N yɛɛ Wurubuarɛ sae e kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">lee Mɛkesɛdɛke kasee kegyakaare man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Degbeŋgyoo seŋɛɛ n dunoluŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">waa yɛlɛɛ gyooneŋ ɔ baŋ wee keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Waa di tɛɛlese nombia, waa yilaa woya baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">na waa yɛlɛɛ tɛɛle pou dɔɔ gyooneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Waa nyɔɔ boŋobii keŋ doo gbɛɛnaa man nɛ loŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">mena dɔɔ waa yoodi.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Maa mo me konɔɔ pou fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ na balaŋ degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Degbeŋgyoo tomse kerɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">baŋ ŋɛɛ gyoo be sia nɛ pou na gyueŋ ŋe man.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Ɔ tomse na lese wɔ obuo na ɔ gyoorobiiri wola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">te ɔ katenee doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Ɔ ne yele bɛɛ tɔɔse ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">Degbeŋgyoo dana wɔe te ɔ ne wii balaŋ waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Ɔ ne fa baŋ bee yee e nɛ weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">ɔ ne tɔɔse ɔ nɔɔkebakesee kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Ɔ ta lese ɔ tomse doŋ wola ɔ balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">keŋ ɔ ba mo tɛɛlese baale tɛɛlese fa wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ɔ nyiŋmaa man tomse doona ŋe gbɛɛ te ŋa tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">nyaŋ ke tale mo n wose lɔ wɔ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Ŋe doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">ɔ faa ŋa lee anokoare na ŋe gbɛɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Ɔ yelaa ɔ balaŋ nyiŋa ba wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">ɔ see ɔ nɔɔkebakesee kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">ɔ yele yɛna fereŋkyeŋ na gyakoloŋ.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Degbeŋgyoo keyee yɛna nyansa kewalaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">baŋ pou bee di wɔ mmaraase dɔɔ ne nyii nombia man nideli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">Ŋon te kaboena nyi baa lese ɔ yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s1">Walaŋ kpaakpaa kenyaŋee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:1">Baŋ bee yee Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">te wɔ mmaraase na gyoo be sia nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Be bia baa yɛɛ doŋ tɛɛle keŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">Baa hiraa baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ nɛ duuluŋ man bia.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Kede na wose kenyiŋ doo ba akpaŋalaŋ man kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">be katenee gyae ke doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Keŋmaŋee na lee detiŋtɛɛ man fa baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ nombia kpaakpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">na baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ wɔe na baŋ bee wii balaŋ na baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Ne dee fa baŋ be dana wɔe te bɛɛ paa balaŋ abɔɔ lee be konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">na baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ ba abɔɔ kegbɛɛ dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Ampaŋ baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ be gyae baa wosi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">baa tɔɔse wɔ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Bɔɔ gyae baa yee nombiikum daale ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">be wɔe bɛɛ lɔ wɔ ya, bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Be wɔe te fɛɛ wɔ, bɔɔ yee kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">ɔtoman na baa naa nyi be te di be kɔlara dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Be faa ayematena abɔɔ lee be konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">be katenee doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">baa lɛɛ yele na obuo.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Akpanyanyaŋtena baa naa na ka do wɔ baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">baa tao be kela na baa ŋaalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">keŋ akpanyanyaŋtena ne gyae nɛ gyae ke yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo deeli yele kalese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo tewulɛɛ, ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele keŋ yele.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Ɛ yela baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">lee gyɛŋ na kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Lee weese dɛɛlee kelii weese dɛɛyalae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">kaboena nyi baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Be te gyina Degbeŋgyoo kela tɛɛlese pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">ɔ gyoorobiiri korɛɛ kela adido adido.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Amɔte kyaala ŋgba Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">ŋon ɔ kyaa gyooro gbeli dɔɔ adido,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />te ɔ ne gɔŋase kɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:6">adido na tɛɛle nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Ɔ ne gyina ayematena adido lee akuŋkuŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">te ɔ ne gate baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya nɛ lee tɔŋ man,<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />na waa mo wɔ kyaase kyaarabia man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">kpuna ɔ balaŋ kyaarabia.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Ɔ ne yele ɔlamanbo ne nyiŋ dekpaŋalaŋ kyaa ke man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">na ke yɛɛ e gyoŋ ŋgba talabo na ɔ bia nɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:9">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s1">Nyeekelɛɛwee Nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Iseraetena ketu lee Igyipite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">na Yakɔbe duuluŋ man balaŋ ka lee ŋɔɔla tɛɛle man nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Yuda bese Wurubuarɛ balaŋ fereŋkyeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Iserae bese baŋ ɔ ne di be dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Ɛpo naawɔ te ɔ yeuwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">Yɔɔdan besewɔ ɔ wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Bulase toŋeewɔ ŋgba namense baala nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">bulasebia ŋgba namense bia nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Ɛpo, woŋ yɛɛna neŋ te n yeuwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">Yɔɔdan, woŋ kɔŋala te n bese n wɔle?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Bulase, weera te ɛ toŋeewɔ ŋgba namense baala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">te bulasebia toŋeewɔ ŋgba namense bia nɛ?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Tɛɛle, seree Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ŋon siaman,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />ŋon besenaana kpanaŋ yɛɛ depaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">kpanaŋ doŋte bese loŋse deepue lee.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ gbagba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Na daa ya, Ao Degbeŋgyoo, na daa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">mɔna n yele te gyoorobiiri kaboena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">lee n kegyae na nya anokoare kedi dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Woŋ dɔɔ te tɛɛlese ne bɔɔse nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">&lt;&lt;Be Wurubuarɛ kyaa aleŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />De Wurubuarɛ kyaa adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">ɔ ne yɛɛ kpene kamasɛ keŋ ɔ gyae.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Mɔna be banɛɛ yɛna kɔba wolom na kɔba yayam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">denibalaŋ nyiŋmaase yɛɛna ŋa.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Be dana nɔɔse mɔna bɔɔ ne kolosi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">be dana sia mɔna bɔɔ ne naa ya.<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />Be dana deŋela mɔna bɔɔ ne nyii ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">be dana memɔɔse, mɔna bɔɔ ne wɔm nyii ya.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Be dana nyiŋmaase, mɔna bɔɔ ne tina kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">be dana naawɔɔ, mɔna bɔɔ ne tɛɛ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">te bɔɔ na mo be lokotɛɛse fae yeesa ya.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Baŋ bɔɔ yɛɛ wɔ nɛ, baa yɛɛ ŋgba baŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">mena te baŋ pou bɛɛ mo ba wose lɔ be dɔɔ nɛ baa yɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Ɛmɛɛ Iseraetena pou, ɛ mo ɛ wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">ŋon yɛna be kyɔɔre na be yoo nyeele pampasaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Aarɔn dekpaŋalaŋmantena, ɛ mo ɛ wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">ŋon yɛna be kyɔɔre na be yoo nyeele pampasaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ, ɛ mo ɛ wose lɔ ɔ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">ŋon yɛna be kyɔɔre na be yoo nyeele pampasaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Degbeŋgyoo ne tɔɔse daa, te waa hiraa daa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">Waa hiraa ɔ balaŋ Iseraetena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">waa hiraa Aarɔn dekpaŋalaŋmantena,<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />waa hiraa baŋ bee yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">bia na kegyiise pou.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Degbeŋgyoo waa yela ɛ ke wuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">ɛmɛɛ na ɛ bia pou.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Degbeŋgyoo waa hiraa ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">ŋon yɛɛna adido na tɛɛle.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Adido adido yɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">mɔna ɔ ta mo tɛɛle fa denibalaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Na woya na lesena Degbeŋgyoo yele ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">te baŋ bɔɔ tisi gyu woyadɛɛ nɛ bɛɛ lese ɔ yele ya.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Mɔna daa dɛɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">lee gyɛŋ kelii kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:18">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s1">Ŋolo kalese Wurubuarɛ yele ŋgba ɔ ba lese e lee yeŋ man nɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Mɛɛ gyae Degbeŋgyoo, nawolo nyi ɔ nyii ma woya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">ɔ nyii me waraŋase kewii.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Keŋ ɔ ba see deŋele nyii maŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">maa wii baake e ma kekyaa man pou.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Yeŋ ŋmeeseŋ milii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">woyadɛɛ gyakoloŋ gyoo maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">me naa diyem te waraŋase kyaŋa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Keŋte me baake Degbeŋgyoo yele nyi, &lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo lɛɛ ma nyee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Degbeŋgyoo na boele balaŋ, te ɔ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">de Wurubuarɛ ne wii balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Degbeŋgyoo ne gyee baŋ bɔɔ dana kyɔɔre ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">ma wose yɔkɔse maŋ na, ɔ lɛɛ ma nyee.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Ma woo bese gyu n kaa fɛɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo te yɛɛ deeli fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo lesena maŋ lee yeŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">me sia lee siasaraŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">me nawɔɔ lee kekpaŋte man,<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />na maa ta Degbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">denibalaŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Ma moo ma wose lɔ Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ, debaŋ keŋ mɔɔ yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">&lt;&lt;Nombia ne takaa maŋ nideli nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Me wɔe kelɔ maŋ na me yakowɔ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">Walaŋ kamasɛ yɛɛ dekarate e.<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Woŋ yaa maa mo tɔ Degbeŋgyoo kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">lee ɔ deeli ŋan pou ɔ be yɛɛ fa maŋ nɛ dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Maa gyina nyeekelɛɛ leenɔɔ keŋ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">na maa baake Degbeŋgyoo yele fa e karaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Maa tɔ ma alaŋaŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">ɔ balaŋ pou degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Degbeŋgyoo tewulɛɛ fereŋkyeŋ baŋ yeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">na lee koya ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo, ampaŋ me yɛɛ n tobaale e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">mɛɛ som neŋ ŋgba me naa ka som neŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">nyaŋ boolina maŋ lee ma agbaraagbaraase man.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Maa yɛɛ karaŋ kefa kedeesa fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">na maa baake Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Maa tɔ maa alaŋaŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">ɔ balaŋ pou degyaŋee man,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />Degbeŋgyoo ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ dekpaŋalaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">Yerusalɛm nsana nsana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Tɛɛlese pou ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">ɛmɛɛ balaŋ pou ɛ kɛlɛɛ e.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Nawolo nyi ɔ kegyae boe fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">te Degbeŋgyoo anokoare kedi doo kekpaakekpaa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa karaŋ lee keyoodi man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Ɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ, nawolo nyi ɔ dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Ɛ yela Iserae ke yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">&lt;&lt;Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Ɛ yela Aarɔn dekpaŋalaŋmantena ke yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">&lt;&lt;Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Ɛ yela baŋ bee yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ ke yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">&lt;&lt;Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Ma wose kyaŋa maŋ na, me baake Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">te ɔ lese maŋ lee ma wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Degbeŋgyoo kpuɛna maŋ, mɔɔ ne yee ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">woŋ te deniwalaŋ waa tale yɛɛ maŋ?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Degbeŋgyoo kpuɛna maŋ, ŋon yɛna me kyɔɔre.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">waa yoodi me kɔlara dɔɔ, na maa mo me sibii naa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Dei nyi dee yeu kagyoo Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">kela keŋ dɛɛ mo da wose lɔ denibalaŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Dei nyi dee yeu kagyoo Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">kela keŋ dɛɛ mo da wose lɔ kyaarabia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Tɛɛlese pou te kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">mɔna lee Degbeŋgyoo yele man dɔɔ me wɔlɛɛ wɔ pou.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Ba te tɔ maŋ do gyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">mɔna lee Degbeŋgyoo yele man dɔɔ me wɔlɛɛ be popou.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Be te wuu me dɔɔ ŋgba teebɔɔbiise nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">mɔna boalaŋ kpaa wɔ ŋgba sɔɔse nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">Degbeŋgyoo yele man te me wɔlɛɛ wɔ pou.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Be tɛɛse maŋ wɔlewɔle nafɔ maa yala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">mɔna Degbeŋgyoo kyɔɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna me doŋ na me gyeere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">ŋon yɛna ma nyeekelɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />De nyii kenyaŋee na keyoodi yeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ kanyaŋ denɛɛ man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:15">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa ne yɛɛ nombia dinaana.<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Degbeŋgyoo te gyina ɔ dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa adido,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:16">Degbeŋgyoo dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa ne yɛɛ nombia dinaana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Mɔɔ gyae maa yeŋ ya, mɔna maa kyaa nyeedoŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">na maa gyɔ ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ nɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Degbeŋgyoo wɔŋa ma deŋele nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">mɔna ɔ ta mo maŋ fa yeŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Ɛ toro nombia ŋan doona ŋe gbɛɛ nɛ anaanɔɔse fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">na maa gyoo na maa fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Kei yɛna Degbeŋgyoo denaanɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa mo ke man gyoo.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Maa fa neŋ karaŋ nawolo nyi n nyii maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">n ta bese ma nyeekelɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Boe keŋ deni maara be bɛɛ ke nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">kaa bese mokɔɔ kasee boe kpaakpaate.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛɛna kei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">te ke dana gyakoloŋ de siaman.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Gyɛŋ wee kei te Degbeŋgyoo yɛɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">ɛ yela dɛɛ nyaŋee gyɛŋ na ke yɛɛ daa gyoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Ao Degbeŋgyoo lɛɛ da nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">Ao Degbeŋgyoo yela ke gyu nideli fa daa.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Walaŋ ŋon ɔ ne kɔŋ Degbeŋgyoo yele man nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:26">Dee hiraa ŋon lee Degbeŋgyoo ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ɔ te yele ɔ keŋmaŋee te ŋmaŋee fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">ɛ mo tombia tela, na ɛ ke ta lɔ baameŋ nɔɔkedi keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ɛ ta kekyaŋkyaŋ dɔɔ kilisi kedeesaboe keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ, maa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ, maa gyina neŋ adido,<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Ɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ nawolo nyi ɔ dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s1">Degbeŋgyoo mmaraa keŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Baŋ be gbɛɛneŋ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">te bee di Degbeŋgyoo mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ nɛ baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ ɔ kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">te bɛɛ mo be konɔɔ pou kɛo e nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Bɔɔ ne yɛɛ kolokum ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">mɔna bɛɛ tɛɛ ɔ gbɛɛneŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Nyaŋ wolana n gbɛɛneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">ŋan dee di ŋe dɔɔ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Ao, me lookegyakaa yɛna nyi me gbɛɛneŋ dɛɛ tenee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">lee n kawolase dɔɔ kedi man.<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Akpaa ma gyene nyaŋ mmaraase pou nideli nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">nafɔ desɛŋ be gyae ke kyaŋ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Maa mo konɔɔ kpaakpaa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">debaŋ keŋ mɛɛ kasee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Maa di n kawolase dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">naa bɛɛ maŋ korakora ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Sena te tobaale waa tale kyaa fereŋkyeŋ man?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">Lee n nombia ŋan dɔɔ kedi man.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Me ta mo me konɔɔ pou mɛɛ kɛo neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">na yele maa yo gbɛɛ lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Me ta mo n nombia ŋan weese me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">na mɔɔ nyiŋ yɛɛ dukum tia neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">wola maŋ n kawolase ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Maa bese toro yako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">mmaraase ŋan pou ba lee n nɔɔman nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Mɛɛ nyaŋee lee n kegyaebii keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">kela kenyaŋee lee wosekenyiŋ nideli man.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Mɛɛ gyoo n kawolase ŋan man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">te me sia gyakaa n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />N kawolase na gyoo me sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">mɔɔ gyae maa wolee n nombia ŋan ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Yɛɛ deeli fa n tobaale ma kekyaabii man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">na maa di n nombia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Gyuusu me sia na maa naa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan doo nyaŋ mmaraa man.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Me yɛɛ ŋɔɔle e tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">na weese maŋ nyaŋ mmaraase ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Ne gyɔ maŋ loo nideli me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">lee nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />N ne kalena agaŋtaŋtena, baŋ n be falaa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">baŋ yoona gbɛɛ lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan man.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Lese tuubia na desɛŋ lee me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">nawolo nyi mee di nya mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Doo nyi kegyiise ne yilaa bake ma nyeeman koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">n tobaale waa gyoo n kebakesee man.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Nya adansɛɛ nombia na gyoo me sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">ŋan ne kolosila fa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Be te tisina ma woo do tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ lee n nombia ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Ma toro ŋan pou mɔɔ yɛɛ nɛ yako, te n tiranɔɔ fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">wola maŋ n kawolase.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Yela maa nyii n gbɛɛneŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">na maa gyoo n gyakoloŋ nombia man.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Ma woo ne mutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">do maŋ doŋ ŋgba mena keŋ n nombii keŋ doo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Lese maŋ lee akɛrɛɛ gbɛɛneŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">boele maŋ na n ka wola maŋ nyaŋ mmaraa.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Me ta lese anokoare kedi gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">me ta mo me konɔɔ gyakaa nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Degbeŋgyoo, me dana nya mmaraase ŋan man keŋkeŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">naa yele desɛŋ ke kyaŋ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Maa barasena nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ kedi man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">nawolo nyi n te yele mee nyii nombia man nideli.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Degbeŋgyoo, wola maŋ n kebakesee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">na maa sila ŋa kelii ɔto.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Fa maŋ nombia man kenyii, na maa di nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">na maa mo me konɔɔ pou di ŋe dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Mo maŋ ta nyaŋ mmaraase gbɛɛneŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">nawolo nyi ŋan na gyoona me sia.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Yela nya mmaraase nombia ke gyɔ maŋ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">mɔna na wose kenyiŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Lese me sia lee abɔɔ ŋan taŋ tɔnɔɔ ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ lee n nombii keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Seŋ n keyakosee dɔɔ fa n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">na baa nyiŋ yee neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Lese desɛŋ keŋ mee yee nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">nawolo nyi nyaŋ mmaraase dei.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />N gbɛɛneŋ kesila ne gyɔ maŋ loo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">N katenee dɔɔ gyee ma nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Degbeŋgyoo yela n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ ke kɔŋ me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">n nyeekelɛɛ ŋgba mena keŋ n be yakosee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Kenaŋ na maa nyiŋ nombii yako baŋ bee kulu maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:42">nawolo nyi mɛɛ mo ma wose lɔ n nombii dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Naa lese nya anokoare nombii keŋ lee me nɔɔman korakora ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">nawolo nyi me loo gyakaa nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Maa di nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Maa ta wosekelɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">nawolo nyi mee di n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Maa kolosi nya mmaraase ŋan gyooneŋ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">keŋ desɛŋ be kyaŋ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan na gyoo me sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">nawolo nyi mɛɛ gyae ŋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Mee bu nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan te mɛɛ gyae ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">na maa gyoo n kebakesee ŋan man.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Tɔɔse n nombii keŋ n be yako n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">ke man te n faa maŋ loo kegyakaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Kei ne fɛɛna me wɔe me kaale man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">n keyakosee ne gyee ma nyee.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Agaŋtaŋtena ne kulu maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">mɔna me ta lee nyaŋ mmaraa wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Degbeŋgyoo, me tɔɔse n beneŋ mmaraase ŋan na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">me wɔe te fɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Me baŋ na koro nideli lee akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">baŋ bɔɔ bɛɛ nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />N kebakesee yɛna me nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">me dasoe kamasɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ tɔɔse n yele nelim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">nyi maa di nyaŋ mmaraa dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Ke ta bese kpene keŋ mɛɛ yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">nyi maa di n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ yɛna me wui dedii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">ma te yakosee nyi maa di n nombia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Me ta mo me konɔɔ pou mɛɛ kɛɛ n siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">boele maŋ ŋgba mena keŋ n be yakosee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Ma te kɛɛ ma keta man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">te me kyɛɛkee ma naawɔ kekulu man nyi maa di nya mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Maa yɛɛ ɔsaa te mɔɔ dɔɔ wɔle ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">nyi maa di nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Nyi akpanyanyaŋtena da mo ŋmeeseŋ bake maŋ koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">mɔɔ gyae maa wolee nyaŋ mmaraa ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Tɛɛ nsana maa koro fa neŋ karaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Me gyoona yɛna baŋ pou bee yee neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">baŋ pou bɛɛ tɛɛ n gbɛɛneŋ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Degbeŋgyoo, n kegyae te lɛɛ tɛɛle pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">wola maŋ n kebakesee ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Degbeŋgyoo, yɛɛ deeli fa n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">ŋgba mena keŋ n nombii doo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Wola maŋ nombia kagyeŋ na nombia kedi kpaakpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">nawolo nyi me ta mo ma wose lɔ nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Pɛ n ke wɔŋ ma deŋele na me kpase gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">mɔna nɛnɛɛ dɔɔ mee di n nombii keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />N dei, te ŋan n ne yɛɛ mɔ dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">wola maŋ n kebakesee ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Doo nyi agaŋtaŋtena ne ta mo akɛrɛɛ sɔ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">mɔna maa mo me konɔɔ pou di n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Be konɔɔ dana yuŋ te bɔɔ ne wii walaŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">mɔna maŋ dɔɔ nyaŋ mmaraa na gyoo me sia.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Dei fa maŋ ŋgba n be wɔŋ ma deŋele nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">na maa nyiŋ kasee n kebakesee ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Mmaraa keŋ ba lee n nɔɔman na lee koya fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">kela kɔba wolom na kɔba yayam bia kakpoŋse.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />N nyiŋmaase yɛɛna maŋ te n desina maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">fa maŋ nombia man kenyii na maa kasee nyaŋ mmaraase,<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Baŋ bee yee neŋ baa naa maŋ na baa nyaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">nawolo nyi me ta mo me loo gyakaa n nombii keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Degbeŋgyoo, ma gyeŋ nyi nyaŋ mmaraase tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">te n moo anokoare kedi wɔŋ ma deŋele.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Yela n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ ke yako do maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">ŋgba mena keŋ n be yakosee fa n tobaale nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Yela n kewii kekɔŋ me dɔɔ na maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">nawolo nyi nyaŋ mmaraa na gyoo me sia.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Yela desɛŋ ke kyaŋ agaŋtaŋtena nawolo nyi ba te kɛrɛɛ me nɔɔse keŋ ma te yɛɛ kolo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">mɔna maŋ maa gyoo n gbɛɛneŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Yela baŋ bee yee neŋ ka bese kɔŋ me gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">baŋ bee nyii nya mmaraase nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Yela me konɔɔ pou ke sila n kebakesee ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">na desɛŋ be nyiŋ kyaŋ maŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />N nyeekelɛɛ ne gyɔ ma woo loo nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">me ta mo me loo gyakaa n nombii dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Me sia te kɛɛ n keyakosee gbɛɛ kina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">Me kpa, &lt;&lt;Woromɔ te nyaŋ ke yakodo maŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Me yɛɛ ŋgba wonembu tɔne ogele keŋ doo nyɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">mɔna mɔɔ gyae maa wolee n kebakesee ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />N tobaale waa daa kelii woromɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Woromɔ yaa n ke di baŋ bɛɛ naase maŋ diyem nɛ nombia?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Agaŋtaŋtena te wula dowokom fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">keŋ bɛɛ kyaana nyaŋ mmaraase ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Nyaŋ mmaraase pou doona ŋe gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">kyɔ maŋ, nawolo nyi bɛɛ naase maŋ diyem yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Kaa kyomii nafɔ be ta lese maŋ lee tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">mɔna ma te bɛɛ n gbɛɛneŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">na maa di n nɔɔman adansɛɛ nombia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Degbeŋgyoo, n nombii keŋ doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">ka seŋɛɛ adido keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Nya anokoare kedi doo kelii kalola kegyakaarese pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">nyaŋ seena tɛɛle mokɔɔ te ka seŋɛɛ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Nyaŋ mmaraase seŋɛɛ kaalii gyɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">nawolo nyi abɔɔ pou na som neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Nyi nyaŋ mmaraase deŋ ta gyoo me sia ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">nafɔ meŋ wɔlɛɛwɔ ma diyem kena man.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Mɔɔ gyae maa wolee n gbɛɛneŋ korakora ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">nawolo nyi ŋe dɔɔ te n tɛɛwɔ yela me nyiŋa nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Lɛɛ ma nyee, nawolo nyi me yɛɛ n wui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">me te di n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Akpanyanyaŋtena na deke maŋ baa wɔlɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">mɔna maŋ maa gyoo nya mmaraase man.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Ma te naa nyi abɔɔ kpaakpaa pou dana ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">mɔna nyaŋ mmaraase be dana ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Ao, mena keŋ mɛɛ gyae nyaŋ mmaraa keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">mɛɛ gyoo ke man wee dibiliŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Nyaŋ mmaraase doo me gyaŋ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">ŋa te yele me ta gyeŋ nombia kela me kɔlara.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Ma gyeŋ nombia kela ma wolara pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">nawolo nyi mɛɛ gyoo nya mmaraase man,<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Mee nyii nombia man nideli kela kegyiise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">nawolo nyi mee di n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Ma te wɔŋ ma wose lee dukum kamasɛ keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">na maa di n nombia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Me ta lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan wɔle ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">nawolo nyi nyaŋ wolana maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />N nombia dana maŋ gyoŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">gyoŋ kela teebɔɔ doola me nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />N gbɛɛneŋ yelela mee nyii nombia man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">mena dɔɔ mɛɛ kɔla gbɛɛkum kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />N nombii yɛɛ kanea fa me nawɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">na keŋmaŋee me gbɛɛnaa man.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Ma te kaŋ ntam te me lɛɛ ke do,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">nyi maa di nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Ma te naa diyem nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">Degbeŋgyoo, fa maŋ nyeedoŋ lee n nombii keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Degbeŋgyoo, lɛɛ me nɔɔman yele kalese kedeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">na n ka wola maŋ nyaŋ mmaraase.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Doo nyi ma nyeedoŋ doo me nyiŋmaa man debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">mɔɔ gyae maa wolee nyaŋ mmaraase ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Akpanyanyaŋtena te nyɔɔ maŋ kɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">mɔna ma te kpase lee n gbɛɛneŋ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Nyaŋ mmaraase yɛna me dedii kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">ŋan yɛna kenyaŋee me konɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Ma te yɛɛ ma nyeempɔ nyi maa di n kebakesee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">kelii ɔto.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Mɛɛ kɔla baŋ ba nyeempɔse yɛɛ ala ala nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">mɔna mɛɛ gyae nyaŋ mmaraa.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Nyaŋ yɛna ma keyeu kagyoo na ma yoo nyeele pampasaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">me loo gyakaa n nombii dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Ɛmɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra, ɛ lee me gyaŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">na maa nyiŋ di me Wurubuarɛ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Tela maŋ ŋgba mena keŋ n be yakosee nɛ, na maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">naa yele me loo kegyakaa ke yɛɛ yakaa ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Kyaŋ maŋ na maa nyiŋ kelɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">maa mo obuo fa n kebakesee debaŋ kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />N te bɛɛ baŋ pou bɔɔ kpase lee n kebakesee ŋan wɔle nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">nawolo nyi ba adao gbɛɛneŋ pou te yɛɛ yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />N te bɛɛ tɛɛle kei dɔɔ akpanyanyaŋtena pou ŋgba woŋsila nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">mena dɔɔ mɛɛ gyae nya mmaraase.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />N keyee te yele ma wose ne seree maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">mee yee nyaŋ mmaraase.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Ma te yɛɛ keŋ tenɛɛ na keŋ doona ke gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">naa tina maŋ yela fa baŋ bɛɛ ŋere maŋ do nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Kɛɛ nyi n tobaale te nyiŋ ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">na yele agaŋtaŋtena ka ŋere maŋ do ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Me sia te kɛɛ n nyeekelɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">na n keyakosee keŋ tenɛɛ nɛ gbɛɛ kina.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Yɛɛ deeli fa n tobaale lee n kegyae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">na n ka wola maŋ n kebakesee.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Me yɛɛ n tobaale e, fa maŋ nombia man kenyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">na maa gyeŋ nya mmaraase<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Degbeŋgyoo, debaŋ te lii keŋ nya yɛɛ kolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">nawolo nyi ba te yala nyaŋ mmaraa keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Nawolo nyi mɛɛ gyae nyaŋ mmaraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">kela kɔba yayam, kela kɔba yayam kpaakpaate,<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />te keŋ mɛɛ kɛɛ n gbɛɛneŋ pou nyi ŋe dei dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">mɛɛ kɔla gbɛɛkum kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Nyaŋ mmaraase dana gyakoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">mena dɔɔ mee di ŋe dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />N nombia man kalese wola ne fa keŋmaŋee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">ne yele ŋon ɔ ba gyeŋ kolo ya na gyeŋ nombia.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Ma te wola me nɔɔ mee lilii nɔɔloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">nawolo nyi nyaŋ mmaraase ne gyɔ maŋ loo.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Besena kɛɛ maŋ na n ke wii me waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">ŋgba mena keŋ debaŋ kamasɛ n ne yɛɛ fa baŋ bɛɛ gyae n yele nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Gyee me nawɔɔ kekulu ŋgba mena keŋ n nombii doo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">naa yele dukum kamasɛ ke di me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Lɛɛ maŋ lee denibalaŋ kaŋeredo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">na maa nyiŋ ta n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Booli n sia fa n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">na n ka wola maŋ n kebakesee.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Siasaraŋ ne laŋ me sia ŋgba boo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">nawolo nyi bɔɔ ne di nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Degbeŋgyoo, n tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">te nyaŋ mmaraase doona ŋe gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Nyaŋ mmaraa keŋ n be yako see nɛ tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">baa tale mo wose lɔ ŋe dɔɔ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Ne yɛɛ maŋ baŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">nawolo nyi me kɔlara te bɛɛ n nombia.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Me ta gyoo n keyakosee ŋan man nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">te n tobaale ne gyae ŋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Doo nyi mɔɔ doo daale man ya te bee kulu maŋ koraŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">mɔɔ ne wolee n gbɛɛneŋ ŋan ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />N gbɛɛneŋ katenee doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">te nyaŋ mmaraa yɛɛ anokoare.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Kayeyɛɛ na kaale te yala maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">mɔna nyaŋ mmaraase ne yele mɛɛ nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Nyaŋ mmaraase tenɛɛ debaŋ kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">fa maŋ nombia man kenyii na maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Mɛɛ baake neŋ lee me konɔɔ pou man, kpa maŋ Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">na maa di n kebakesee dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Mee wii baake neŋ, lɛɛ maŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">na maa di nya mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Mɛɛ karatɛɛ wii baake neŋ nyi nya kyɔ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">me ta mo me loo gyakaa n nombii dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Me sia bee wuu nelim pou ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">na maa nyiŋ gyoo n keyakosee ŋan man.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Nyii ma woya lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">gyee ma nyee, Degbeŋgyoo, lee nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Baŋ bɛɛ yɛɛ akpanyanyaŋ nombia ta benaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">mɔna baŋ na nyaŋ mmaraase nsana dana lem.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo, nyaŋ benaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">te nyaŋ mmaraase pou yɛɛ anokoare.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Lee gyaŋgba gyaŋgba te ma gyeŋa nya mmaraase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">nyi nyaŋ seena ŋa mokɔɔ nyi ŋe dee doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Kɛɛ me kaale na n ka lese maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">nawolo nyi ma te wolee nyaŋ mmaraa ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Di me nombia fa maŋ na n ke yoo lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ lee n keyakosee keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Nyeekelɛɛ na akpanyanyaŋtena nsana dana lem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">nawolo nyi bɔɔ ne kɛo n kebakesee ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Degbeŋgyoo, n waraŋase kewii boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">gyee ma nyee lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Me kɔlara baŋ bɛɛ naase maŋ diyem nɛ boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">mɔna me ta lee nya mmaraa wɔle ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Me naa baŋ bɔɔ ne di anokoare ya na, be dana maŋ ahiŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">nawolo nyi bɔɔ ne di n nombii dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Kɛɛ mena keŋ mɛɛ gyae n gbɛɛneŋ ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">gyee ma nyee, Degbeŋgyoo, lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />N nombia pou yɛɛ anokoare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ taŋ ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Kegyiise ne naase maŋ diyem yakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">mɔna n nombii te mɛɛ mo obuo fa.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Mɛɛ nyaŋee lee n keyakosee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">ŋgba ŋon ɔ be nyiŋ yooman abɔɔ burum nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Mɛɛ kɔla dekara te ke dana maŋ duwaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">mɔna mɛɛ gyae nyaŋ mmaraa.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Mɛɛ lese n yele betabo nyetooro wee dokoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">lee nyaŋ mmaraase ŋan tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Wosefɛɛreŋ gbagba doo fa baŋ bɛɛ gyae nyaŋ mmaraa keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">te kolo be tale yela baa gyɔ be nae ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Mɛɛ daa n nyeekelɛɛ, Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">te mee di nyaŋ mmaraase dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Mee di n gbɛɛneŋ na nya adansɛɛ nombia dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">nawolo nyi mɛɛ gyae ŋa nideli.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Mee di n gbɛɛneŋ na nya adansɛɛ nombia dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">nawolo nyi n gyeŋ me gbɛɛneŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Degbeŋgyoo, yela me kewii kelii n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">fa maŋ nombia man kenyii lee n nombii keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Yela me kasola kelii n gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">lɛɛ maŋ lee n keyakosee keŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Maa gyuusu me nɔɔ lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">nawolo nyi n wola maŋ n kebakesee.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Me laakem gyae ka mo n nombii kpee nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">nawolo nyi nyaŋ mmaraase pou tenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Yela n nyiŋmaa kaa kyɔ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">nawolo nyi mɛɛ tɛɛ n gbɛɛneŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Degbeŋgyoo, n nyeekelɛɛ ne gyɔ maŋ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">te nyaŋ mmaraa ne yele mɛɛ nyaŋee.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Yela maa nyiŋ nyeedoŋ na maa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">na n ke yela nyaŋ mmaraase ke kyɔ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Ma te kpase ŋgba nam ŋon ɔ ba yoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">kɛo n tobaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">nawolo nyi ma te wolee nyaŋ mmaraase ya.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Me kaale man me wiiwɔ baake Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">te ɔ kpaa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Degbeŋgyoo lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">lee akɛrɛɛ nɔɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">na akɛrɛɛ laakemse man.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Nyaŋ laakem dekarate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">woŋ te waa mo fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">yaa woŋ te waa mo yɛɛ neŋ?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Waa mo yoonɔɔte baŋdaŋ nyeele kyɔŋkyɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">na nyewalaŋ ŋɛɛ wɔŋ n deŋele.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Nyi me kyaa Mɛsɛke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">yaa me kyaa Kedare kanyaŋ denɛɛ man na maa laako.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Ma te kyaa balaŋ baŋ bɛɛ kɔla wosefɛɛreŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">man kyare gbaa.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Maŋ ne gyae wosefɛɛreŋ bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">mɔna nyi me kolosi na, baŋ ne gyae yoo bo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">Degbeŋgyoo de gyeere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">121:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gbɛɛ keta nɔɔneŋ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Me gyinaa me sia tee bulase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">aleŋ yaa ma kekyɔ gyae ka lee kɔŋ?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Ma kekyɔ gyae ka lee Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ adido na tɛɛle nɛ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Ɔ be gyae waa yela n ke kpaŋte ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">ŋon ɔ ne kɛɛ n dɔɔ be gyae waa deŋeli ya.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Ampaŋ ŋon ɔ ne kɛɛ Iserae dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">be gyae waa deŋeli yaa waa doo ya.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Degbeŋgyoo ne kɛɛ n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">Degbeŋgyoo yɛna n wuluŋ n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa yenaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Weese be gyae waa wɔlɛɛ neŋ weese teŋteŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">yaa gyaalaŋ nelim ya.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Degbeŋgyoo waa gyee neŋ lee nombiikum kamasɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">waa kɛɛ n nyeedoŋ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Degbeŋgyoo waa kɛɛ n kalee na n kagyoo man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">lee gyɛŋ kelii kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalɛm yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Yɛɛ maŋ gyoŋ, debaŋ keŋ bɔɔ yako maŋ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">&lt;&lt;Ɛ yela dee gyu Degbeŋgyoo dɛɛ&gt;&gt; nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Yerusalɛm, de nawɔɔ seŋɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">n denaanɔɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Be baŋa Yerusalɛm bo ŋgba donɔɔ dinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">keŋ bɔɔ baŋ ke kyaŋna dɔŋa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Botɔɔ te akpaŋalaŋ ŋan ne gyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">Degbeŋgyoo akpaŋalaŋ ŋan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 122:4">ne gyu ka lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">ŋgba mena keŋ bɔɔ fa Iseraetena mmaraa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Be ta see gyooro gbelɛɛ botɔɔ baa kyaa di nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">Dawide denimantena gyooro gbelɛɛ ŋan.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Fane sola wosefɛɛreŋ fa Yerusalɛm nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">Dee de fa baŋ bɛɛ gyae neŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Wosefɛɛreŋ dɛɛ kyaa n donɔɔ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">na wosekenyiŋ na kegyee ke doo n gyooro dekpaŋalaŋ man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Lee me denimantena na me gyoona dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">maa yako nyi, &lt;&lt;Wosefɛɛreŋ dɛɛ kyaa ɛ man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Lee Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ dekpaŋalaŋ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">maa gyae n wose kenyiŋ.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa waraŋase kewii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Me te gyina me sia tee neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">nyaŋ ŋon n kyaa gyoorogbeli dɔɔ adido.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Mena keŋ gbeŋi tobaale ne kɛɛ ɔ gbeŋgyoo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">mena keŋ gbeŋi alebu ne kɛɛ ɔ gbeŋgyoo alo siaman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">mena yaa daa mɔ ne kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo de Wurubuarɛ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">kelii debaŋ keŋ waa wii daa.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Wii de waraŋase, Degbeŋgyoo, wii de waraŋase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">nawolo nyi ba te naase daa diyem gbaa.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Baŋ be dana ba wose ne kulu daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">baŋ bee gyina ba wose na do daa desɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">yela te gbaa daa.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ ŋon Ɔ ne gyee Ɔ balaŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Na Degbeŋgyoo seŋɛɛla de wɔle ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">yela Iserae ke yako,<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />na Degbeŋgyoo seŋɛɛla de wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">debaŋ keŋ balaŋ ne yoo daa nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />nafɔ beŋ lilii daa na de sia fonɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">debaŋ keŋ bɔɔ gyeŋ baŋ de dɔɔ nideli nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />nafɔ boo kewuu deŋ waale daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">kakpela deŋ gyɔɔ daa laŋ,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />nafɔ kakpela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:5">deŋ kuu daa laŋ.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">ŋon ɔ te yele baa tao daa ya nɛ yele.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />De te nyiŋ gbɛɛ yeu ŋgba gyebu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">ŋon ɔ be nyiŋ gbɛɛ lee kɔlare kɔta man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 124:7">kɔta keŋ te tekeri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">te de nyiŋa gbɛɛ lee.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Degbeŋgyoo yɛna ŋon ɔ ne kyɔ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">ŋon yɛɛna adido na tɛɛle.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ ne gyee Ɔ balaŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Baŋ be loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ nɛ yɛɛ ŋgba Siyɔn bula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">keŋ bɔɔ tale wosi ke ya, te ka seŋɛɛ kekpaakekpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Mena keŋ bulase be kilisi Yerusalɛm nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">mena te Degbeŋgyoo kilisi ɔ balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">lee gyɛŋ kelii kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Akpanyanyaŋtena gyoorogbutu be gyae ke kyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">tɛɛle keŋ bɔɔ mo fa baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:3">na mena ya na baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">be nyiŋmaase yɛɛ dukum.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, yɛɛ deeli fa baŋ be dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">na baŋ be konɔɔse man tenɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Baŋ bɛɛ kpase mo gbɛɛneŋ kumɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">Degbeŋgyoo waa wɔlɛɛ wɔ kpuna nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Wosefɛɛreŋ dɛɛ kyaana Iserae.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kelɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Degbeŋgyoo ka besena Siyɔn see ka beneŋ man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">ke yɛɛ daa ŋgba dosɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Boŋɛɛse wulu de nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">de laakemse kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Te be yakowɔ tɛɛlese man nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo te yɛɛ abɔɔ dinaana fa wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Degbeŋgyoo te yɛɛ abɔɔ dinaana fa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">te de nyaŋeewɔ nideli.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, besena daa see da beneŋ gyoorobiiri man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">ŋgba boŋobiise ŋan kyaa ata yenaŋ depampaa man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Baŋ bɛɛ mo siasaraŋ duu abɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">baa mo kenyaŋee kɔ.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Baŋ bɛɛ mo kewii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">na ba seelena abɔɔbia be kaa duu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:6">baa bese kɔŋ na kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">na ba seelena weenɛɛ ŋan bɔɔ kɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ deeli yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Nyi Degbeŋgyoo te baŋ deni keŋ ya na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">deni maara baŋ ne yɛɛ tom bo yakaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Nyi Degbeŋgyoo te gyee donɔɔ dinaa keŋ ya na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">gyeera baŋ ne gyee bo yakaa.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Ke yɛɛ yakaa ŋgba ɛ ne karatɛɛ koro nebo nebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">na ɛ te kyaa kelii nelim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">naase ɛ wose diyem nyi ɛ ne gyae weenɛɛ ɛ kedi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo ne fa baŋ ɔ ne gyae nɛ weenɛɛ dosoroŋ man gba.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Bia yɛɛ dedii ke lee Degbeŋgyoo gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">dokyoa man bia yɛɛ kom ketɔ ke lee ɔ gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Mena keŋ baŋdaŋ nyeela doo yoonɔɔte nyiŋmaa man nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">mena te tobiiritɛɛ bia mɔ doo.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Baale ŋon ŋɔɔ wulu ɔ gbegya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">ŋonna nyeebam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:5">Nyi ŋon na ɔ kɔlara de gyaŋee gbelɛɛ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">desɛŋ be gyae ke kyaŋ e ya.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s1">Tɔnɔɔ keŋ doo Degbeŋgyoo keyee man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Baŋ pou bee yee Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">te be dɔŋ ɔ gbɛɛneŋ man nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />nyaŋ ke di n nyiŋmaa man tom tɔnɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">gyae ke de fa neŋ na n ke nyiŋ n wose.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />N wɛɛle waa yɛɛ ŋgba gerepo daŋ keŋ kɛɛ se bia nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">n dekpaŋalaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">n bia baa yɛɛ ŋgba oliifi daase ŋan ŋɔɔ potee nɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">kilisi n tebulu.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Kɛɛ, nnɛ yaa baa hiraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">walaŋ ŋon ɔ ne yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Degbeŋgyoo waa hiraa neŋ lee Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">waa yela n kena Yerusalɛm wose kenyiŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">n kekyaabii man pou.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />Waa yela n ke kyaa na n kena n naanasebia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">wosefɛɛreŋ dɛɛ kɔŋ Iserae dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane tia Iseraetena Kɔlara</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Ɛ yela Iserae ke yako nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">&lt;&lt;Be naase maŋ diyem nideli leenaŋ me tobiiritɛɛ,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />&lt;&lt;Be naase maŋ diyem nideli leenaŋ me tobiiritɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">mɔna ba te tale di me dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Wɔɔfarala te pupui me wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">te be wɔŋa ke dɔɔloŋ dɔɔloŋ ŋgba dedaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo tenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">ɔ te tirii akpanyanyaŋtena ŋmeeseŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Baŋ pou bɛɛ kɔla Siyɔn nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">baa mo desɛŋ bese be wɔle.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Baa yɛɛ ŋgba deni nyeedɔɔ ŋale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">keŋ na boto pɛte kɛɛ bee nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />ke bɛɛ wulu ŋon ɔ ne kɛrɛɛ nɛ nyiŋmaase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">yaa ŋon ɔ ne yilaa nɛ baameŋse man ya.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Baŋ bɛɛ lam botɔɔ nɛ naa yako wɔ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">&lt;&lt;Degbeŋgyoo waa hiraa ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">dee hiraa ŋon lee Degbeŋgyoo yele man&gt;&gt; ya.<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, me doo kayeyɛɛ dinaa man mee wii baake neŋ,<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyii ma woya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:2">See deŋele n ke tei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">me kewii baake.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Nyi nyaŋ Degbeŋgyoo de yako nyi n ne ŋmarase de nombiakumɛɛ see na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">Degbeŋgyoo, amɔte ne gyaela waa tale seŋ?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Mɔna nyaŋ na mo dukum kyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">na baa nyiŋ mo keyee som neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Mɛɛ kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo gbɛɛ, ma woo ne kɛɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">me loo gyakaa ɔ nombia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Mɛɛ kɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">kela mena keŋ dekere ne kɛɛ tɛɛkena gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">kela mena keŋ dekere ne kɛɛ tɛɛkena gbɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Iserae mo n loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo kegyae taŋ ɔto ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ɔ ne lɛɛ balaŋ nyee gbagba.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Ŋon gbagba ne gyaela waa lɛɛ Iserae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">lee be nombiakumɛɛ pou man.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s1">Loo kamo kegyakaa kefane dɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, me konɔɔ bɛɛ gate ka wose ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">mɔɔ ne kɛɛ ma wose gbaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">mɔɔ famenɛ na nombia dinaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">yaa nombia ŋan ŋe dana maŋ gyakoloŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Mɔna ma te yɔkɔse ma wose, te me yɛɛwɔ yididi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">me yɛɛ ŋgba biikyaa ŋon bɔɔ tira e dide te ɔ mataana ɔ naa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">na gyoo me sia ŋgba me yɛɛ biikyaa ŋon bɔɔ tira e dide nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Iserae, mo n loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">lee debaŋ kei kelii kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔsom deni keŋ yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɔɔse Dawide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">na ɔ kaale wa anaŋ laŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Ɔ kaŋa ntam fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">ɔ sɛɛ kom fa Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere ŋon nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />&lt;&lt;Mɔɔ gyae maa gyu me dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3">yaa maa doo ma dofoŋoŋ dɔɔ ya.,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />Mɔɔ gyae maa yela me sia ke wuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:4">yaa me sibii kegyɔ ya,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />kaboena maa nyiŋ dekyae fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:5">dekyae fa Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere ŋon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />De nyii ke lee Ɛferata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">de naa ke Yaare tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Ɛ yela dee gyu ɔ dekyae man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">ke buŋ som ɔ nae dɛɛbetee siaman nyiaa,<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Degbeŋgyoo koro, gyu n dɛɛfɛɛfoe keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ɛmɛɛ na n doŋ nɔɔkebakesee adakaa keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Yela n saese ka mo n katenee wuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">yela n balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare ke nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Lee n tobaale Dawide dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">naa bɛɛ n walaŋ ŋon n be tiu e nuŋ nɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Degbeŋgyoo kaŋa ntam fa Dawide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">ntam keŋ ɔ be gyae waa lee kewɔle ya nyiaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:11">&lt;&lt;N duuluŋ man walaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">te maa mo see n gyooro gbeli dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Nyi akpaa n bia tewulɛɛ de di me nɔɔkebakesee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">na kawolase ŋan maa wola wɔ dɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:12">kenaŋ na be bia tewulɛɛ baa kyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">n gyooro gbeli dɔɔ kekpaakekpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo ta lese Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">ɔ ne gyae nyi botɔɔ ke yɛɛ ɔ dekyae,<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />Ɔ kpa nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Kɛbo yɛna ma defɛɛfoe kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">kɛbo te maa kyaa di gyoori, nawolo nyi kɛbo te mɛɛ gyae.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Maa mo weenɛɛ burum hiraa e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">maa fa wa ayematena weenɛɛ baa di baa.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Maa mo nyeekelɛɛ wuu ɔ saese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">na ɔ balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ ke kpee kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Kɛbo te maa yela Dawide ke baŋ lila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">na maa desina kanea see fa ŋon mɔɔ tiu e nuŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Maa mo desɛŋ wuu ɔ kɔlara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">mɔna maa yela ɔ gyooro kotɔtɔɔ ke ŋalakee ɔ nyee dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s1">Kehiraa keŋ doo nɔɔdokoloŋ kekyaa man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Kɛɛ mena keŋ ke dei, na kyeo keŋ ke dana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">nyi Wurubuarɛ balaŋ baa kyaa nɔɔdokoloŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ke yɛɛ ŋgba nuŋ koyadoŋte keŋ bɔɔ toosi woli nyee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">te be kyɔsee woli nɔɔfata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:2">te be kyɔsee woli Aarɔn nɔɔfata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">tisi ka gyoo ɔ kegba wurikyim wɔŋe man.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ke yɛɛ ŋgba Hɛremon obosuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">ne yalala Siyɔn bula dɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:3">Nawolo nyi botɔɔ te Degbeŋgyoo ne hiraa balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">te ɔ ne fa wɔ nyeedoŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s1">Balaŋ kebaake nyi be kaa lese Wurubuarɛ yele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo tewulɛɛ pou, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ na som Degbeŋgyoo ɔ dɛɛ nelim.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Ɛ gyina ɛ nyiŋmaase adido wɔ ɔsom deni fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">na ɛ ka lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Degbeŋgyoo ŋon ɔ be yɛɛ adido na tɛɛle nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">waa hiraa ŋon lee Siyɔn.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele keŋ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">Ɛmɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo tewulɛɛ, ɛ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />Ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ na som Degbeŋgyoo dekpaŋalaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">de Wurubuarɛ ɔsom deni dinaa keŋ dekpaŋalaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele, nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ lese ɔ yele, nawolo nyi keŋ kaboela.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo ta lese Yakɔbe fa ɔ wose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">ɔ ta lese Iserae mo yɛɛ ŋon gbagba wui.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Ma gyeŋ nyi Degbeŋgyoo boe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">Degbeŋgyoo boe kela wurubuarɛse pou.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Kpene kamasɛ keŋ na gyoo Degbeŋgyoo sia nɛ, keŋ te ɔ ne yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">adido na tɛɛle dɔɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">ɛpose na ŋe siiliŋ man pou.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Ŋon ne yelela debuŋta na koro lee tɛɛle ɔto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ɔ yɛɛ ɔga keŋmaale fa ɔga keŋɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">te ɔ na lese feliŋ lee wa abɔɔ dɛɛsee man kɔŋ.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Ɔ koe Igyipite bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">denibalaŋ na wonembia bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Ɔ kpila ɔ gyakoloŋ nombia na ɔ wɔɔle dinaana kɔŋ nyaŋ Igyipite nsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">kɔŋ Faaro na ɔ tewulɛɛ pou dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Ɔ wɔlɛɛ tɛɛlese burum balaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">te ɔ koe gyooneŋ doŋ nyibaŋ,<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />ŋgba Amoritena gyoo Sihɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">na Basan gyoo Ogi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">na Kaana gyooneŋ pou.<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />te ɔ moo ke fa ɔ balaŋ Iseraetena ŋgba dedii nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">ɔ moo ke yɛɛ dedii fa ɔ balaŋ Iserae.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Degbeŋgyoo, n yele doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">Degbeŋgyoo, baa tɔɔse n yele kelɛɛ kalola kegyakaarese pou man.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo waa fa ɔ balaŋ deŋele kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">na waa wii ɔ tewulɛɛ waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Tɛɛlese bɛɛneŋ yɛɛ kɔba wolom na kɔba yayam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">denibalaŋ nyiŋmaase yɛɛna ŋa.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Be dana nɔɔse, mɔna bɔɔ ne tale kolosi ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">be dana sia, mɔna bɔɔ ne naa ya.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Be dana deŋela, mɔna bɔɔ ne nyii ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">te weesɛɛ mɔ be doo be nɔɔse man ya.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Baŋ bɔɔ yɛɛ wɔ nɛ, baa yɛɛ ŋgba baŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">mena mɔ te baŋ pou bɛɛ mo be loo gyakaa be dɔɔ nɛ baa yɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Ɛmɛɛ Iseraetena pou, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">Aarɔn dekpaŋalaŋmantena, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Lewi dekpaŋalaŋmantena, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ ne yee e, ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele lee Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">ŋon ɔ kyaa Yerusalɛm nɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21" />
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s1">Karaŋ kefa nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Ɛ fa Degbeŋgyoo karaŋ, nawolo nyi ɔ dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">Ɔ kegyae mɔ doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Ɛ fa wurubuarɛse pou Wurubuarɛ ŋon karaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Ɛ fa gbeŋgyoona pou Gbeŋgyoo ŋon karaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Ŋon waageŋ ne yɛɛna gyakoloŋ nombia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Ŋon moona ɔ nombia man kenyii yɛɛ adido.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Ŋon fɛlɛɛna tɛɛle wuu loŋse dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Ŋon yɛɛna kanease dinaana ŋan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Weese nyi waa di tɛɛkena dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />gyaalaŋ na kyolobiise dee di nelim dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Ŋon koena Igyipitetena bia gyaŋgba nyibaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Ŋon lesena Iseraetena lee be man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Ɔ nyiŋmaa keŋ ke dana doŋ, ɔ baam keŋ ɔ ba tenee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Ŋon kpasena ɛpo yayam man ala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Ɔ moo Iseraetena ta ka nsana lee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Mɔna ɔ yelaa Faaro na ɔ yoonɔɔtena dɔɔwɔ ɛpo yayam keŋ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Ŋon moona ɔ balaŋ ta depampaa keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Ŋon koena gyooneŋ dinaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Ɔ koo gyooneŋ baŋ bɔɔ lɛɛ yele.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Amoritena gyoo Sihɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />na Basan gyoo Ogi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Te ɔ moo be tɛɛle fa ŋgba dedii nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />dedii fa ɔ tobaale Iserae.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Ɔ tɔɔse daa da keyɔkɔse man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Ɔ lɛɛ daa lee de kɔlara nyiŋmaa man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Ɔ ne fa denibalaŋ na wonembia pou weenɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Ɛ fa Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ kyaa adido nɛ karaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">Ɔ kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s1">Iseraetena katoroŋ yoogbeŋiri man</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />De tisiwɔ kyaa Babilɔn booneŋ gyaŋ, te de wiiwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">debaŋ keŋ dɔɔ tɔɔse Siyɔn nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Daase ŋan seŋɛɛ botɔɔ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">te da moo da adolɛɛse wuluŋu.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Nawolo nyi botɔɔ te baŋ bɔɔ kyaŋ daa gyu yoo gbeŋiri man nɛ, bɔɔse daa nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">baŋ bɔɔ naase daa diyem nɛ bɔɔse daa kenyaŋee nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">be yako daa nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɛ kpee Siyɔn nɔɔneŋ dokoloŋ fa daa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Sena te dɛɛ tale kpee Degbeŋgyoo nɔɔneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">keŋ de kyaa ŋɔɔla tɛɛle man?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Yerusalɛm, akpaa me wolee neŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">yela me dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa na tale yɛɛ ka tom ya.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Nyi akpaa ma te tɔɔse neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">nyi akpaa ma te kɛɛ Yerusalɛm nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">ŋon yɛna ma kenyaŋee kpaakpaate ya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">yela me laakem ke wulu me nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, tɔɔse keŋ Ɛdomtena be yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">wee kenaŋ keŋ Yerusalɛm be yale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:7">be yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Ɛ tekerii ke lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">ɛ tekerii ke lɔ kelii ka mokɔɔ kasee man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Babilɔn alebu ŋon baa wɔlɛɛ neŋ korakora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ŋon waa wɔlɛɛ neŋ tɔ kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ŋgba mena keŋ n be yɛɛ daa nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Walaŋ ŋon waa lɛo n kyokyoose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">mo wɔ ŋmereena kpanaŋse nɛ, ŋonna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa karaŋ kefa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, maa mo me konɔɔ pou lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese n yele wurubuarɛse siaman.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Maa buŋ mo me sia tee nyɔ ɔsom deni dinaa fereŋkyeŋ keŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">na maa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya, na nya anokoare kedi dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">nawolo nyi n te gyina n yele na n nombia adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">kela kpene kamasɛ.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Me baake neŋ na, n kpaa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">n doo maŋ doŋ te ma seŋawɔ me nawɔɔ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, akpaa tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyooneŋ pou de nyii n nɔɔman nombia na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">baa lese n yele.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Baa kpee nɔɔneŋ lee ŋan Degbeŋgyoo be yɛɛ nɛ wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo gyoorobiiri boe nideli.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Doo nyi Degbeŋgyoo kyaa adido adido koraŋ nɛ, ɔ ne kɛɛ baŋ bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">mɔna ɔ ne naa baŋ bɛɛ gate ba wose nɛ lee lemlem.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Nyi me dɔŋ wose kekyaŋ man koraŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">n ne gyee ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:7">n na tenee n nyiŋmaa me kɔlara baŋ bɛɛ gyeŋ baŋ do maŋ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">n na mo n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa lɛɛ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Degbeŋgyoo waa yɛɛ keŋ ɔ be yakosee lee ma wose man nɛ fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">Degbeŋgyoo, n kegyae doo kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">naa bɛɛ n nyiŋmaa man tomse ŋan ya.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ kagyeŋ na walaŋ dɔɔ kekɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, n te kɛo me man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">te n gyeŋ maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />N gyeŋ me ke tisi kyaa na me ka koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">n kyaa lemlem koraŋ na, n gyeŋ ma nyeempɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />N na gyene me ka lee, na me ke tisi doo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">n gyeŋ me gbɛɛneŋ keta man pou.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, pɛ nombii ka lee me nɔɔman nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">na nyaŋ wulaa n gyeŋ ke pou.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />N te kilisi maŋ me siaman na me wɔle pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">te n moo n nyiŋmaa doŋte keŋ gyakaa me dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Mena nombia kagyeŋ kei dana maŋ gyakoloŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">ke dana yuŋ keŋ mɔɔ tale nyii ke man ya.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Aleŋ yaa maa lee n feliŋ ŋon gyaŋ gyu?&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">Aleŋ yaa maa yeu lee n siaman gyu?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Nyi akpaa ma gyem gyu adido na, n kyaa botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">nyi akpaa me lɔ ma dofoŋoŋ woyadɛɛ koraŋ na. n kyaa botɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Nyi akpaa me karatɛɛ nebo nebo furufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">gyu ke kyaa ɛpo ɔto koraŋ na,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />n nyiŋmaa gyae ke sila maŋ gyu botɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">n dunoluŋ nyiŋmaa gyae ke kyaŋ maŋ keŋkeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Akpaa me yako nyi, &lt;&lt;Detiŋtɛɛ gyae ka weese maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">te keŋmaŋee da bese nelim kilisi maŋ nɛ,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />detiŋtɛɛ kenaŋ koraŋ be gyae ke yɛɛ detiŋtɛɛ fa neŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">nelim kenaŋ gyae ke ŋmaŋee ŋgba tɛɛkena nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">nawolo nyi detiŋtɛɛ yɛɛ ŋgba keŋmaŋee nɛ fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛɛna ma wose man abɔɔ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">nyaŋ maana maŋ me naa tɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Mɛɛ lese n yele nawolo nyi n yɛɛ maŋ bo keyee na gyakoloŋ gbɛɛ man.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">N tomse dana gyakoloŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">te ma gyeŋ ke nideli.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Debaŋ keŋ bɔɔ yɛɛ maŋ daweesee man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">te bɔɔ yilaa maŋ me naa tɔɔman nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">na me ŋɔɔ ba weesɛɛ neŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />N sia naa maŋ pɛte ma bese walaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ba te ŋmarase ma weeya ŋan maa di pou do n tɔne man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">pɛte ŋe man dokoloŋ gba kɔŋawɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Wurubuarɛ, n nyeempɔ na lee koya fa maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">ŋolo na ŋolo be tale kala ŋa ya.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Nyi me yako maa kala ŋa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ŋe gyae ka bo kela aŋasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">nyi me fom na, me sɛɛ me kyaa n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Wurubuarɛ, ma kegyae yɛna nya ko akpanyanyaŋtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">ɛ lee me gyaŋ ɛmɛɛ baŋ ɛ na koe balaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Bee kolosi nombia kumɛɛ lee n wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">n kɔlara na mo n yele yɛɛ nombiakumɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Degbeŋgyoo, mɔɔ ne kɔla baŋ bɛɛ kɔla neŋ yee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">baŋ bɛɛ seŋ tia neŋ nɛ nombia bɛɛ yɛɛ maŋ duwaare yee?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Mɛɛ kɔla wɔ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">mɛɛ kɛɛ wɔ nyi be yɛɛ me kɔlarawɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Wurubuarɛ, kɛo me man na n ka gyeŋ me konɔɔ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">kɛɛse maŋ kɛɛ, na n ka gyeŋ ma nyeempɔ man.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Kɛɛ nyi mberem nombiikum daale doo me man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">na n ka mo maŋ ta gbɛɛ keŋ doo kekpaakekpaa nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kegyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, lɛɛ maŋ lee balaŋ kumɛɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">gyee maŋ lee nyeeman doŋtena nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Bɛɛ gyueŋ nombiakumɛɛ be konɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">wee kamasɛ na bɛɛ gyae nyi yoo dɛɛ yala.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Bɛɛ sara be laakemse ŋgba doma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">be nɔɔwoya yɛɛ ŋgba wurale teekum nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Degbeŋgyoo, lɛɛ maŋ lee akpanyanyaŋtena nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">gyee maŋ lee nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">baŋ bɛɛ gyae baa do maŋ kenaŋtere lɔ nɛ nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Agaŋtaŋtena te nyɔɔ maŋ kɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">ba te fɛlɛɛ ba asawuse lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">te be nyɔɔ maŋ kɔtase me gbɛɛneŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Me yako Degbeŋgyoo nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">Degbeŋgyoo, nyii me kewii baake.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee, me lɛɛre doŋte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">n wuu ma nyee yoo wee keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Degbeŋgyoo, naa yele akpanyanyaŋtena ke nyiŋ keŋ bɛɛ gyae ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">naa yele ŋan bɛɛ bake nɛ ke de fa wɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Baŋ bɔɔ kilisi maŋ nɛ ne gate ba nyeeya agaŋtaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">yela be nɔɔwoya kumɛɛ ke busaana wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Yela nyewalaŋ ŋɛɛ ke yala be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">yela baa fuŋ wɔ do boalaŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">do bɔɔ kyilimkyilim keŋ bɔɔ tale lee ya nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Naa yele baŋ bɛɛ mo nombia gyakaa balaŋ dɔɔ nɛ ke baŋ lila tɛɛle dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">yela nombiikum ke yala balaŋ kumɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Ma gyeŋ nyi Degbeŋgyoo ne di nombia kegbɛɛ dɔɔ fa ayematena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">ɔ ne di nombia na kegbɛɛ fa baŋ bɔɔ dana kolo ya.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Ampaŋ baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ baa lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">na baŋ ba tenɛɛ nɛ ke kyaa n siaman.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s1">Balinɔɔ kefane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, mɛɛ baake neŋ, yɛɛ bileŋ kɔŋ me gyaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">akpaa me baake neŋ na nyii maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Yela ma kefane kelii n siaman ŋgba oliifi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">nyi me gyina me nyiŋmaase na, dɛɛ yɛɛ ŋgba balinɔɔ kedeesa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, do me nɔɔ dokɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">na n ke gyee me nɔɔsebia.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Naa yele me konɔɔ ke gyu dukum keyɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">na maa yɛɛ akpanyanyaŋ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:4">mo kpuna nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">naa yele maa di be weenɛɛ gyoŋ nyiŋan ŋan ya.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Nyi walaŋ ŋon ɔ tenɛɛ de gyɔ maŋ na, ke yɛɛ deeli te ɔ yɛɛwɔ fa maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">nyi ɔ kalena maŋ na, ke yɛɛ nuŋ te ɔ kyɛɛkeewɔ woli ma nyee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:5">Ma nyee be gyae ke bɛɛ ke ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">nawolo nyi ma kefane gyae ke tia nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra ayɛɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Baa fuŋ be kegyiise lee bula nyeedɔɔ kaa lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">na akpanyanyaŋtena ka gyeŋ nyi me nɔɔwoya yɛɛ anokoare.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Baa yako nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Mena keŋ bɛɛ fara tɛɛle purikii ke nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">mena te be yelaa de ŋɔɔ yaaseewɔ yebɔɔ nɔɔman.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Mɔna Degbeŋgyoo Doŋ Pou Nyee, me sia gyakaa n dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">nyaŋ te mee yeu kaagyoo, naa yele maa yeŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Gyee maŋ lee kɔtase ŋan nombiakumɛɛ yɛɛra be nyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">lee kɔtase ŋan bɔɔ nyɔɔ maŋ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Yela akpanyanyaŋtena ka gyoo baŋ gbagba kɔtase man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">na maŋ ke gbaa ŋa laŋ wosefɛɛreŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s1">Dawide kefane fa kekyɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Me lɔɔ nɔɔ keŋkeŋ baake Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">me gyinaa ma woya baake Degbeŋgyoo nyi waa wii me waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Ma moo me nombia ŋan ne takaa maŋ see ɔ siaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">me yako ma wose kekyaŋ nombia ɔ siaman.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Nyi ma wose de tekerii maŋ na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">nyaŋ ne kɛɛna ma keta man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:3">Ba te nyɔɔ maŋ kɔtase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">gbɛɛneŋ ŋan dɔɔ me dɔŋ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Kɛɛ na n kena nyi ŋolo be kyaa me dunoluŋ dɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ŋolo be famenɛna maŋ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:4">Mɔɔ dana keyeu kagyoo ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">ŋolo be famenɛna ma nyeedoŋ ya.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, mee wii baake neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">me yakowɔ nyiaa, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ yɛna ma keyeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">me wui dedii deni balaŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Nyii me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">nawolo nyi ma wose te kyaŋ maŋ nideli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:6">lɛɛ maŋ lee baŋ bee gegi maŋ nɛ nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">nawolo nyi be dana doŋ nideli kela maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Lese maŋ lee me kaale man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">na maa nyiŋ lese n yele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Kenaŋ na baŋ ba tenɛɛ baa yilaa kilisi maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">lee n deeli keŋ n be yɛɛ fa maŋ nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s1">Kefane fa kekyɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">143:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawide nɔɔneŋ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Degbeŋgyoo, nyii ma kefane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">tei me kewii baake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:1">lee nya anokoare kedi, na n katenee dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">kpa maŋ.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Naa bu n tobaale fɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">nawolo nyi ŋolo be kyaa keŋ ɔ tenɛɛ n siaman ya.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Kɔlare ŋon te kuu gyakaa me dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">ɔ te gyɔ maŋ lɔ tɛɛle man kpaaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:3">ɔ te yele me doo detiŋtɛɛ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">ŋgba baŋ bɔɔ wulaa yekee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Mena dɔɔ ma wose te yɔkɔse maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">te yele ma te yala koyololo.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Mɛɛ tɔɔse gyaŋgba gyaŋgba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">mɛɛ gyoo n tomse ŋan pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">mɛɛ gyoo n nyiŋmaa man tomse pou man.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Me te gyina me nyiŋmaase tee neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">n ne gyɔ maŋ loo ŋgba tɛɛle dowolosa ne kɛɛna ɔga gbɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Degbeŋgyoo, kpa maŋ bileŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ma wose te kyaŋ maŋ nideli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:7">Naa mo n sia weese maŋ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">na mena ya na, maa yɛɛ ŋgba baŋ bɔɔ tisi gyoo yebɔɔ man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Tɔɔse maŋ lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya nɛ nombia nebo kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">nawolo nyi me ta mo ma wose lɔ n dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Wola maŋ gbɛɛ keŋ maa mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">nawolo nyi me ta mo ma nyeedoŋ do n nyiŋmaa man.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Degbeŋgyoo, lɛɛ maŋ lee me kɔlara nyiŋmaa man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">nawolo nyi me ta mo ma wose kaa weese n gyaŋ.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Wola maŋ maa yɛɛ n kegyaebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">nawolo nyi nyaŋ yɛna me Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:10">yela n feliŋ kpaakpaa ŋon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">ka mo maŋ ta tɛɛle tatarataa dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Degbeŋgyoo, lee n yele dɔɔ lɛɛ ma nyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">lee n katenee dɔɔ, lese maŋ lee ma wose kekyaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Lee n kegyae keŋ taŋ ɔto ya dɔɔ, lese me kɔlara pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">munu baŋ pou bɛɛ kɔla maŋ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">nawolo nyi me yɛɛ n tobaale e.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s1">Gyoo faa Wurubuarɛ karaŋ lee keyoodi man<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">144:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawide nɔɔneŋ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo me kpanaŋ ŋon yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">ɔ ne desina maŋ fa yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">ɔ na wola maŋ mena keŋ maa yoo.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Ŋon yɛna Wurubuarɛ ŋon ɔ ne gyae maŋ, na ma dekagya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ma dekagya ŋon ɔ ne gyee maŋ na me lɛɛre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">me yoo nyeele pampasaŋ ŋon mee yeu kagyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ŋon ɔ ne yɔkɔse tɛɛlese do me tɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Degbeŋgyoo, balaŋ yɛna bomɔ te n ne kɛɛ be dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">denibalaŋ yakaa keŋ n na gyueŋ be dɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Be yɛɛ ŋgba weesɛɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">ba weeya yɛɛ ŋgba wɔŋtaa keŋ ne lam nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Degbeŋgyoo, bɛɛse adido man na n ke tisi kɔŋ tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">tina bulase ŋan, na ŋe ka lee nyɔɔse.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Yela ɔga keŋmaale ke yaasee kɔlara baŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">tɔ n baŋdaŋ nyeela na n ke yaasee wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Tenee n nyiŋmaa lee adido kɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">lese maŋ na n ke lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:7">lee booneŋ dinaana man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">lee ŋɔɔla nyiŋmaase man.<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />Akɛrɛɛ te wulu be nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">be dunoluŋ nyiŋmaase na beo.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Me Wurubuarɛ, maa kpee nɔɔneŋ wɔle fa neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">maa mo adolɛɛ ŋmeeseŋ kufute kpee nɔɔneŋ fa neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />Fa nyaŋ ŋon n ne yele gyooneŋ ne yoodi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">nyaŋ lɛɛna n tobaale Dawide.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 144:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:10">Lee yoosila kum nɔɔman. <verse eid="PSA 144:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />lɛɛ maŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">lese maŋ lee ŋɔɔla nyiŋmaase man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:11">akɛrɛɛ te wulu be nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">be dunoluŋ nyiŋmaase na beo.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Kenaŋ na de bia tewulɛɛ tobiiritɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">gyae ke yɛɛ ŋgba daase ŋan ba bee nideli nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:12">na de bia alebia ke yɛɛ ŋgba piilase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">ŋan bɔɔ yae baa mo desina gyooro dekpaŋalaŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Weenɛɛ kpookpoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">gyae ke wulu de kpeese man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:13">De namense baa lolee kakpoŋse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">na baa wuku kakpoŋ kakpoŋse de tɛɛle dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />De nunkyuese baa lolee burum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:14">bɔɔ gyae baa lese tɔɔ ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">bɔɔ kyaŋ daa yoogbeŋa bela ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">bɔɔ gyae baa nyii waraŋsa kewii da abɔnterese man ya.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Balaŋ baŋ kei de kɔŋ mena fa wɔ na, baŋna nyeebam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">baŋ be Wurubuarɛ yɛna Degbeŋgyoo nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Me Wurubuarɛ na me Gyoo, maa gyina neŋ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">maa lese n yele kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Maa lese n yele wee kamasɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">na maa kɛlɛɛ neŋ kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Degbeŋgyoo kerɛɛ te ɔ kaboena nyi baa lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">ŋolo be tale gyeŋ wɔ ɔkeereŋ man ya.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Kalola kegyakaare daale ne kɛlɛɛ n tomse fa kalola kegyakaare wɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">bɛɛ gyɔ n nombia dinaana ŋan n be yɛɛ nɛ dekpeŋkpeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Bee kolosi lee nyɔ obuo na n gyoorobiiri wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">te maŋ maa gyoo n gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan n ne yɛɛ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Bee kolosi lee n gyakoloŋ nombia ŋan n ne yɛɛ nɛ wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">te maŋ maa gyɔ n tomse dinaana ŋan dekpeŋkpeŋ.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Bee kolosi lee n deeli burum keyɛɛ wose man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">te bɛɛ nyaŋee kpee n katenee nɔɔneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Degbeŋgyoo na boele balaŋ te ɔ ne wii wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">ɔ bɛɛ gyeŋ baŋ bileŋbileŋ ya, te ɔ dana wɔe nideli.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Degbeŋgyoo dei fa balaŋ pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">ɔ ne wii abɔɔ wa ayɛŋ pou waraŋase.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Degbeŋgyoo, abɔɔ nya ayɛŋ pou na lese n yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">n balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ pou baa kɛlɛɛ neŋ.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Bɛɛ yako gyoorobiiri keŋ doo n gyooridedii wose man nɛ nombia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">te bee kolosi lee n doŋ wose man,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />na balaŋ pou kenyiŋ gyeŋ abɔɔ dinaana ŋan n ne yɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">na n gyooridedii gyoorobiiri kyeote keŋ.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />N gyooridedii yɛɛ gyooridedii kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">te n gyoorikedi gyae kedoo fa kalola kegyakaarese pou.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:13">Degbeŋgyoo ne di anokoare ɔ keyakosee pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">te ɔ ne di anokoare ŋan pou ɔ ne yɛɛ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Degbeŋgyoo ne lɔɔ kyaŋ baŋ pou bɛɛ yale nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">te ɔ ne gyina baŋ pou bɔɔ yɔkɔse wɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Sia pou ne kɛɛ neŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">te n ne fa wɔ be weenɛɛ ka debaŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />N ne gyuusu n nyiŋmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">te n ne yele baŋ pou be kyaa nyeedoŋ man nɛ ne nyiŋ keŋ bɛɛ gyae.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Degbeŋgyoo tenɛɛ ɔ gbɛɛneŋ pou man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">te ɔ ne di anokoare ŋan pou ɔ ne yɛɛ nɛ man.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Degbeŋgyoo benaana baŋ pou bɛɛ baake e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">baŋ pou bɛɛ baake e anokoare man nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Ɔ ne yɛɛ baŋ bee yee e nɛ kegyaebii fa wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">ɔ ne nyii be kewii na ɔ te lɛɛ ba nyee.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Degbeŋgyoo sia gyakaa baŋ pou bɛɛ gyae e nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">mɔna waa wɔlɛɛ akpanyanyaŋtena pou.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Maa gyuusu me nɔɔ kolosi lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">Baŋ pou ɔ be yɛɛ wɔ nɛ baa lese ɔ yele fereŋkyeŋ keŋ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ nyeelɛɛre yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:1">Ma woo, lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Ma kekyaa man pou maa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">Me nyiŋaa me kyaa nɛ, maa kpee nɔɔneŋ lese me Wurubuarɛ yele.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Ɛ naa mo ɛ wose lɔ gyoorobia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">yaa denibalaŋ baŋ bɔɔ tale lɛɛ walaŋ nyee ya nɛ dɔɔ ya.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Akpaa be kara weesi na, bɛɛ bese gyoo tɛɛle man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">mena wee kenaŋ na, ŋan pou bɔɔ bake nyi baa yɛɛ nɛ te kɔŋ ɔto.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Baŋ Yakɔbe Wurubuarɛ ne kyɔ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">baŋ be loo gyakaa Degbeŋgyoo be Wurubuarɛ dɔɔ nɛ, baŋna nyeebam.<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Ŋon yɛɛna adido na tɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">ɛpo na abɔɔ ŋan pou doo ŋe man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">wa anokoare kedi doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Ɔ ne di nombia fa baŋ bɔɔ ŋere wɔ do nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">ɔ ne fa baŋ tanam na ko wɔ nɛ weenɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:7">Degbeŋgyoo na lese baŋ bɔɔ kyaŋ tɔ deni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Degbeŋgyoo ne gyuusu siayɛlɛɛsatena sia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:8">Degbeŋgyoo ne gyina baŋ bɔɔ yɔkɔse wɔ nɛ adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">Degbeŋgyoo ne gyae baŋ ba tenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Degbeŋgyoo sia gyakaa ŋɔɔla dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">ɔ ne kɛɛ yoyolobia na liala dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">mɔna ɔ ne wɔlɛɛ akpanyanyaŋtena gbɛɛneŋ.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Degbeŋgyoo ne di gyoori kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">Ao Siyɔn, n Wurubuarɛ ne di gyoori kalola kegyakaarese pou dɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubuarɛ Dekpataakpere ŋon yele kalese</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:1">Dei nyi dee kpee yele kalese nɔɔneŋ fa de Wurubuarɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">ke dei te kaboena nyi dɛɛ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Degbeŋgyoo ne baŋ Yerusalɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ɔ ne yilaa Iseraetena yoogbeŋa baŋ.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Ɔ ne kyɔ baŋ nombia ne takaa wɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">na ɔ te bake be gyamɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Ɔ na wola kyolobiise yaanɔɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">te ɔ doo be popou yela.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Degbeŋgyoo kerɛɛ te ɔ doŋ dokoso be kyaa ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">ɔ nombia man kenyii be taŋ ɔto ya.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Degbeŋgyoo ne gyina baŋ bɔɔ yɔkɔse wɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">mɔna ɔ ne fuŋ akpanyanyaŋtena lɔ tɛɛle man.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Ɛ kpee karaŋ kefa nɔɔneŋ fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">ɛ mo adolɛɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa de Wurubuarɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Ŋon moona debuŋta wuu ŋɔma dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">ɔ ne yele ɔga ne ŋɛɛ woli tɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">ɔ ne yele ŋalese ne tuu bulasebia dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Ɔ ne fa wonembia weenɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">ɔ ne fa kwaakwaadabi bia baŋ bee wii nɛ weenɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Dɛɛkyɔŋ doŋ bɛɛ gyoo ɔ sia ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">yoote nawɔɔ ɔsaa bɛɛ gyoo ɔ sia ya.<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Mɔna baŋ bee yee Degbeŋgyoo nɛ nombia na gyoona ɔ sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">baŋ bɛɛ mo be loo gyakaa ɔ kegyae kekpaakekpaa keŋ dɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Yerusalɛm, kɛlɛɛ Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">Siyɔn, lese n Wurubuarɛ yele.<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Ɔ ne yele n denaanɔɔ nyeela ne yɛɛ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">ɔ ne hiraa n balaŋ baŋ be doo n man.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Ɔ ne yele wosefɛɛreŋ ne kyaa n wuluse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">ɔ na mo aboŋ kpaakpaa fa neŋ n ne dii baa.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Ɔ ne kpila ɔ nɔɔwoya kɔŋ tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">ɔ nombia dana ɔsaa.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Ɔ ne fɛlɛɛ senoo ŋgba dukurufa mpuu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">na ɔ te ŋmatee obosuo ŋgba tɔŋ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Ɔ ne fuŋii wa akpeleŋkpeleŋbia lɔ ŋgba boyabia nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">Amɔte ne gyaela waa tale seŋ ɔ waare man?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Ɔ kpila ɔ nombia kaa yalakee ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">ɔ ne yele ɔ feliŋ ne gyɔɔ na loŋse te waale.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Ɔ ta lese ɔ nombia wola Yakɔbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">wɔ mmaraase na ɔ kawolase wola Iserae.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Ɔ te yɛɛ kei fa tɛɛlese ŋaale ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">bɔɔ gyeŋ wɔ mmaraase ya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s1">Tɛɛlese pou be kaa lese Wurubuarɛ yele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:1">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele lee adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">ɛ lese ɔ yele lee adido adido.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Ɛmɛɛ ɔ kpilara pou ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">ɛmɛɛ wa adidotena pou ɛ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Weese na gyaalaŋ, ɛ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">ɛmɛɛ kyolobiise ŋan ɛ ne ŋalakee pou ɛ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Ɛmɛɛ adido adidotena pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">na ɛmɛɛ loŋse ŋan pou gyakaa ŋɔma dɔɔ, ɛ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Ɛ yela baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele keŋ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">nawolo nyi ŋon faela do te ŋe yɛɛwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Ŋon seena ŋa mokɔɔ kekpaakekpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">ŋon seena kawola keŋ doo kekpaakekpaa.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele lee tɛɛle dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">ɛmɛɛ ɛpo man wonembia dinaana, na baŋ be doo ɛpo tɔɔman,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />ɔga keŋmaale na akpeleŋkpeleŋbia na senoo na debuŋta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">na koloŋoloŋ keŋ ne yɛɛ ɔ kegyaebii.<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />Ɛmɛɛ bulase na bulasebia pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">daase ŋan na se bia na sida daase pou,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />ŋale man wonembia na nunkyuese pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">wonembia buruburu na gyebuse,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />tɛɛle kei dɔɔ gyooneŋ na tɛɛlese pou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">ɛmɛɛ gyoorobia na tɛɛle kei dɔɔ kyaarabia pou,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />alebia na tewulɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">bia na kegyiise.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Ɛ yela baa lese Degbeŋgyoo yele keŋ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">nawolo nyi ɔ yele kaageŋ te bee gyina adido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ɔ gyoorobiiri kela tɛɛle na adido pou.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Ɔ te yele ɔ balaŋ te yɛɛ doŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">na ɔ tewulɛɛ baŋ pou bee di anokoare nɛ ka lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">Iserae ɔ balaŋ baŋ be doo ɔ konɔɔ man.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s1">Yele kalese nɔɔneŋ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:1">Ɛ kpee nɔɔneŋ wɔle fa Degbeŋgyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">ɛ lese ɔ yele ɔ balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ degyaŋee man.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Ɛ yela Iserae kenyaŋee lee ɔ yɛɛre dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ɛ yela ke yɛɛ Siyɔntena gyoŋ lee be gyoo dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Ɛ yela baa mo sɔɔre lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">na baa mo akyakaa na adolɛɛ kegyɔ kpee nɔɔneŋ fa e.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Nawolo nyi Degbeŋgyoo balaŋ na gyoo ɔ sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">ɔ na mo keyoodi wuu baŋ bɛɛ yɔkɔse ba wose nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Ɛ yela ɔ balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ ke nyaŋee lee obuo kei dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">na baa nyaŋee kpee nɔɔneŋ ba afoŋoŋse dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Ɛ yela Wurubuarɛ yele kalese ke doo be nɔɔse man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">na yoosila sia na wɔle ke doo be nyiŋmaase man,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />nyi baa tɔ tɛɛlese kom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">na baa wɔŋ balaŋ baŋ deŋele,<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />na baa mo nyeela akyakaase bake be gyooneŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">na baa do gyoorobia nyeela anewaŋterese.<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />Baa mo nombia ŋan bɔɔ ŋmarase tia wɔ nɛ wɔŋ ba deŋele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">kei yɛna ɔ balaŋ baŋ bee di anokoare nɛ gyoorobiiri.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1" />
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">Ɛ lese Wurubuarɛ yele ɔ dekyae fereŋkyeŋ keŋ man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">ɛ lese ɔ yele wa adido dekpataakpere keŋ man.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Ɛ lese ɔ yele lee keŋ ɔ na mo ɔ doŋ yɛɛ nɛ dɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">ɛ lese ɔ yele lee ɔ nombia dinaana ŋan ŋa dokoso be kyaa ya nɛ dɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Ɛ mo kaberɛ kewii lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">ɛ mo adolɛɛ na akyakaase lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Ɛ mo akyakaa na sɔɔre lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">ɛ mo adolɛɛ na kefereese lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Ɛ mo akpaakpaase kegyɔ lese ɔ yele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">ɛ mo akpaakpaase kegyɔ keŋkeŋ lese ɔ yele.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Kpene kamasɛ keŋ weesɛɛ doo ke man nɛ dɛɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">Ɛ lese Degbeŋgyoo yele.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>